  {"name_ja":"フラッタ解析","name_en":"Flutter Analysis","definition":"流体力と構造振動がエネルギーを交換して振幅が発散する不安定現象を予測し、飛行包線内での安全余裕を評価する解析。","impact_summary":"航空機、タービン、ロケット構造の破壊的振動を防ぐ基盤になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"空力弾性安定性","era_start":1916,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"フラッタ,動的不安定,飛行包線,振動","keywords_en":"flutter,dynamic instability,flight envelope,vibration","key_researchers":["Arthur Collar","Theodore Theodorsen"],"key_works":["General Theory of Aerodynamic Instability and the Mechanism of Flutter (1935)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ガスト応答","name_en":"Gust Response","definition":"突風や大気乱流によって航空機構造と飛行姿勢が受ける過渡荷重、加速度、疲労影響を評価する飛行荷重解析概念。","impact_summary":"構造強度基準、乗り心地、飛行制御設計に直接反映された。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"飛行荷重解析","era_start":1930,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"突風,荷重,疲労,大気乱流","keywords_en":"gust,load,fatigue,atmospheric turbulence","key_researchers":["Theodore von Karman","Norman Dryden"],"key_works":["Statistical Theory of Turbulence (1948)"]},
  {"name_ja":"飛行力学","name_en":"Flight Dynamics","definition":"航空機や宇宙機の運動を剛体力学、空力、推進、制御入力で表し、安定性、操縦性、軌道を解析する基礎分野。","impact_summary":"操縦設計、自動操縦、飛行試験、シミュレータの共通基盤になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"運動力学","era_start":1900,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"飛行力学,安定性,操縦性,剛体運動","keywords_en":"flight dynamics,stability,control,rigid-body motion","key_researchers":["George Bryan","Bernard Etkin"],"key_works":["Stability in Aviation (1911)"]},
  {"name_ja":"縦安定理論","name_en":"Longitudinal Stability Theory","definition":"ピッチ角、迎角、速度、高度の摂動運動を扱い、短周期モードやフゴイドを通じて航空機の縦方向安定性を評価する理論。","impact_summary":"尾翼容積、重心範囲、自動操縦設計の基礎を形成した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"飛行安定性","era_start":1910,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"縦安定,短周期,フゴイド,尾翼","keywords_en":"longitudinal stability,short period,phugoid,tailplane","key_researchers":["George Bryan","Frederick Lanchester"],"key_works":["Stability in Aviation (1911)"]},
  {"name_ja":"横・方向安定理論","name_en":"Lateral-Directional Stability Theory","definition":"ロール、ヨー、横滑りの連成運動を扱い、ダッチロール、スパイラル、ロール収束などの固有モードを解析する飛行安定理論。","impact_summary":"垂直尾翼、上反角、ヨーダンパ、飛行制御則の設計を支えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"飛行安定性","era_start":1910,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"横安定,方向安定,ダッチロール,上反角","keywords_en":"lateral stability,directional stability,Dutch roll,dihedral","key_researchers":["George Bryan","Bernard Etkin"],"key_works":["Dynamics of Flight (1959)"]},
  {"name_ja":"フゴイド運動","name_en":"Phugoid Motion","definition":"航空機が速度と高度を交換しながら長周期で振動する縦運動モードで、減衰性や操縦介入の必要性を評価する安定性概念。","impact_summary":"飛行試験と操縦性評価で縦運動理解の基本例になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"飛行安定性","era_start":1908,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"フゴイド,長周期,縦運動,エネルギー交換","keywords_en":"phugoid,long period,longitudinal motion,energy exchange","key_researchers":["Frederick Lanchester"],"key_works":["Aerodonetics (1908)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ダッチロール","name_en":"Dutch Roll","definition":"横滑り、ロール、ヨーが連成して蛇行する横・方向振動モードで、後退翼機や高高度機の乗り心地と安全性に関わる。","impact_summary":"ヨーダンパと方向安定設計の重要性を明確にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"飛行安定性","era_start":1930,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ダッチロール,ヨー,ロール,ヨーダンパ","keywords_en":"Dutch roll,yaw,roll,yaw damper","key_researchers":["Bernard Etkin"],"key_works":["Dynamics of Flight (1959)"]},
  {"name_ja":"フライ・バイ・ワイヤ","name_en":"Fly-by-Wire","definition":"操縦入力を機械リンクではなく電気信号として伝え、コンピュータが安定性補償、制限保護、操縦則を実行する飛行制御概念。","impact_summary":"不安定機体や高効率形状を実用化し、操縦安全性を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"デジタル飛行制御","era_start":1972,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"電子制御,操縦則,安定性補償,制限保護","keywords_en":"fly-by-wire,control law,stability augmentation,envelope protection","key_researchers":["NASA Dryden researchers"],"key_works":["Digital Fly-By-Wire Flight Control System (1972)"]},
  {"name_ja":"適応飛行制御","name_en":"Adaptive Flight Control","definition":"機体特性や環境の変化、損傷、モデル誤差に応じて制御器パラメータをオンラインで調整し、性能と安定性を保つ制御理論。","impact_summary":"無人機、再構成制御、損傷許容飛行の研究を進めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"ロバスト・適応制御","era_start":1958,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"適応制御,損傷許容,モデル誤差,再構成","keywords_en":"adaptive control,damage tolerance,model uncertainty,reconfiguration","key_researchers":["Karl Astrom","NASA researchers"],"key_works":["Adaptive Control (1989)"]},
  {"name_ja":"モデル予測制御","name_en":"Model Predictive Control","definition":"将来の機体運動をモデルで予測し、制約条件を満たす最適入力を逐次計算する制御手法で、航空機と宇宙機の軌道制御に使われる。","impact_summary":"制約付き誘導、着陸、編隊飛行、自律制御の精密化に貢献した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"最適制御","era_start":1978,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"モデル予測制御,制約,最適化,誘導","keywords_en":"model predictive control,constraints,optimization,guidance","key_researchers":["Jacques Richalet","Manfred Morari"],"key_works":["Model Predictive Control: Theory and Design (2009)"]},
  {"name_ja":"H∞制御","name_en":"H-infinity Control","definition":"外乱から出力への最悪ゲインを抑えることで、モデル不確かさや外乱に対して安定性と性能を保証するロバスト制御理論。","impact_summary":"柔軟構造物、飛行制御、宇宙機姿勢制御の信頼性向上に寄与した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"ロバスト制御","era_start":1981,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ロバスト制御,H∞,外乱,不確かさ","keywords_en":"robust control,H-infinity,disturbance,uncertainty","key_researchers":["George Zames","John Doyle"],"key_works":["Feedback and Optimal Sensitivity (1981)"]},
  {"name_ja":"カルマンフィルタ","name_en":"Kalman Filter","definition":"線形動的システムの状態を、モデル予測と雑音を含む観測から最小分散で逐次推定する航法・誘導・制御の基礎アルゴリズム。","impact_summary":"アポロ誘導から現代UAV航法まで、状態推定の標準技術になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"推定理論","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"状態推定,航法,センサ融合,雑音","keywords_en":"state estimation,navigation,sensor fusion,noise","key_researchers":["Rudolf Kalman"],"key_works":["A New Approach to Linear Filtering and Prediction Problems (1960)"]},
  {"name_ja":"拡張カルマンフィルタ","name_en":"Extended Kalman Filter","definition":"非線形運動方程式を局所線形化し、宇宙機姿勢、軌道決定、慣性航法などの状態を逐次推定する実用的推定手法。","impact_summary":"非線形航法問題でリアルタイム推定を可能にし、探査機運用を支えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"非線形推定","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"非線形推定,局所線形化,軌道決定,姿勢推定","keywords_en":"nonlinear estimation,linearization,orbit determination,attitude estimation","key_researchers":["Stanley Schmidt","Rudolf Kalman"],"key_works":["Application of State-Space Methods to Navigation Problems (1966)"]},
  {"name_ja":"粒子フィルタ","name_en":"Particle Filter","definition":"状態分布を多数のサンプルで表し、非線形・非ガウスな航法、目標追跡、故障診断問題を逐次ベイズ推定で扱う手法。","impact_summary":"複雑な自律航法とロバストな宇宙機状態推定の選択肢を広げた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"ベイズ推定","era_start":1993,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"粒子フィルタ,ベイズ推定,非ガウス,追跡","keywords_en":"particle filter,Bayesian estimation,non-Gaussian,tracking","key_researchers":["Neil Gordon","D. Salmond","A. Smith"],"key_works":["Novel Approach to Nonlinear/Non-Gaussian Bayesian State Estimation (1993)"]},
  {"name_ja":"慣性航法","name_en":"Inertial Navigation","definition":"加速度計とジャイロの測定を積分して、外部電波に頼らず機体の姿勢、速度、位置を推定する自律航法概念。","impact_summary":"航空機、ミサイル、宇宙機、潜航機の独立航法能力を実現した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航法工学","era_start":1942,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"慣性航法,ジャイロ,加速度計,自律航法","keywords_en":"inertial navigation,gyro,accelerometer,autonomous navigation","key_researchers":["Charles Stark Draper"],"key_works":["Inertial Guidance (1960)"]},
  {"name_ja":"GNSS航法","name_en":"GNSS Navigation","definition":"複数の測位衛星からの信号到達時間を用い、航空機や宇宙機の位置、速度、時刻を高精度に決定する衛星航法方式。","impact_summary":"航空交通管理、精密進入、無人機運用、宇宙機測位を変革した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"衛星航法","era_start":1978,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"GNSS,GPS,測位,時刻同期","keywords_en":"GNSS,GPS,positioning,timing","key_researchers":["Bradford Parkinson","Ivan Getting"],"key_works":["Global Positioning System: Theory and Applications (1996)"]},
  {"name_ja":"天文航法","name_en":"Celestial Navigation","definition":"恒星、太陽、惑星の観測方向と時刻を用いて機体や宇宙機の姿勢・位置を推定する航法で、深宇宙で特に重要となる。","impact_summary":"電波支援が乏しい長距離飛行と深宇宙探査の自律性を支えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"天測航法","era_start":1910,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"天文航法,星センサ,深宇宙,姿勢決定","keywords_en":"celestial navigation,star sensor,deep space,attitude determination","key_researchers":["Charles Stark Draper","NASA JPL researchers"],"key_works":["Space Navigation Guidance and Control (1966)"]},
  {"name_ja":"三軸姿勢制御","name_en":"Three-Axis Attitude Control","definition":"スピン安定に頼らず、ロール・ピッチ・ヨー各軸を能動的に制御して衛星や探査機の指向精度を維持する姿勢制御方式。","impact_summary":"高分解能観測、通信指向、太陽電池追尾を可能にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙機制御","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"三軸制御,姿勢制御,リアクションホイール,指向","keywords_en":"three-axis control,attitude control,reaction wheel,pointing","key_researchers":["Harold Black","NASA Goddard researchers"],"key_works":["Spacecraft Attitude Determination and Control (1978)"]},
  {"name_ja":"スピン安定","name_en":"Spin Stabilization","definition":"宇宙機を回転させることで角運動量により姿勢を受動的に安定化し、簡単な構成で指向性と熱環境を保つ姿勢安定方式。","impact_summary":"初期衛星と惑星探査機の信頼性を高め、低コスト運用を可能にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙機安定化","era_start":1957,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"スピン安定,角運動量,衛星,姿勢","keywords_en":"spin stabilization,angular momentum,satellite,attitude","key_researchers":["NASA Goddard researchers"],"key_works":["Attitude Stabilization and Control of Earth Satellites (1966)"]},
  {"name_ja":"リアクションホイール制御","name_en":"Reaction Wheel Control","definition":"電動ホイールの回転速度を変えて角運動量を交換し、推進剤を使わず宇宙機姿勢を精密に制御するアクチュエータ概念。","impact_summary":"観測衛星、望遠鏡、探査機の長寿命高精度指向を実現した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙機姿勢制御","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"リアクションホイール,角運動量,姿勢制御,指向精度","keywords_en":"reaction wheel,angular momentum,attitude control,pointing accuracy","key_researchers":["NASA researchers"],"key_works":["Spacecraft Attitude Determination and Control (1978)"]},
  {"name_ja":"コントロール・モーメント・ジャイロ","name_en":"Control Moment Gyroscope","definition":"高速回転するロータのジンバル角を変えて大きなジャイロトルクを発生させ、宇宙機や大型衛星を素早く姿勢変更する装置。","impact_summary":"宇宙ステーションや大型観測衛星の機敏な姿勢制御を可能にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙機姿勢制御","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"CMG,ジャイロトルク,大型衛星,姿勢変更","keywords_en":"CMG,gyroscopic torque,large satellite,attitude maneuver","key_researchers":["NASA engineers"],"key_works":["Control Moment Gyro Systems for Spacecraft (1962)"]},
  {"name_ja":"重力傾度安定","name_en":"Gravity Gradient Stabilization","definition":"軌道上の重力勾配が長軸を地球方向へ向ける性質を利用し、能動制御を少なくして衛星姿勢を安定化する方式。","impact_summary":"小型・低電力衛星の姿勢安定に有効な受動制御手段を与えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"受動姿勢制御","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"重力傾度,受動安定,衛星姿勢,低電力","keywords_en":"gravity gradient,passive stabilization,satellite attitude,low power","key_researchers":["NASA Goddard researchers"],"key_works":["Gravity-Gradient Stabilization of Earth Satellites (1963)"]},
  {"name_ja":"軌道力学","name_en":"Orbital Mechanics","definition":"重力場中の人工衛星、探査機、惑星の運動を力学的に扱い、軌道要素、摂動、遷移、ランデブーを解析する基礎分野。","impact_summary":"人工衛星運用、月惑星探査、宇宙交通の設計言語を提供した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"天体力学応用","era_start":1687,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"軌道,ケプラー,摂動,遷移","keywords_en":"orbit,Kepler,perturbation,transfer","key_researchers":["Isaac Newton","Johannes Kepler"],"key_works":["Philosophiae Naturalis Principia Mathematica (1687)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ケプラー軌道要素","name_en":"Keplerian Orbital Elements","definition":"軌道長半径、離心率、軌道傾斜角、昇交点赤経、近点引数、真近点角で二体問題の軌道を表す標準的記述法。","impact_summary":"衛星追跡、軌道設計、ミッション解析で共通座標系として機能した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"軌道表現","era_start":1609,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"軌道要素,離心率,傾斜角,二体問題","keywords_en":"orbital elements,eccentricity,inclination,two-body problem","key_researchers":["Johannes Kepler"],"key_works":["Astronomia Nova (1609)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ホーマン遷移","name_en":"Hohmann Transfer","definition":"二つの同一平面円軌道間を、接線方向の二回の速度変更で結ぶ最小エネルギーに近い楕円遷移軌道。","impact_summary":"衛星投入、月惑星遷移、燃料見積りの基本手法になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"軌道遷移設計","era_start":1925,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ホーマン遷移,デルタV,楕円軌道,燃料最小","keywords_en":"Hohmann transfer,delta-v,elliptic orbit,fuel minimum","key_researchers":["Walter Hohmann"],"key_works":["Die Erreichbarkeit der Himmelskorper (1925)"]},
  {"name_ja":"重力アシスト","name_en":"Gravity Assist","definition":"惑星や衛星の重力場を通過して相対速度ベクトルを変え、推進剤を節約しながら探査機のエネルギーと軌道を変える技術。","impact_summary":"外惑星探査、太陽系脱出、複数天体探査を現実的にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星間航行","era_start":1959,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"重力アシスト,スイングバイ,惑星探査,軌道エネルギー","keywords_en":"gravity assist,flyby,planetary exploration,orbital energy","key_researchers":["Michael Minovitch","Gary Flandro"],"key_works":["A Method for Determining Interplanetary Free-Fall Reconnaissance Trajectories (1961)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ラグランジュ点ミッション","name_en":"Lagrange Point Mission","definition":"二天体重力場で相対的に力が釣り合うラグランジュ点やその近傍軌道を利用し、観測、通信、探査拠点を配置する概念。","impact_summary":"太陽観測、宇宙望遠鏡、深宇宙通信中継の配置戦略を広げた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"三体問題応用","era_start":1772,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ラグランジュ点,L1,L2,ハロー軌道","keywords_en":"Lagrange point,L1,L2,halo orbit","key_researchers":["Joseph-Louis Lagrange","Robert Farquhar"],"key_works":["Essai sur le Probleme des Trois Corps (1772)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ハロー軌道","name_en":"Halo Orbit","definition":"ラグランジュ点近傍に存在する三次元周期軌道で、太陽観測や深宇宙望遠鏡の連続通信と安定した熱環境に利用される。","impact_summary":"SOHOやJWSTなど重要ミッションの軌道設計を可能にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"制限三体問題","era_start":1968,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ハロー軌道,ラグランジュ点,三体問題,深宇宙","keywords_en":"halo orbit,Lagrange point,three-body problem,deep space","key_researchers":["Robert Farquhar"],"key_works":["The Control and Use of Libration-Point Satellites (1970)"]},
  {"name_ja":"低エネルギー遷移","name_en":"Low-Energy Transfer","definition":"三体力学や弱安定境界を利用し、時間をかける代わりに少ない推進剤で月・惑星・小天体へ到達する軌道設計概念。","impact_summary":"小型探査機や燃料制約の厳しいミッションの可能性を広げた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"力学系軌道設計","era_start":1991,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"低エネルギー遷移,弱安定境界,三体問題,燃料節約","keywords_en":"low-energy transfer,weak stability boundary,three-body problem,fuel saving","key_researchers":["Edward Belbruno","Martin Lo"],"key_works":["Ballistic Lunar Capture Transfer (1991)"]},
  {"name_ja":"弾道捕獲","name_en":"Ballistic Capture","definition":"目的天体周辺の重力環境に自然に捕まる軌道を設計し、大きな軌道投入燃焼を避けて捕獲を実現する惑星間航行手法。","impact_summary":"月・火星ミッションの推進剤削減策として注目された。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"低エネルギー軌道","era_start":1991,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"弾道捕獲,月遷移,火星遷移,推進剤削減","keywords_en":"ballistic capture,lunar transfer,Mars transfer,propellant reduction","key_researchers":["Edward Belbruno"],"key_works":["Capture Dynamics and Chaotic Motions in Celestial Mechanics (2004)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ランデブー・ドッキング","name_en":"Rendezvous and Docking","definition":"二つの宇宙機が相対軌道を制御して接近し、姿勢と速度を同期させて機械的に結合する軌道運用技術。","impact_summary":"宇宙ステーション、補給船、月着陸、軌道上整備の前提技術になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙運用工学","era_start":1965,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ランデブー,ドッキング,相対航法,近傍運用","keywords_en":"rendezvous,docking,relative navigation,proximity operations","key_researchers":["NASA Gemini program engineers","Sergei Korolev"],"key_works":["Gemini Rendezvous Mission Reports (1966)"]},
  {"name_ja":"相対軌道力学","name_en":"Relative Orbital Dynamics","definition":"近接する二宇宙機の相対位置と速度を、クロハシー・ウィルトシャー方程式などで記述し、接近運用を設計する理論。","impact_summary":"編隊飛行、ドッキング、衛星点検、デブリ除去の基礎になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"近傍軌道制御","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"相対軌道,CW方程式,編隊飛行,接近運用","keywords_en":"relative orbit,CW equations,formation flying,proximity operations","key_researchers":["W. H. Clohessy","R. S. Wiltshire"],"key_works":["Terminal Guidance System for Satellite Rendezvous (1960)"]},
  {"name_ja":"編隊飛行衛星","name_en":"Satellite Formation Flying","definition":"複数の衛星を相対軌道制御で一定幾何配置に保ち、単一大型衛星では難しい観測、干渉計測、分散ミッションを実現する概念。","impact_summary":"地球観測、宇宙科学、通信ミッションの分散化を促進した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"分散宇宙システム","era_start":1995,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"編隊飛行,分散衛星,相対制御,干渉計","keywords_en":"formation flying,distributed satellites,relative control,interferometry","key_researchers":["David Miller","Jonathan How"],"key_works":["Spacecraft Formation Flying: Dynamics, Control and Navigation (2004)"]},
  {"name_ja":"衛星コンステレーション","name_en":"Satellite Constellation","definition":"多数の衛星を計画的な軌道面と位相に配置し、通信、測位、観測を全球的または高頻度に提供する宇宙システム設計概念。","impact_summary":"低遅延通信、地球観測の高頻度化、宇宙インフラの商業化を加速した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙システム工学","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"衛星コンステレーション,低軌道,通信衛星,全球カバレッジ","keywords_en":"satellite constellation,LEO,communication satellite,global coverage","key_researchers":["John Walker","Greg Wyler"],"key_works":["Satellite Constellations (1984)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ウォーカー星座","name_en":"Walker Constellation","definition":"同一高度・傾斜角の複数軌道面に衛星を規則的位相で配置し、均一な地球カバレッジを得る衛星コンステレーション設計法。","impact_summary":"GNSSや通信衛星網の配置設計に広く使われる標準モデルとなった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"衛星網設計","era_start":1970,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ウォーカー星座,軌道面,位相,全球被覆","keywords_en":"Walker constellation,orbital plane,phasing,global coverage","key_researchers":["John Walker"],"key_works":["Satellite Constellations (1984)"]},
  {"name_ja":"キューブサット","name_en":"CubeSat","definition":"10センチ級単位の標準寸法を用いる小型衛星規格で、大学、企業、政府が低コストで宇宙実証や観測を行えるようにした概念。","impact_summary":"宇宙開発への参入障壁を下げ、小型衛星産業と教育を拡大した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"小型衛星工学","era_start":1999,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"キューブサット,小型衛星,標準化,低コスト","keywords_en":"CubeSat,small satellite,standardization,low cost","key_researchers":["Jordi Puig-Suari","Bob Twiggs"],"key_works":["CubeSat Design Specification (1999)"]},
  {"name_ja":"超小型衛星","name_en":"Nanosatellite","definition":"数キログラムから十数キログラム級の衛星で、民生部品、標準バス、短期開発を活用して実証や観測を迅速に行う衛星概念。","impact_summary":"大学発宇宙ミッション、商業地球観測、技術実証の速度を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"ニュー・スペース","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"超小型衛星,民生部品,短期開発,技術実証","keywords_en":"nanosatellite,COTS,rapid development,technology demonstration","key_researchers":["Bob Twiggs","Jordi Puig-Suari"],"key_works":["CubeSat Design Specification (1999)"]},
  {"name_ja":"衛星メガコンステレーション","name_en":"Satellite Megaconstellation","definition":"数百から数万機規模の低軌道衛星群で、広帯域通信や高頻度観測を提供する一方、衝突リスクや天文学影響も伴う概念。","impact_summary":"宇宙インターネットを拡大し、軌道交通管理の必要性を急増させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"商業宇宙システム","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"メガコンステレーション,低軌道通信,宇宙交通,衝突回避","keywords_en":"megaconstellation,LEO broadband,space traffic,collision avoidance","key_researchers":["SpaceX engineers","OneWeb engineers"],"key_works":["Starlink Initial Deployment Filings (2016)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙交通管理","name_en":"Space Traffic Management","definition":"軌道上物体の追跡、衝突予測、回避調整、運用ルールを統合し、混雑する宇宙環境の安全と持続性を確保する概念。","impact_summary":"メガコンステレーション時代の宇宙利用を継続可能にする政策技術基盤となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙安全保障工学","era_start":2010,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙交通管理,SSA,衝突回避,軌道持続性","keywords_en":"space traffic management,SSA,collision avoidance,orbital sustainability","key_researchers":["Brian Weeden","T. S. Kelso"],"key_works":["Space Traffic Management in the Age of New Space (2017)"]},
  {"name_ja":"スペースデブリ緩和","name_en":"Space Debris Mitigation","definition":"ミッション終了後の軌道離脱、爆発防止、破片発生抑制、衝突回避により人工物残骸の増加を抑える宇宙環境保全概念。","impact_summary":"衛星運用の長期安全性と国際的な宇宙活動規範を形成した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙環境保全","era_start":1978,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"スペースデブリ,軌道離脱,破片,持続可能性","keywords_en":"space debris,deorbit,fragments,sustainability","key_researchers":["Donald Kessler","Nicholas Johnson"],"key_works":["Collision Frequency of Artificial Satellites (1978)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ケスラーシンドローム","name_en":"Kessler Syndrome","definition":"軌道上衝突で生じた破片がさらに衝突を誘発し、連鎖的にデブリ密度が増えて特定軌道の利用を困難にする現象モデル。","impact_summary":"宇宙デブリ対策と軌道利用規制の重要性を世界的に認識させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙環境リスク","era_start":1978,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ケスラーシンドローム,連鎖衝突,デブリ,低軌道","keywords_en":"Kessler syndrome,collisional cascading,debris,LEO","key_researchers":["Donald Kessler","Burton Cour-Palais"],"key_works":["Collision Frequency of Artificial Satellites: The Creation of a Debris Belt (1978)"]},
  {"name_ja":"能動デブリ除去","name_en":"Active Debris Removal","definition":"ロボットアーム、ネット、ハープーン、レーザー、推進タグなどで大型デブリを捕獲または軌道離脱させる宇宙環境改善技術。","impact_summary":"混雑軌道の衝突リスクを直接下げる実行手段として研究が進んだ。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"軌道保全工学","era_start":2010,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"能動デブリ除去,捕獲,軌道離脱,宇宙ロボット","keywords_en":"active debris removal,capture,deorbit,space robotics","key_researchers":["JAXA researchers","ESA Clean Space team"],"key_works":["RemoveDEBRIS Mission Results (2019)"]},
  {"name_ja":"軌道上サービス","name_en":"On-Orbit Servicing","definition":"軌道上で衛星の点検、補給、修理、アップグレード、寿命延長を行い、使い捨て前提の宇宙機運用を変えるサービス概念。","impact_summary":"高価な衛星の寿命延長と宇宙インフラの保守可能性を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙ロジスティクス","era_start":1984,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"軌道上サービス,修理,補給,寿命延長","keywords_en":"on-orbit servicing,repair,refueling,life extension","key_researchers":["NASA Hubble servicing teams","DARPA RSGS team"],"key_works":["Hubble Space Telescope Servicing Mission Reports (1993)"]},
  {"name_ja":"軌道上製造","name_en":"In-Space Manufacturing","definition":"微小重力や真空環境を利用して部品、構造物、材料を宇宙で製造し、打上げ制約を超える宇宙システムを作る概念。","impact_summary":"大型構造物、修理部品、深宇宙探査の補給戦略を変えつつある。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙製造工学","era_start":2014,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"軌道上製造,3Dプリント,微小重力,大型構造","keywords_en":"in-space manufacturing,3D printing,microgravity,large structures","key_researchers":["Made In Space engineers","NASA researchers"],"key_works":["3D Printing in Zero-G Technology Demonstration (2014)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙資源利用","name_en":"In-Situ Resource Utilization","definition":"月、火星、小惑星などの現地資源から水、酸素、推進剤、建材を生成し、地球からの補給依存を減らす探査工学概念。","impact_summary":"持続的月面活動と火星探査の経済性を大きく改善する鍵とされた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星表面システム","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ISRU,現地資源,月面,火星","keywords_en":"ISRU,local resources,lunar surface,Mars","key_researchers":["Robert Zubrin","Gerald Sanders"],"key_works":["The Case for Mars (1996)"]},
  {"name_ja":"月面基地システム","name_en":"Lunar Base Systems","definition":"月面で人員居住、電力、熱制御、通信、移動、資源利用を統合し、短期滞在を持続的活動へ拡張するシステム概念。","impact_summary":"アルテミス以降の月探査を単発着陸から拠点運用へ転換させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"有人宇宙システム","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"月面基地,居住,電力,ISRU","keywords_en":"lunar base,habitation,power,ISRU","key_researchers":["Wernher von Braun","NASA Artemis teams"],"key_works":["The Exploration of Mars and the Moon (1956)"]},
  {"name_ja":"火星直接計画","name_en":"Mars Direct","definition":"地球軌道組立を最小化し、火星大気から帰還推進剤を製造して有人火星探査を単純化するミッションアーキテクチャ。","impact_summary":"火星探査を巨大計画から実行可能な設計問題として再提示した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"有人惑星探査","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"火星直接,ISRU,有人火星探査,帰還推進剤","keywords_en":"Mars Direct,ISRU,human Mars exploration,return propellant","key_researchers":["Robert Zubrin","David Baker"],"key_works":["Mars Direct: A Simple, Robust, and Cost Effective Architecture (1991)"]},
  {"name_ja":"深宇宙探査","name_en":"Deep Space Exploration","definition":"地球重力圏を越え、月、惑星、小惑星、外惑星、太陽圏を対象に長距離通信、自律航法、放射線対策を伴って行う探査活動。","impact_summary":"太陽系の理解を拡張し、通信、電源、航法、ロボティクス技術を発展させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星探査工学","era_start":1959,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"深宇宙探査,惑星探査,自律航法,長距離通信","keywords_en":"deep space exploration,planetary exploration,autonomous navigation,long-distance communication","key_researchers":["NASA JPL researchers","Sergei Korolev"],"key_works":["Voyager Mission Reports (1977)"]},
  {"name_ja":"サンプルリターン","name_en":"Sample Return Mission","definition":"月、彗星、小惑星、火星などから試料を採取し、汚染管理と再突入回収を通じて地球の研究施設へ戻す探査ミッション概念。","impact_summary":"遠隔観測では得られない高精度分析を可能にし、惑星科学を深化させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星探査運用","era_start":1969,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"サンプルリターン,小惑星,再突入,汚染管理","keywords_en":"sample return,asteroid,reentry,contamination control","key_researchers":["NASA Apollo teams","JAXA Hayabusa teams"],"key_works":["Apollo Lunar Sample Preliminary Examination Reports (1969)"]},
  {"name_ja":"小惑星探査","name_en":"Asteroid Exploration","definition":"小天体の低重力、不規則形状、表面物性に対応して、ランデブー、着陸、採取、帰還を行う惑星探査の一分野。","impact_summary":"太陽系形成史、資源利用、地球防衛の知見を大きく拡張した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"小天体探査","era_start":1991,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"小惑星探査,低重力,サンプル採取,地球防衛","keywords_en":"asteroid exploration,microgravity,sampling,planetary defense","key_researchers":["JAXA Hayabusa team","NASA OSIRIS-REx team"],"key_works":["Hayabusa Mission to Asteroid Itokawa (2011)"]},
  {"name_ja":"惑星保護","name_en":"Planetary Protection","definition":"探査機が地球由来生命を他天体へ持ち込むこと、また地球へ未知物質を戻すことによる生物学的汚染を管理する方針と技術。","impact_summary":"火星、氷衛星、サンプルリターンの設計と運用基準を規定した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙生命倫理工学","era_start":1967,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"惑星保護,汚染管理,火星,サンプルリターン","keywords_en":"planetary protection,contamination control,Mars,sample return","key_researchers":["COSPAR panels","Joshua Lederberg"],"key_works":["Outer Space Treaty (1967)"]},
  {"name_ja":"エアロキャプチャ","name_en":"Aerocapture","definition":"惑星大気の抗力を一回の通過で利用して探査機を捕獲軌道へ入れ、大きな推進剤消費を避ける軌道投入技術。","impact_summary":"外惑星や火星周回ミッションの質量余裕を増やす有力手段となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"大気利用軌道制御","era_start":1980,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"エアロキャプチャ,大気制動,惑星周回,推進剤節約","keywords_en":"aerocapture,aerobraking,planetary orbit,propellant saving","key_researchers":["Robert Braun","NASA Langley researchers"],"key_works":["Aerocapture Technology Development Needs (2002)"]},
  {"name_ja":"エアロブレーキング","name_en":"Aerobraking","definition":"惑星大気上層を複数回通過して抗力で軌道エネルギーを減らし、少ない推進剤で周回軌道を低下・円軌道化する技術。","impact_summary":"火星探査機の燃料節約と搭載質量増加を可能にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星軌道運用","era_start":1993,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"エアロブレーキング,火星,大気抗力,軌道低下","keywords_en":"aerobraking,Mars,atmospheric drag,orbit lowering","key_researchers":["NASA JPL researchers"],"key_works":["Mars Global Surveyor Aerobraking Mission (1999)"]},
  {"name_ja":"大気圏突入・降下・着陸","name_en":"Entry, Descent, and Landing","definition":"惑星大気突入から減速、熱防護、パラシュートや推進着陸、誘導までを統合し、安全に表面へ到達する技術領域。","impact_summary":"火星ローバー、月着陸機、サンプル帰還の成否を左右する中核技術になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星着陸工学","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"EDL,突入,降下,着陸","keywords_en":"EDL,entry,descent,landing","key_researchers":["NASA JPL EDL teams"],"key_works":["Mars Science Laboratory Entry, Descent, and Landing System (2012)"]},
  {"name_ja":"スカイクレーン着陸","name_en":"Sky Crane Landing","definition":"火星ローバーをロケット降下段からケーブルで吊り下げ、車輪を直接地表に接地させて大型ローバーを安全に着陸させる方式。","impact_summary":"大型火星ローバーの着陸質量制約を突破し、精密探査を可能にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星着陸システム","era_start":2012,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"スカイクレーン,火星ローバー,推進着陸,EDL","keywords_en":"sky crane,Mars rover,propulsive landing,EDL","key_researchers":["Adam Steltzner","NASA JPL EDL team"],"key_works":["Mars Science Laboratory Entry, Descent, and Landing System (2012)"]},
  {"name_ja":"精密着陸","name_en":"Precision Landing","definition":"画像航法、地形照合、危険回避、誘導制御により、惑星表面や地球帰還地点へ狙った範囲内で着陸する技術概念。","impact_summary":"科学価値の高い危険地形への着陸と再使用ロケット回収を可能にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"自律着陸誘導","era_start":2000,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"精密着陸,地形照合,危険回避,画像航法","keywords_en":"precision landing,terrain relative navigation,hazard avoidance,vision navigation","key_researchers":["NASA JPL researchers","SpaceX engineers"],"key_works":["Terrain Relative Navigation for Mars 2020 (2021)"]},
  {"name_ja":"地形相対航法","name_en":"Terrain Relative Navigation","definition":"搭載カメラ画像を地図と照合して現在位置を推定し、着陸候補地や危険地形を避ける自律航法技術。","impact_summary":"火星2020の高精度着陸を実現し、危険地域探査を開いた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"視覚航法","era_start":2010,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"地形相対航法,画像照合,火星着陸,自律航法","keywords_en":"terrain relative navigation,image matching,Mars landing,autonomous navigation","key_researchers":["Andrew Johnson","NASA JPL researchers"],"key_works":["Mars 2020 Lander Vision System (2021)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ロケット方程式","name_en":"Tsiolkovsky Rocket Equation","definition":"噴射速度と質量比から理想的な速度増分を求める式で、宇宙輸送における推進剤質量と到達能力の根本制約を示す。","impact_summary":"打上げ機、探査機、ミッション計画の質量設計を支配する基本式になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"ロケット推進理論","era_start":1903,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ロケット方程式,質量比,比推力,デルタV","keywords_en":"rocket equation,mass ratio,specific impulse,delta-v","key_researchers":["Konstantin Tsiolkovsky"],"key_works":["Exploration of Cosmic Space by Means of Reaction Devices (1903)"]},
  {"name_ja":"多段ロケット","name_en":"Multistage Rocket","definition":"燃料を使い終えた段を切り離して不要質量を減らし、ロケット方程式の制約を緩和して軌道速度へ到達する打上げ機概念。","impact_summary":"人工衛星打上げ、月探査、惑星探査を現実にした基礎構成となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙輸送工学","era_start":1920,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"多段ロケット,段分離,質量比,軌道投入","keywords_en":"multistage rocket,staging,mass ratio,orbital insertion","key_researchers":["Konstantin Tsiolkovsky","Wernher von Braun"],"key_works":["The Rocket into Planetary Space (1923)"]},
  {"name_ja":"液体ロケットエンジン","name_en":"Liquid Rocket Engine","definition":"液体酸化剤と燃料をポンプまたは圧送で燃焼室へ送り、燃焼ガスをノズルで加速して高推力を得るロケット推進方式。","impact_summary":"大型打上げ機、有人宇宙船、深宇宙探査の主力推進となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"化学推進","era_start":1926,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"液体ロケット,燃焼室,ターボポンプ,ノズル","keywords_en":"liquid rocket,combustion chamber,turbopump,nozzle","key_researchers":["Robert Goddard","Valentin Glushko"],"key_works":["A Method of Reaching Extreme Altitudes (1919)"]},
  {"name_ja":"固体ロケットモータ","name_en":"Solid Rocket Motor","definition":"燃料と酸化剤を混合した固体推進薬を燃焼させ、構造が単純で即応性に優れる推進装置としてミサイルや補助ブースタに使われる。","impact_summary":"軍用ロケット、打上げ補助、探査機加速段の信頼性を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"化学推進","era_start":1930,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"固体ロケット,推進薬,ブースタ,即応性","keywords_en":"solid rocket,propellant,booster,readiness","key_researchers":["Frank Malina","Qian Xuesen"],"key_works":["Jet Propulsion (1946)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ハイブリッドロケット","name_en":"Hybrid Rocket","definition":"固体燃料と液体または気体酸化剤を組み合わせ、固体ロケットの単純さと液体ロケットの停止・推力制御性を両立させる推進方式。","impact_summary":"安全性と運用性を重視する宇宙輸送や実験機で選択肢を増やした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"化学推進","era_start":1933,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ハイブリッドロケット,固体燃料,液体酸化剤,推力制御","keywords_en":"hybrid rocket,solid fuel,liquid oxidizer,throttle control","key_researchers":["O. Lutz","SpaceShipOne engineers"],"key_works":["Hybrid Rocket Propulsion Systems (1967)"]},
  {"name_ja":"比推力","name_en":"Specific Impulse","definition":"推進剤重量流量あたりの推力を表す性能指標で、ロケットやジェット推進の効率を比較し、ミッション質量を決める基本量。","impact_summary":"推進方式選定とロケット質量設計の中心的な評価尺度になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"推進性能論","era_start":1900,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"比推力,推進効率,推力,推進剤","keywords_en":"specific impulse,propulsion efficiency,thrust,propellant","key_researchers":["Konstantin Tsiolkovsky"],"key_works":["Exploration of Cosmic Space by Means of Reaction Devices (1903)"]},
  {"name_ja":"膨張ノズル理論","name_en":"Rocket Nozzle Expansion Theory","definition":"燃焼室の高温高圧ガスを収束拡散ノズルで加速し、圧力比と面積比に応じて推力と効率を最適化する理論。","impact_summary":"ロケットエンジン性能の設計、海面用と真空用ノズルの使い分けを可能にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"推進流体力学","era_start":1888,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ノズル,面積比,膨張,推力","keywords_en":"nozzle,area ratio,expansion,thrust","key_researchers":["Gustaf de Laval","Theodore von Karman"],"key_works":["Rocket Propulsion Elements (1949)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ターボポンプサイクル","name_en":"Turbopump Cycle","definition":"燃料や酸化剤でタービンを駆動し、高圧で推進剤を燃焼室へ供給する液体ロケットエンジンのポンプ駆動サイクル群。","impact_summary":"高燃焼圧・高推力エンジンを成立させ、大型打上げ機を支えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"液体ロケット工学","era_start":1940,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ターボポンプ,燃焼圧,ガス発生器, staged combustion","keywords_en":"turbopump,chamber pressure,gas generator,staged combustion","key_researchers":["Valentin Glushko","Wernher von Braun"],"key_works":["Rocket Propulsion Elements (1949)"]},
  {"name_ja":"二段燃焼サイクル","name_en":"Staged Combustion Cycle","definition":"予燃焼器で一部推進剤を燃焼させてタービンを回し、その排気を主燃焼室へ送ることで高効率と高燃焼圧を実現する方式。","impact_summary":"高性能ロケットエンジンの比推力と推力重量比を向上させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"液体ロケット推進","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"二段燃焼,予燃焼器,高燃焼圧,高効率","keywords_en":"staged combustion,preburner,high chamber pressure,high efficiency","key_researchers":["Alexei Isaev","Valentin Glushko"],"key_works":["Soviet Staged Combustion Engine Developments (1960)"]},
  {"name_ja":"エキスパンダサイクル","name_en":"Expander Cycle","definition":"燃料をエンジン冷却で加熱・気化させ、その膨張でタービンを駆動する液体ロケットサイクルで、高効率かつ清浄な運転が特徴。","impact_summary":"上段エンジンの再着火性、信頼性、比推力向上に貢献した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"液体ロケット推進","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"エキスパンダサイクル,再生冷却,上段,水素","keywords_en":"expander cycle,regenerative cooling,upper stage,hydrogen","key_researchers":["Pratt & Whitney engineers"],"key_works":["RL10 Engine Development Reports (1963)"]},
  {"name_ja":"メタンロケット","name_en":"Methane Rocket Propulsion","definition":"液体メタンと液体酸素を用いる推進で、すすの少なさ、貯蔵性、火星資源利用との相性から再使用機や探査で重視される。","impact_summary":"再使用ロケットと火星ミッションの推進剤選択を大きく変えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"次世代化学推進","era_start":2000,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"メタン,LOX,再使用,火星ISRU","keywords_en":"methane,LOX,reuse,Mars ISRU","key_researchers":["SpaceX Raptor team","Blue Origin BE-4 team"],"key_works":["Raptor Engine Development Updates (2016)"]},
  {"name_ja":"再使用ロケット","name_en":"Reusable Rocket","definition":"打上げ機の第一段や宇宙船を回収、点検、再飛行させることで、使い捨て前提だった宇宙輸送の費用と製造周期を削減する概念。","impact_summary":"低軌道打上げ価格を下げ、商業宇宙、衛星網、月火星計画を加速した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"ニュー・スペース輸送","era_start":1981,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"再使用ロケット,垂直着陸,回収,宇宙輸送","keywords_en":"reusable rocket,vertical landing,recovery,space transportation","key_researchers":["Maxime Faget","SpaceX engineers"],"key_works":["Space Shuttle Transportation System Reports (1981)"]},
  {"name_ja":"垂直離着陸ロケット","name_en":"Vertical Takeoff Vertical Landing Rocket","definition":"ロケットが垂直に離陸し、帰還時にも推力を制御して垂直に着陸する方式で、再使用打上げ機の主要アーキテクチャとなる。","impact_summary":"第一段回収を実用化し、打上げ運用の経済構造を変えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"再使用宇宙輸送","era_start":1993,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"VTVL,垂直着陸,推力制御,第一段回収","keywords_en":"VTVL,vertical landing,throttle control,booster recovery","key_researchers":["McDonnell Douglas DC-X team","SpaceX engineers"],"key_works":["DC-X Flight Test Reports (1993)"]},
  {"name_ja":"推進着陸","name_en":"Propulsive Landing","definition":"パラシュートや滑走路ではなくロケット推力を使って速度と姿勢を制御し、惑星表面や着陸台へ軟着陸する技術。","impact_summary":"月着陸、火星大型着陸、再使用ロケット回収に不可欠となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"着陸誘導制御","era_start":1966,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"推進着陸,軟着陸,月着陸,再使用","keywords_en":"propulsive landing,soft landing,lunar landing,reuse","key_researchers":["NASA Surveyor team","SpaceX engineers"],"key_works":["Surveyor Mission Reports (1966)"]},
  {"name_ja":"単段式宇宙往還機","name_en":"Single-Stage-to-Orbit","definition":"段分離せず単一機体で地上から軌道速度に到達し、再使用運用を目指す宇宙輸送概念で、軽量構造と高性能推進が鍵となる。","impact_summary":"完全再使用宇宙機の理想形として研究を刺激し続けている。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"先進宇宙輸送","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"SSTO,単段式,再使用,軽量構造","keywords_en":"SSTO,single stage,reuse,lightweight structure","key_researchers":["Max Hunter","NASA X-33 team"],"key_works":["Single-Stage-to-Orbit Vertical Takeoff and Landing Concept (1966)"]},
  {"name_ja":"スペースプレーン","name_en":"Spaceplane","definition":"航空機のような揚力飛行と宇宙機の軌道到達能力を組み合わせ、滑走路運用や再使用性を目指す宇宙輸送機概念。","impact_summary":"シャトル、X-37B、極超音速輸送研究の設計思想に影響した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"空力宇宙輸送","era_start":1950,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"スペースプレーン,揚力飛行,再使用,極超音速","keywords_en":"spaceplane,lifting flight,reuse,hypersonic","key_researchers":["Eugen Sanger","Irene Bredt"],"key_works":["A Rocket Drive for Long Range Bombers (1944)"]},
  {"name_ja":"リフティングボディ","name_en":"Lifting Body","definition":"明確な翼ではなく胴体形状で揚力を発生し、再突入後に操縦可能な滑空と着陸を行う宇宙往還機向け形状概念。","impact_summary":"スペースシャトルや再突入機の形状設計に重要な知見を与えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"再突入機空力","era_start":1957,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"リフティングボディ,再突入,滑空,宇宙往還機","keywords_en":"lifting body,reentry,glide,spaceplane","key_researchers":["Alfred Eggers","Dale Reed"],"key_works":["Lifting Body Flight Tests (1963)"]},
  {"name_ja":"空気吸込み式ロケット","name_en":"Air-Breathing Rocket","definition":"大気中では外気酸素を取り込み、宇宙では搭載酸化剤を使うことで、推進剤質量を削減する複合推進宇宙輸送概念。","impact_summary":"SSTOや極超音速機の質量効率向上を狙う重要研究テーマになった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"複合サイクル推進","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"空気吸込み,複合サイクル,SSTO,酸化剤削減","keywords_en":"air-breathing,combined cycle,SSTO,oxidizer reduction","key_researchers":["Alan Bond","Reaction Engines team"],"key_works":["HOTOL and SABRE Engine Studies (1980)"]},
  {"name_ja":"スクラムジェット","name_en":"Scramjet","definition":"超音速のまま空気を燃焼器へ通し、液体燃料などを燃焼させて極超音速域で推力を得る空気吸込み式推進方式。","impact_summary":"極超音速巡航、迅速アクセス、将来宇宙輸送の可能性を広げた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"極超音速推進","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"スクラムジェット,極超音速,超音速燃焼,空気吸込み","keywords_en":"scramjet,hypersonic,supersonic combustion,air-breathing","key_researchers":["Antonio Ferri","NASA Hyper-X team"],"key_works":["Hyper-X Program Overview (2004)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ラムジェット","name_en":"Ramjet","definition":"前進飛行の動圧で空気を圧縮し、回転圧縮機なしで燃焼と排気加速を行う高速飛行向け空気吸込み式エンジン。","impact_summary":"ミサイル、標的機、超音速実験機の推進方式として発展した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"高速推進","era_start":1913,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ラムジェット,動圧圧縮,超音速,ミサイル","keywords_en":"ramjet,ram compression,supersonic,missile","key_researchers":["Rene Lorin","William Avery"],"key_works":["Ramjet Propulsion (1948)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ターボジェット","name_en":"Turbojet","definition":"圧縮機、燃焼器、タービン、ノズルで構成され、排気ジェットの運動量で推力を生むガスタービン航空エンジン。","impact_summary":"航空機の高速化と高高度化を実現し、ジェット時代を開いた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"ガスタービン推進","era_start":1937,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ターボジェット,ガスタービン,圧縮機,推力","keywords_en":"turbojet,gas turbine,compressor,thrust","key_researchers":["Frank Whittle","Hans von Ohain"],"key_works":["Jet Propulsion (1953)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ターボファン","name_en":"Turbofan","definition":"ファンで大量の空気を加速し、コア流とバイパス流を組み合わせて高効率推力を得る現代旅客機の主流エンジン方式。","impact_summary":"民間航空の燃費、騒音、航続距離を大幅に改善した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空推進","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ターボファン,バイパス比,燃費,騒音低減","keywords_en":"turbofan,bypass ratio,fuel efficiency,noise reduction","key_researchers":["Rolls-Royce engineers","Pratt & Whitney engineers"],"key_works":["High Bypass Turbofan Development Reports (1960)"]},
  {"name_ja":"高バイパス比エンジン","name_en":"High-Bypass Turbofan","definition":"コア流に比べて非常に多い空気をファンで迂回させ、低速大質量流で効率よく推力を得る低燃費・低騒音エンジン概念。","impact_summary":"大型旅客機の経済性と環境性能を決定づける技術になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"民間航空推進","era_start":1968,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"高バイパス,ファン,低騒音,燃費","keywords_en":"high bypass,fan,low noise,fuel efficiency","key_researchers":["General Electric engineers","Pratt & Whitney engineers"],"key_works":["CF6 Engine Development Reports (1971)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ギヤードターボファン","name_en":"Geared Turbofan","definition":"ファンと低圧タービンの間に減速ギヤを入れ、それぞれを最適回転数で動かして燃費と騒音を改善するターボファン概念。","impact_summary":"単通路旅客機の燃費競争を押し上げ、低騒音化にも寄与した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"先進航空推進","era_start":2008,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ギヤードターボファン,減速ギヤ,燃費,騒音","keywords_en":"geared turbofan,reduction gear,fuel burn,noise","key_researchers":["Pratt & Whitney engineers"],"key_works":["PW1000G Geared Turbofan Development (2008)"]},
  {"name_ja":"オープンローター","name_en":"Open Rotor","definition":"ダクトなしの大径反転プロペラ状ファンで高い推進効率を狙う航空エンジン概念で、燃費改善と騒音対策が設計課題となる。","impact_summary":"次世代低燃費航空機の候補として周期的に研究開発が進められた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"高効率航空推進","era_start":1980,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"オープンローター,反転ファン,推進効率,騒音","keywords_en":"open rotor,contra-rotating fan,propulsive efficiency,noise","key_researchers":["NASA Propfan team","GE Aviation engineers"],"key_works":["Advanced Turboprop Project Reports (1987)"]},
  {"name_ja":"プロップファン","name_en":"Propfan","definition":"高速巡航に適した薄い後退ブレードを用い、プロペラ効率とジェット機速度の両立を目指す非ダクトファン推進概念。","impact_summary":"燃料危機後の航空推進研究を刺激し、現代オープンローターへ継承された。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"省燃費推進","era_start":1975,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"プロップファン,後退ブレード,燃費,高速プロペラ","keywords_en":"propfan,swept blade,fuel efficiency,high-speed propeller","key_researchers":["NASA Lewis researchers","Hamilton Standard engineers"],"key_works":["Advanced Turboprop Project (1988)"]},
  {"name_ja":"電動航空機","name_en":"Electric Aircraft","definition":"バッテリー、燃料電池、発電機から得た電力でモータを駆動し、プロペラやファンで推力を得る航空機概念で、騒音と排出低減を狙う。","impact_summary":"短距離航空、eVTOL、分散推進、脱炭素航空の研究開発を加速した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"持続可能航空","era_start":2010,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"電動航空機,バッテリー,モータ,脱炭素","keywords_en":"electric aircraft,battery,motor,decarbonization","key_researchers":["NASA X-57 team","Joby Aviation engineers"],"key_works":["NASA X-57 Maxwell Project Overview (2016)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ハイブリッド電気推進","name_en":"Hybrid-Electric Propulsion","definition":"ガスタービンや内燃機関と電動機・電池を組み合わせ、飛行フェーズに応じてエネルギー源を配分する航空推進システム概念。","impact_summary":"航続距離を保ちながら燃費、騒音、排出を下げる現実的経路を示した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"持続可能航空推進","era_start":2010,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ハイブリッド電気,タービン発電,電池,燃費低減","keywords_en":"hybrid-electric,turbogenerator,battery,fuel reduction","key_researchers":["NASA Glenn researchers","Airbus E-Fan X team"],"key_works":["NASA N+3 Hybrid Electric Propulsion Studies (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"分散電気推進","name_en":"Distributed Electric Propulsion","definition":"多数の小型電動プロパルサを翼や機体に分散配置し、推進と空力の相互作用を利用して揚力、効率、制御性を高める概念。","impact_summary":"eVTOL、短距離機、境界層吸込み推進の設計自由度を広げた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"電動空力推進統合","era_start":2010,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"分散電気推進,電動プロパルサ,高揚力,eVTOL","keywords_en":"distributed electric propulsion,electric propulsor,high lift,eVTOL","key_researchers":["Mark Moore","NASA X-57 team"],"key_works":["Distributed Electric Propulsion Aircraft Studies (2014)"]},
  {"name_ja":"eVTOL","name_en":"Electric Vertical Takeoff and Landing","definition":"電動推進を用いて垂直離着陸と巡航飛行を行う航空機概念で、都市内・地域間移動に向けて多ロータやリフトクルーズ型が研究される。","impact_summary":"都市航空交通、騒音規制、認証、バッテリー安全設計の新領域を開いた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"都市航空モビリティ","era_start":2014,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"eVTOL,都市航空交通,垂直離着陸,電動推進","keywords_en":"eVTOL,urban air mobility,VTOL,electric propulsion","key_researchers":["Mark Moore","Joby Aviation engineers"],"key_works":["Uber Elevate White Paper (2016)"]},
  {"name_ja":"先進航空モビリティ","name_en":"Advanced Air Mobility","definition":"eVTOL、小型空港、デジタル管制、自律運航を統合し、都市内や地域間の新しい航空輸送サービスを構築する概念。","impact_summary":"航空機設計だけでなく、空域管理、認証、インフラ計画を変えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空交通システム","era_start":2018,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"先進航空モビリティ,AAM,eVTOL,空域管理","keywords_en":"advanced air mobility,AAM,eVTOL,airspace management","key_researchers":["NASA AAM team","FAA researchers"],"key_works":["NASA Advanced Air Mobility National Campaign (2020)"]},
  {"name_ja":"都市航空モビリティ","name_en":"Urban Air Mobility","definition":"都市圏で短距離・高頻度の空中移動を提供する交通システム概念で、低騒音機体、離着陸場、運航管理が一体で設計される。","impact_summary":"航空工学を都市交通、騒音、社会受容性の問題へ拡張した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空交通革新","era_start":2016,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"都市航空モビリティ,UAM,離着陸場,低騒音","keywords_en":"urban air mobility,UAM,vertiport,low noise","key_researchers":["Uber Elevate team","NASA researchers"],"key_works":["Fast-Forwarding to a Future of On-Demand Urban Air Transportation (2016)"]},
  {"name_ja":"燃料電池航空機","name_en":"Fuel Cell Aircraft","definition":"水素などを燃料電池で電力へ変換し、電動モータで推進する航空機概念で、航続距離とゼロ排出運航の両立を目指す。","impact_summary":"小型機からリージョナル機まで脱炭素航空の有力経路として研究が進んだ。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"水素航空","era_start":2000,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"燃料電池,水素,電動推進,ゼロ排出","keywords_en":"fuel cell,hydrogen,electric propulsion,zero emission","key_researchers":["DLR researchers","ZeroAvia engineers"],"key_works":["HY4 Fuel Cell Aircraft Demonstration (2016)"]},
  {"name_ja":"水素航空機","name_en":"Hydrogen Aircraft","definition":"液体または気体水素を燃焼または燃料電池で利用し、二酸化炭素排出を大幅に削減する航空機システム概念。","impact_summary":"脱炭素航空の本命候補として燃料貯蔵、空港供給、機体配置研究を促した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"持続可能航空","era_start":1970,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"水素航空機,液体水素,脱炭素,燃料貯蔵","keywords_en":"hydrogen aircraft,liquid hydrogen,decarbonization,fuel storage","key_researchers":["Airbus ZEROe team","NASA researchers"],"key_works":["Cryoplane Project Reports (2003)"]},
  {"name_ja":"持続可能航空燃料","name_en":"Sustainable Aviation Fuel","definition":"廃油、バイオマス、合成燃料などから作る低炭素航空燃料で、既存機体やインフラを活用しながらライフサイクル排出削減を狙う。","impact_summary":"航空脱炭素で短中期に実装可能な主要手段として政策と技術を動かした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"環境航空工学","era_start":2008,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"SAF,低炭素燃料,合成燃料,ライフサイクル排出","keywords_en":"SAF,low-carbon fuel,synthetic fuel,life-cycle emissions","key_researchers":["ICAO CAEP experts","ASTM fuel committees"],"key_works":["ASTM D7566 Aviation Turbine Fuel Specification (2009)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ブレンデッドウィングボディ","name_en":"Blended Wing Body","definition":"翼と胴体を滑らかに一体化し、機体全体で揚力を生みながら表面積と抵抗を減らす高効率輸送機形状概念。","impact_summary":"大型旅客機や輸送機の燃費、騒音、積載効率を再考させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"革新航空機形態","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"BWB,翼胴融合,高効率,低抵抗","keywords_en":"BWB,blended wing body,high efficiency,low drag","key_researchers":["Robert Liebeck","NASA researchers"],"key_works":["Design of the Blended Wing Body Subsonic Transport (2004)"]},
  {"name_ja":"トラス支持翼","name_en":"Transonic Truss-Braced Wing","definition":"細長い高アスペクト比翼をトラスで支え、誘導抗力を減らしつつ遷音速巡航を可能にする次世代旅客機向け形状概念。","impact_summary":"単通路機の燃費改善を狙う最新機体構成として実証計画が進んだ。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"次世代輸送機設計","era_start":2010,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"トラス支持翼,高アスペクト比,遷音速,燃費","keywords_en":"truss-braced wing,high aspect ratio,transonic,fuel efficiency","key_researchers":["NASA SUGAR team","Boeing researchers"],"key_works":["SUGAR High Transonic Truss-Braced Wing Studies (2010)"]},
  {"name_ja":"モーフィング翼","name_en":"Morphing Wing","definition":"翼形状、翼幅、キャンバー、ねじりを飛行条件に応じて連続的または段階的に変化させ、広い包線で性能を最適化する概念。","impact_summary":"固定形状翼の妥協を減らし、低燃費・高機動・低騒音設計を促した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"適応構造航空","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"モーフィング翼,可変形状,適応構造,キャンバー","keywords_en":"morphing wing,variable geometry,adaptive structure,camber","key_researchers":["NASA Morphing Project team","Sergio Ricci"],"key_works":["Morphing Aircraft Structures (2007)"]},
  {"name_ja":"アクティブフロー制御","name_en":"Active Flow Control","definition":"吹出し、吸込み、プラズマ、合成ジェットなどで境界層や剥離を能動的に操作し、揚力増加や抵抗低減を図る技術概念。","impact_summary":"高揚力装置の簡素化、失速遅延、機体騒音低減の可能性を示した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"流体制御","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"能動流体制御,剥離制御,合成ジェット,プラズマ","keywords_en":"active flow control,separation control,synthetic jet,plasma","key_researchers":["Ari Glezer","John Seifert"],"key_works":["Active Flow Control: A Review (2007)"]},
  {"name_ja":"境界層吸込み推進","name_en":"Boundary Layer Ingestion Propulsion","definition":"機体後部の低速境界層をファンで吸い込み、機体抵抗の一部を推進系で回収して総合効率を高める空力推進統合概念。","impact_summary":"次世代低燃費機の設計で機体とエンジンの一体最適化を促した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"空力推進統合","era_start":2000,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"境界層吸込み,BLI,推進効率,機体統合","keywords_en":"boundary layer ingestion,BLI,propulsive efficiency,airframe integration","key_researchers":["NASA N+3 researchers","Mark Drela"],"key_works":["D8 Double Bubble Aircraft Studies (2010)"]},
  {"name_ja":"二重胴体D8概念","name_en":"D8 Double Bubble Aircraft","definition":"二つの胴体を結合した断面と後部境界層吸込みエンジンを組み合わせ、低速巡航と高効率を狙う次世代旅客機概念。","impact_summary":"機体形状と推進統合による燃費改善の代表例として研究された。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"次世代民間機設計","era_start":2010,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"D8,二重胴体,境界層吸込み,低燃費","keywords_en":"D8,double bubble,boundary layer ingestion,fuel efficiency","key_researchers":["Mark Drela","MIT researchers"],"key_works":["D8 Series Future Aircraft Design Studies (2010)"]},
  {"name_ja":"超音速旅客機","name_en":"Supersonic Transport","definition":"マッハ1を超える巡航で乗客を輸送する航空機概念で、波面抵抗、ソニックブーム、熱、燃費、騒音規制が主要課題となる。","impact_summary":"コンコルド以降も高速移動の可能性と環境制約を象徴する分野である。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"高速民間航空","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"超音速旅客機,ソニックブーム,波面抵抗,高速輸送","keywords_en":"supersonic transport,sonic boom,wave drag,high-speed transport","key_researchers":["Concorde teams","NASA Supersonics Project"],"key_works":["Concorde Flight Test Reports (1969)"]},
  {"name_ja":"低ブーム超音速機","name_en":"Low-Boom Supersonic Aircraft","definition":"機体全体の体積・揚力分布を調整して地上に届くソニックブームを弱め、陸上超音速飛行の実現を目指す設計概念。","impact_summary":"環境規制と高速輸送を両立させるための最新超音速研究を牽引した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"環境適合高速機","era_start":2003,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"低ブーム,ソニックブーム,超音速,形状設計","keywords_en":"low boom,sonic boom,supersonic,shaping","key_researchers":["Christine Darden","NASA X-59 team"],"key_works":["Low-Boom Flight Demonstration Project (2016)"]},
  {"name_ja":"極超音速滑空体","name_en":"Hypersonic Glide Vehicle","definition":"ロケットで高高度へ加速された後、大気上層を極超音速で滑空し、揚力と機動で長距離を移動する飛行体概念。","impact_summary":"熱防護、誘導制御、材料、空力加熱研究を急速に押し上げた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"極超音速飛行","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"極超音速滑空体,HGV,熱防護,誘導","keywords_en":"hypersonic glide vehicle,HGV,thermal protection,guidance","key_researchers":["Theodore von Karman","DARPA HTV teams"],"key_works":["Hypersonic Technology Vehicle Reports (2011)"]},
  {"name_ja":"極超音速境界層遷移","name_en":"Hypersonic Boundary-Layer Transition","definition":"極超音速流で層流境界層が乱流へ移る過程を扱い、表面粗さ、音響擾乱、熱化学効果が熱流束を大きく変える現象。","impact_summary":"再突入機と極超音速機の熱防護重量と安全余裕を左右する。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"極超音速空力熱","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"極超音速,境界層遷移,熱流束,表面粗さ","keywords_en":"hypersonic,boundary-layer transition,heat flux,roughness","key_researchers":["Lester Lees","Iain Boyd"],"key_works":["Laminar Heat Transfer over Blunt-Nosed Bodies (1956)"]},
  {"name_ja":"プラズマ空力","name_en":"Plasma Aerodynamics","definition":"高温再突入流や放電アクチュエータで生じるプラズマが、空力、通信遮断、熱伝達、流体制御へ及ぼす影響を扱う分野。","impact_summary":"再突入通信、極超音速制御、能動流体制御の研究を結びつけた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"電磁流体空力","era_start":1950,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"プラズマ,再突入,通信ブラックアウト,流体制御","keywords_en":"plasma,reentry,communication blackout,flow control","key_researchers":["A. B. Cambel","M. Mitchner"],"key_works":["Plasma Physics and Magnetofluidmechanics (1963)"]},
  {"name_ja":"磁気流体力学発電・制御","name_en":"Magnetohydrodynamic Control","definition":"導電性の高温気体やプラズマに磁場と電流を作用させ、流れの減速、発電、熱負荷低減を試みる極超音速関連概念。","impact_summary":"再突入熱緩和と空気吸込み極超音速推進の可能性を示した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"MHD空力","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"MHD,磁場,プラズマ,極超音速","keywords_en":"MHD,magnetic field,plasma,hypersonic","key_researchers":["Richard Rosa","A. B. Cambel"],"key_works":["Magnetohydrodynamic Energy Conversion (1968)"]},
  {"name_ja":"航空音響","name_en":"Aeroacoustics","definition":"流れ、渦、ジェット、翼端、ファンが発生する音を流体力学と音響学で解析し、航空機騒音の予測と低減を図る分野。","impact_summary":"空港騒音規制、エンジン設計、eVTOL受容性の基礎になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"流体音響","era_start":1952,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"航空音響,ジェット騒音,ファン騒音,低騒音設計","keywords_en":"aeroacoustics,jet noise,fan noise,low-noise design","key_researchers":["M. J. Lighthill","James Ffowcs Williams"],"key_works":["On Sound Generated Aerodynamically (1952)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ファン騒音予測","name_en":"Fan Noise Prediction","definition":"ターボファンや電動ダクトファンのブレード通過音、広帯域騒音、伝播を解析し、低騒音化を設計段階で評価する技術。","impact_summary":"民間機と都市航空機の認証・社会受容に重要な設計指標を与えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空音響設計","era_start":1970,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ファン騒音,ブレード通過音,広帯域騒音,認証","keywords_en":"fan noise,blade passing tone,broadband noise,certification","key_researchers":["Ffowcs Williams","NASA Glenn researchers"],"key_works":["Aircraft Engine Noise Reduction (1975)"]},
  {"name_ja":"翼端渦低減","name_en":"Wingtip Vortex Reduction","definition":"翼端で発生する渦と誘導抗力を、ウィングレット、翼端形状、後流制御により低減する空力設計概念。","impact_summary":"旅客機燃費を改善し、空港周辺の後方乱気流安全にも影響した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"抵抗低減空力","era_start":1976,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"翼端渦,ウィングレット,誘導抗力,後方乱気流","keywords_en":"wingtip vortex,winglet,induced drag,wake turbulence","key_researchers":["Richard Whitcomb"],"key_works":["A Design Approach and Selected Wind-Tunnel Results at High Subsonic Speeds for Wing-Tip Mounted Winglets (1976)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ウィングレット","name_en":"Winglet","definition":"翼端に小翼を設け、翼端渦を弱めて有効アスペクト比を高め、誘導抗力を減らす航空機燃費改善技術。","impact_summary":"民間旅客機の燃料消費削減に広く実装された代表的空力改良である。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"実用空力設計","era_start":1976,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ウィングレット,誘導抗力,燃費,翼端","keywords_en":"winglet,induced drag,fuel efficiency,wingtip","key_researchers":["Richard Whitcomb"],"key_works":["NASA Winglet Research (1976)"]},
  {"name_ja":"高揚力装置","name_en":"High-Lift Devices","definition":"フラップ、スラット、前縁装置などで離着陸時の最大揚力を増やし、低速性能と滑走路長を改善する翼装置群。","impact_summary":"大型旅客機の安全な離着陸と空港運用柔軟性を支えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"低速空力設計","era_start":1920,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"高揚力,フラップ,スラット,離着陸","keywords_en":"high lift,flap,slat,takeoff landing","key_researchers":["Handley Page engineers","NACA researchers"],"key_works":["NACA High-Lift Device Reports (1930)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ストール制御","name_en":"Stall Control","definition":"翼面上の流れ剥離を検知・遅延・管理し、失速時の揚力低下や操縦不能を避けるための設計と運用の概念。","impact_summary":"安全基準、操縦訓練、失速警報、翼形状設計に広く反映された。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"飛行安全空力","era_start":1910,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"失速,剥離,迎角,失速警報","keywords_en":"stall,separation,angle of attack,stall warning","key_researchers":["NACA researchers"],"key_works":["Airfoil Section Characteristics as Affected by Variations of the Reynolds Number (1935)"]},
  {"name_ja":"動的失速","name_en":"Dynamic Stall","definition":"急激な迎角変化や回転翼運動で失速が遅れ、大規模渦の生成と崩壊により非定常揚力とモーメントが発生する現象。","impact_summary":"ヘリコプタ、風車、機動航空機の荷重予測と制御に不可欠となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"非定常空力","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"動的失速,非定常揚力,前縁渦,回転翼","keywords_en":"dynamic stall,unsteady lift,leading-edge vortex,rotorcraft","key_researchers":["Martin Leishman","T. S. Beddoes"],"key_works":["A Semi-Empirical Model for Dynamic Stall (1982)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ヘリコプタ運動量理論","name_en":"Helicopter Momentum Theory","definition":"ロータを運動量を加える円盤として扱い、ホバリングや前進飛行の誘導速度、推力、必要馬力を求める回転翼基礎理論。","impact_summary":"ヘリコプタ性能推算とロータ設計の出発点になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"回転翼空力","era_start":1920,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ヘリコプタ,ロータ,誘導速度,ホバリング","keywords_en":"helicopter,rotor,induced velocity,hover","key_researchers":["Juan de la Cierva","Nikolai Zhukovsky"],"key_works":["Principles of Helicopter Aerodynamics (2000)"]},
  {"name_ja":"オートローテーション","name_en":"Autorotation","definition":"エンジン停止時に上昇気流相対成分でロータを回転させ、ヘリコプタが制御された降下と着陸を行う安全飛行状態。","impact_summary":"回転翼機の非常時生存性を高め、訓練と設計要件の中心になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"回転翼飛行力学","era_start":1923,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"オートローテーション,ヘリコプタ,非常着陸,ロータ","keywords_en":"autorotation,helicopter,emergency landing,rotor","key_researchers":["Juan de la Cierva"],"key_works":["Autogiro Flight Reports (1923)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ティルトローター","name_en":"Tiltrotor","definition":"ロータを上向きにして垂直離着陸し、前向きに傾けて固定翼機のように巡航するVTOL航空機概念。","impact_summary":"ヘリコプタの垂直性と固定翼機の速度・航続を結びつけた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"VTOL航空機設計","era_start":1950,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ティルトローター,VTOL,巡航,垂直離着陸","keywords_en":"tiltrotor,VTOL,cruise,vertical takeoff","key_researchers":["Bell Helicopter engineers","NASA Ames researchers"],"key_works":["XV-15 Tilt Rotor Research Aircraft Reports (1977)"]},
  {"name_ja":"テイルシッターVTOL","name_en":"Tail-Sitter VTOL","definition":"機体を垂直姿勢で離着陸させ、水平飛行へ遷移するVTOL概念で、機構が比較的単純だが遷移制御が難しい。","impact_summary":"無人機と小型電動機で再評価され、垂直離着陸設計の選択肢を広げた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"VTOL設計","era_start":1950,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"テイルシッター,VTOL,遷移飛行,無人機","keywords_en":"tail-sitter,VTOL,transition flight,UAV","key_researchers":["Convair engineers","Ryan Aeronautical engineers"],"key_works":["XFY-1 Pogo Flight Tests (1954)"]},
  {"name_ja":"無人航空機システム","name_en":"Unmanned Aircraft Systems","definition":"搭乗操縦者なしで飛行する航空機、地上局、通信、運用手順を含むシステム概念で、遠隔操縦と自律飛行を含む。","impact_summary":"軍事、測量、物流、災害対応、農業など航空利用の範囲を拡大した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"無人航空システム","era_start":1917,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"無人航空機,UAS,遠隔操縦,自律飛行","keywords_en":"UAS,unmanned aircraft,remote piloting,autonomy","key_researchers":["A. M. Low","Abraham Karem"],"key_works":["The Kettering Bug Reports (1918)"]},
  {"name_ja":"自律飛行","name_en":"Autonomous Flight","definition":"機体がセンサ、認識、計画、制御を用いて人間の逐次操作なしに経路選択、障害回避、任務遂行を行う飛行概念。","impact_summary":"ドローン、探査機、次世代航空交通の運用モデルを根本的に変えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"自律航空ロボティクス","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"自律飛行,経路計画,障害回避,AI","keywords_en":"autonomous flight,path planning,obstacle avoidance,AI","key_researchers":["Sebastian Thrun","Nicholas Roy"],"key_works":["Stanley: The Robot that Won the DARPA Grand Challenge (2006)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ドローンスウォーム","name_en":"Drone Swarm","definition":"多数の無人航空機が通信、分散制御、協調認識を用いて集団として任務を遂行する航空ロボティクス概念。","impact_summary":"監視、通信中継、災害対応、防衛で分散システムの可能性を広げた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"群知能航空","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ドローンスウォーム,群制御,分散制御,協調飛行","keywords_en":"drone swarm,swarm control,distributed control,cooperative flight","key_researchers":["Vijay Kumar","Raffaello D'Andrea"],"key_works":["Swarm Robotics and Cooperative UAV Control Studies (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"無人機交通管理","name_en":"UAS Traffic Management","definition":"低高度で多数のドローンを安全に飛行させるため、飛行計画、監視、分離、通信、空域承認をデジタル化する管理概念。","impact_summary":"ドローン配送や都市運用を社会実装するための空域基盤を作った。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空交通管理","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"UTM,ドローン,低高度空域,分離管理","keywords_en":"UTM,drones,low-altitude airspace,separation management","key_researchers":["NASA UTM team","Parimal Kopardekar"],"key_works":["Unmanned Aircraft System Traffic Management Concept (2016)"]},
  {"name_ja":"航空交通管理","name_en":"Air Traffic Management","definition":"航空機の流量、経路、分離、通信、管制を統合し、安全で効率的な空域利用を実現する運用システム概念。","impact_summary":"大量輸送時代の航空安全と遅延削減を支える社会基盤となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空運航システム","era_start":1930,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"航空交通管理,管制,分離,空域","keywords_en":"air traffic management,control,separation,airspace","key_researchers":["FAA researchers","Eurocontrol researchers"],"key_works":["NextGen Concept of Operations (2007)"]},
  {"name_ja":"自由飛行概念","name_en":"Free Flight Concept","definition":"中央管制の固定経路に依存せず、航空機が情報共有と自律判断で効率的な経路を選ぶ航空交通管理の将来構想。","impact_summary":"衛星航法とデータリンクを活用した柔軟な空域運用を促した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"次世代ATM","era_start":1995,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"自由飛行,航空交通,データリンク,経路最適化","keywords_en":"free flight,air traffic,datalink,route optimization","key_researchers":["RTCA committees","NASA ATM researchers"],"key_works":["Free Flight Phase 1 Final Report (1995)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ADS-B","name_en":"Automatic Dependent Surveillance-Broadcast","definition":"航空機がGNSSなどで得た自機位置、速度、識別情報を周期的に放送し、管制と周辺機が監視に利用する航空監視技術。","impact_summary":"航空交通監視の精度と共有性を高め、次世代管制の基盤になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空監視システム","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ADS-B,航空監視,GNSS,位置放送","keywords_en":"ADS-B,surveillance,GNSS,position broadcast","key_researchers":["FAA ADS-B team","RTCA committees"],"key_works":["RTCA DO-260 ADS-B MOPS (2000)"]},
  {"name_ja":"性能基準航法","name_en":"Performance-Based Navigation","definition":"航空路や進入方式を特定機器ではなく必要航法性能で定義し、RNAVやRNPを用いて柔軟で効率的な経路を可能にする概念。","impact_summary":"空域容量、燃費、騒音低減、精密進入の改善に寄与した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空航法運用","era_start":2000,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"PBN,RNAV,RNP,航法性能","keywords_en":"PBN,RNAV,RNP,navigation performance","key_researchers":["ICAO panels","FAA researchers"],"key_works":["ICAO Performance-Based Navigation Manual (2008)"]},
  {"name_ja":"航空安全管理システム","name_en":"Safety Management System","definition":"航空組織が危険源を体系的に特定し、リスク評価、緩和、監視、継続改善を行う安全管理の制度的・工学的枠組み。","impact_summary":"事故後対応から予防型安全管理へ航空業界を移行させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空安全工学","era_start":2006,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"SMS,安全管理,リスク評価,航空安全","keywords_en":"SMS,safety management,risk assessment,aviation safety","key_researchers":["ICAO safety panels"],"key_works":["ICAO Safety Management Manual (2006)"]},
  {"name_ja":"耐空性認証","name_en":"Airworthiness Certification","definition":"航空機、エンジン、装備品が安全基準を満たすことを設計、試験、解析、品質管理で示し、運航許可を得る制度と技術。","impact_summary":"航空機の社会的信頼性を支え、新技術導入の安全な経路を定めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"認証工学","era_start":1926,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"耐空性,認証,安全基準,飛行試験","keywords_en":"airworthiness,certification,safety standards,flight test","key_researchers":["FAA","EASA"],"key_works":["Federal Aviation Act (1958)"]},
  {"name_ja":"システム安全解析","name_en":"System Safety Analysis","definition":"航空宇宙システムの故障、ハザード、影響、発生確率を解析し、設計段階で安全要求と冗長性を定める工学手法。","impact_summary":"複雑な航空機、宇宙機、ソフトウェア搭載システムの安全設計を体系化した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"安全工学","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"システム安全,ハザード解析,FMEA,FTA","keywords_en":"system safety,hazard analysis,FMEA,FTA","key_researchers":["NASA safety engineers","FAA specialists"],"key_works":["MIL-STD-882 System Safety Program Requirements (1969)"]},
  {"name_ja":"フォールトトレラント制御","name_en":"Fault-Tolerant Control","definition":"センサ、アクチュエータ、構造の故障を検出し、残存機能で安定性と任務継続を保つ制御システム設計概念。","impact_summary":"航空機と宇宙機の冗長制御、再構成制御、安全運航を強化した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"信頼性制御","era_start":1980,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"耐故障制御,故障検出,再構成,冗長性","keywords_en":"fault-tolerant control,fault detection,reconfiguration,redundancy","key_researchers":["Naira Hovakimyan","NASA researchers"],"key_works":["Fault-Tolerant Flight Control: A Benchmark Challenge (2003)"]},
  {"name_ja":"デジタルツイン航空機","name_en":"Aircraft Digital Twin","definition":"実機の構造、推進、運用、センサデータを仮想モデルと結び、状態監視、寿命予測、保守最適化を行う概念。","impact_summary":"設計から運航保守までデータ駆動の航空機管理を可能にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"データ駆動航空工学","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"デジタルツイン,状態監視,予知保全,寿命予測","keywords_en":"digital twin,health monitoring,predictive maintenance,life prediction","key_researchers":["NASA researchers","Michael Grieves"],"key_works":["Digital Twin: Manufacturing Excellence through Virtual Factory Replication (2014)"]},
  {"name_ja":"構造ヘルスモニタリング","name_en":"Structural Health Monitoring","definition":"センサ、信号処理、損傷同定を用いて航空機や宇宙機構造の亀裂、剥離、疲労を運用中に監視する技術。","impact_summary":"予防保全、軽量設計、複合材構造の信頼性向上に貢献した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"スマート構造","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"構造ヘルスモニタリング,損傷検知,疲労,センサ","keywords_en":"structural health monitoring,damage detection,fatigue,sensors","key_researchers":["Fu-Kuo Chang","Charles Farrar"],"key_works":["Structural Health Monitoring: A Machine Learning Perspective (2012)"]},
  {"name_ja":"複合材料航空構造","name_en":"Composite Aerospace Structures","definition":"炭素繊維強化プラスチックなどの高比強度材料を用い、積層設計で航空機・宇宙機の軽量高剛性構造を実現する概念。","impact_summary":"旅客機、ロケット、衛星の軽量化と燃費・性能向上を大きく進めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"先進材料構造","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"複合材料,CFRP,積層,軽量構造","keywords_en":"composites,CFRP,laminate,lightweight structure","key_researchers":["Stephen Tsai","NASA materials researchers"],"key_works":["Composite Materials in Aircraft Structures (1986)"]},
  {"name_ja":"サンドイッチ構造","name_en":"Sandwich Structure","definition":"薄い高強度面材と軽量コアを組み合わせ、曲げ剛性を高めながら質量を抑える航空宇宙構造の代表的形式。","impact_summary":"衛星パネル、翼、フェアリング、内装構造の軽量化に広く使われた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"軽量構造設計","era_start":1940,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"サンドイッチ構造,ハニカム,軽量,曲げ剛性","keywords_en":"sandwich structure,honeycomb,lightweight,bending stiffness","key_researchers":["NACA researchers"],"key_works":["Sandwich Construction for Aircraft (1948)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ハニカム構造","name_en":"Honeycomb Structure","definition":"六角形セル状の軽量コアで高い面外剛性とエネルギー吸収を得る構造形式で、航空機床板や衛星パネルに使われる。","impact_summary":"高剛性・低質量の構造パネルを実現し、宇宙機設計に定着した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"軽量構造","era_start":1945,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ハニカム,軽量コア,衛星パネル,剛性","keywords_en":"honeycomb,lightweight core,satellite panel,stiffness","key_researchers":["Hexcel engineers","NACA researchers"],"key_works":["Honeycomb Sandwich Design Technology (1960)"]},
  {"name_ja":"疲労設計","name_en":"Fatigue Design","definition":"繰返し荷重による亀裂発生と進展を考慮し、航空機構造が寿命中に安全余裕を保つよう設計する概念。","impact_summary":"金属機体の事故教訓から安全寿命、損傷許容設計へ発展した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"構造信頼性","era_start":1954,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"疲労,亀裂,寿命,繰返し荷重","keywords_en":"fatigue,crack,life,cyclic loading","key_researchers":["August Wöhler","A. A. Griffith"],"key_works":["Report of the Court Investigation into the Comet Accidents (1955)"]},
  {"name_ja":"損傷許容設計","name_en":"Damage Tolerance Design","definition":"構造に初期欠陥や運用損傷が存在することを前提に、亀裂進展解析と点検で破壊前に検出できるよう設計する考え方。","impact_summary":"航空機構造の安全認証と保守計画を根本的に変えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"破壊力学応用","era_start":1970,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"損傷許容,亀裂進展,点検,破壊力学","keywords_en":"damage tolerance,crack growth,inspection,fracture mechanics","key_researchers":["Paul Paris","FAA researchers"],"key_works":["The Growth of Fatigue Cracks Due to Variations in Load (1963)"]},
  {"name_ja":"破壊力学","name_en":"Fracture Mechanics","definition":"亀裂先端の応力場とエネルギー解放率を用い、材料や構造物がどの条件で亀裂進展・破壊するかを解析する理論。","impact_summary":"航空宇宙構造の安全寿命評価と損傷許容認証の基盤となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"構造強度学","era_start":1921,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"破壊力学,亀裂,応力拡大係数,靭性","keywords_en":"fracture mechanics,crack,stress intensity,toughness","key_researchers":["A. A. Griffith","George Irwin"],"key_works":["The Phenomena of Rupture and Flow in Solids (1921)"]},
  {"name_ja":"座屈理論","name_en":"Buckling Theory","definition":"圧縮やせん断を受ける薄肉構造が、材料破壊前に形状不安定で耐荷能力を失う現象を解析する構造理論。","impact_summary":"航空機胴体、翼、ロケットタンクの薄肉軽量化に不可欠となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"構造安定性","era_start":1757,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"座屈,薄肉構造,圧縮,安定性","keywords_en":"buckling,thin-walled structure,compression,stability","key_researchers":["Leonhard Euler"],"key_works":["Methodus Inveniendi Lineas Curvas Maximi Minimive Proprietate Gaudentes (1744)"]},
  {"name_ja":"有限要素法","name_en":"Finite Element Method","definition":"構造や熱、流体領域を小要素に分割し、近似関数で連立方程式を作って応力、変形、振動を解析する数値手法。","impact_summary":"航空宇宙構造設計を試作依存から高精度シミュレーションへ移行させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"計算構造力学","era_start":1956,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"有限要素法,FEM,応力解析,構造設計","keywords_en":"finite element method,FEM,stress analysis,structural design","key_researchers":["Ray Clough","Olgierd Zienkiewicz"],"key_works":["The Finite Element Method in Plane Stress Analysis (1960)"]},
  {"name_ja":"トポロジー最適化","name_en":"Topology Optimization","definition":"設計領域内の材料配置を数値最適化し、剛性、質量、熱、振動などの条件を満たす軽量構造形状を導く手法。","impact_summary":"航空機部品と衛星構造の軽量化、積層造形設計を加速した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"構造最適設計","era_start":1988,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"トポロジー最適化,軽量化,材料配置,積層造形","keywords_en":"topology optimization,lightweighting,material layout,additive manufacturing","key_researchers":["Martin Bendsoe","Niels Kikuchi"],"key_works":["Generating Optimal Topologies in Structural Design Using a Homogenization Method (1988)"]},
  {"name_ja":"積層造形航空部品","name_en":"Additive Manufacturing for Aerospace","definition":"金属や樹脂を層状に造形し、従来加工では難しい一体化、内部流路、軽量格子を持つ航空宇宙部品を作る技術概念。","impact_summary":"ロケットエンジン、衛星部品、航空機構造の開発期間と部品点数を削減した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"先進製造工学","era_start":2010,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"積層造形,3Dプリント,軽量格子,一体化部品","keywords_en":"additive manufacturing,3D printing,lattice,integrated part","key_researchers":["NASA Marshall researchers","GE Aviation engineers"],"key_works":["Additive Manufacturing of Aerospace Components (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"再生冷却","name_en":"Regenerative Cooling","definition":"ロケット燃焼室やノズル壁内の流路に低温推進剤を流し、壁を冷却しつつ推進剤を予熱して熱効率を高める技術。","impact_summary":"高温高圧ロケットエンジンの長時間運転と再使用性を支えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"推進熱設計","era_start":1930,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"再生冷却,燃焼室,ノズル,熱管理","keywords_en":"regenerative cooling,combustion chamber,nozzle,thermal management","key_researchers":["Robert Goddard","Wernher von Braun"],"key_works":["Rocket Propulsion Elements (1949)"]},
  {"name_ja":"燃焼不安定","name_en":"Combustion Instability","definition":"燃焼室内の熱放出変動と音響波が結合し、圧力振動や破壊的荷重を生む現象で、ロケットとガスタービンで重要となる。","impact_summary":"エンジン開発の最大リスクの一つとして試験、解析、減衰装置を発展させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"推進燃焼学","era_start":1940,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"燃焼不安定,音響振動,ロケット,燃焼室","keywords_en":"combustion instability,acoustic oscillation,rocket,combustion chamber","key_researchers":["Luigi Crocco","F. E. C. Culick"],"key_works":["Theoretical Studies on Liquid-Propellant Rocket Instability (1965)"]},
  {"name_ja":"デトネーションエンジン","name_en":"Detonation Engine","definition":"通常の亜音速燃焼ではなくデトネーション波による急速燃焼を利用し、高熱効率と高出力密度を狙う推進機関概念。","impact_summary":"ロケットと航空エンジンの効率向上候補として2015年以降研究が活発化した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"先進燃焼推進","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"デトネーション,回転デトネーション,高効率,先進推進","keywords_en":"detonation,rotating detonation,high efficiency,advanced propulsion","key_researchers":["F. K. Lu","Kailasanath"],"key_works":["Rotating Detonation Engine Research Review (2016)"]},
  {"name_ja":"回転デトネーションエンジン","name_en":"Rotating Detonation Engine","definition":"環状燃焼器内をデトネーション波が連続的に周回し、定圧燃焼より高い熱効率を狙うロケット・航空推進技術。","impact_summary":"高効率小型推進として各国の実証研究を促し、エンジン設計を再考させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"圧力利得燃焼","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"回転デトネーション,RDE,圧力利得燃焼,環状燃焼器","keywords_en":"rotating detonation,RDE,pressure gain combustion,annular combustor","key_researchers":["F. K. Lu","NASA researchers"],"key_works":["Rotating Detonation-Wave Engines (2014)"]},
  {"name_ja":"核熱ロケット","name_en":"Nuclear Thermal Rocket","definition":"原子炉で水素などの推進剤を加熱しノズルから噴射するロケットで、化学推進より高い比推力を深宇宙輸送に提供する概念。","impact_summary":"火星有人探査の移動時間短縮と推進剤削減の有力候補となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"原子力宇宙推進","era_start":1955,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"核熱ロケット,原子炉,水素,高比推力","keywords_en":"nuclear thermal rocket,reactor,hydrogen,high specific impulse","key_researchers":["NERVA program engineers","Robert Bussard"],"key_works":["NERVA Nuclear Rocket Engine Program Reports (1969)"]},
  {"name_ja":"電気推進","name_en":"Electric Propulsion","definition":"電力で推進剤を電磁的または静電的に加速し、小推力ながら高比推力を得る宇宙機推進方式の総称。","impact_summary":"静止衛星軌道投入、深宇宙探査、小型衛星の長寿命化を実現した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙電気推進","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"電気推進,高比推力,小推力,宇宙機","keywords_en":"electric propulsion,high specific impulse,low thrust,spacecraft","key_researchers":["Harold Kaufman","Ernst Stuhlinger"],"key_works":["Ion Propulsion for Space Flight (1964)"]},
  {"name_ja":"イオンエンジン","name_en":"Ion Thruster","definition":"キセノンなどをイオン化し、電場で高速加速して推力を得る高比推力推進機で、長時間運転による大きな総速度増分が特徴。","impact_summary":"小惑星探査や静止衛星の燃料削減に大きく貢献した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"静電推進","era_start":1964,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"イオンエンジン,キセノン,高比推力,小惑星探査","keywords_en":"ion thruster,xenon,high specific impulse,asteroid mission","key_researchers":["Harold Kaufman","JAXA Hayabusa team"],"key_works":["Ion Propulsion for Space Flight (1964)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ホールスラスタ","name_en":"Hall-Effect Thruster","definition":"磁場中のホール電流で電子を閉じ込め、電場によりイオンを加速する電気推進機で、衛星の軌道制御に広く使われる。","impact_summary":"商業衛星の軌道保持と全電化衛星を普及させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"プラズマ推進","era_start":1971,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ホールスラスタ,プラズマ,軌道保持,全電化衛星","keywords_en":"Hall thruster,plasma,station keeping,all-electric satellite","key_researchers":["Alexey Morozov","Soviet electric propulsion teams"],"key_works":["Stationary Plasma Thruster Development Reports (1971)"]},
  {"name_ja":"太陽電気推進","name_en":"Solar Electric Propulsion","definition":"太陽電池で得た電力をイオンエンジンやホールスラスタに供給し、長期間の小推力加速で高効率な軌道遷移を行う方式。","impact_summary":"小惑星探査、貨物輸送、月火星ロジスティクスの燃料効率を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"高効率宇宙推進","era_start":1998,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"太陽電気推進,イオンエンジン,小推力,深宇宙","keywords_en":"solar electric propulsion,ion thruster,low thrust,deep space","key_researchers":["NASA Glenn researchers","JAXA researchers"],"key_works":["Deep Space 1 Technology Validation Reports (1998)"]},
  {"name_ja":"低推力軌道最適化","name_en":"Low-Thrust Trajectory Optimization","definition":"電気推進のような小推力を長時間連続的に使う軌道について、最適制御で飛行時間、燃料、到達条件を設計する手法。","impact_summary":"電気推進ミッションの設計自由度を実用的に扱えるようにした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"最適軌道設計","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"低推力,軌道最適化,電気推進,最適制御","keywords_en":"low thrust,trajectory optimization,electric propulsion,optimal control","key_researchers":["John Sims","Bruce Conway"],"key_works":["Spacecraft Trajectory Optimization (2010)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ソーラーセイル","name_en":"Solar Sail","definition":"太陽光圧を大面積薄膜で受け、推進剤なしで微小な加速度を得て長期間の軌道変更を行う宇宙推進概念。","impact_summary":"燃料なしの深宇宙航行と小型探査機の新しい移動手段を示した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"非化学宇宙推進","era_start":1924,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ソーラーセイル,光圧,薄膜,無推進剤","keywords_en":"solar sail,radiation pressure,thin film,propellantless","key_researchers":["Friedrich Zander","JAXA IKAROS team"],"key_works":["IKAROS Solar Sail Mission (2010)"]},
  {"name_ja":"レーザー推進","name_en":"Laser Propulsion","definition":"外部レーザーのエネルギーを機体や推進剤へ照射し、加熱、アブレーション、光圧で推力を得るビームエネルギー推進概念。","impact_summary":"超小型探査機や打上げ補助の革新的推進として研究されている。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"ビーム推進","era_start":1970,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"レーザー推進,ビームエネルギー,光圧,アブレーション","keywords_en":"laser propulsion,beamed energy,light pressure,ablation","key_researchers":["Arthur Kantrowitz","Robert Forward"],"key_works":["Propulsion to Orbit by Ground-Based Lasers (1972)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ブレークスルー・スターショット","name_en":"Breakthrough Starshot","definition":"地上レーザーアレイでグラム級の帆付き探査機を相対論的速度へ加速し、近傍恒星系へ超短時間で到達する構想。","impact_summary":"恒星間探査を工学研究課題として再浮上させ、超軽量宇宙機研究を促した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"恒星間探査構想","era_start":2016,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"スターショット,レーザー帆,恒星間探査,超小型探査機","keywords_en":"Starshot,laser sail,interstellar probe,nanocraft","key_researchers":["Philip Lubin","Avi Loeb"],"key_works":["A Roadmap to Interstellar Flight (2016)"]},
  {"name_ja":"原子力電気推進","name_en":"Nuclear Electric Propulsion","definition":"原子炉で発電し、電気推進機へ大電力を供給して高比推力の長時間加速を行う深宇宙輸送向け推進概念。","impact_summary":"外惑星探査や大型貨物輸送の時間短縮と能力向上を期待させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"原子力宇宙推進","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"原子力電気推進,原子炉,電気推進,深宇宙","keywords_en":"nuclear electric propulsion,reactor,electric propulsion,deep space","key_researchers":["Ernst Stuhlinger","NASA Prometheus team"],"key_works":["Project Prometheus Reports (2003)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙太陽発電","name_en":"Space-Based Solar Power","definition":"宇宙空間で太陽エネルギーを集め、マイクロ波やレーザーで地上または宇宙機へ送電する大規模エネルギーシステム概念。","impact_summary":"宇宙インフラと地球エネルギー問題を結ぶ長期構想として研究されている。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙エネルギーシステム","era_start":1968,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙太陽発電,マイクロ波送電,大型構造,エネルギー","keywords_en":"space solar power,microwave transmission,large structure,energy","key_researchers":["Peter Glaser","John Mankins"],"key_works":["Power from the Sun: Its Future (1968)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙エレベーター","name_en":"Space Elevator","definition":"地球静止軌道を越える長大テザーを使い、昇降機で地上と宇宙を結ぶ輸送概念で、材料強度が最大の課題となる。","impact_summary":"非ロケット宇宙輸送の象徴として材料科学と軌道力学の研究を刺激した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"非ロケット宇宙輸送","era_start":1895,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙エレベーター,テザー,静止軌道,材料強度","keywords_en":"space elevator,tether,geostationary orbit,material strength","key_researchers":["Konstantin Tsiolkovsky","Bradley Edwards"],"key_works":["The Space Elevator (2003)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙テザー","name_en":"Space Tether","definition":"長いケーブルを軌道上で展開し、電磁力、運動量交換、重力勾配を利用して推進、発電、姿勢制御を行う概念。","impact_summary":"推進剤を減らす軌道変更やデブリ除去の代替手段として研究された。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"テザー宇宙工学","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙テザー,電磁テザー,運動量交換,軌道変更","keywords_en":"space tether,electrodynamic tether,momentum exchange,orbit change","key_researchers":["Giuseppe Colombo","Robert Forward"],"key_works":["Tethers in Space Handbook (1986)"]},
  {"name_ja":"電磁テザー","name_en":"Electrodynamic Tether","definition":"導電性テザーが地球磁場中を移動することで起電力とローレンツ力を発生し、発電や推進剤不要の軌道変更を行う技術。","impact_summary":"衛星軌道離脱、発電、宇宙ステーション実験で推進剤削減の可能性を示した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"電磁宇宙推進","era_start":1980,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"電磁テザー,ローレンツ力,発電,軌道離脱","keywords_en":"electrodynamic tether,Lorentz force,power generation,deorbit","key_researchers":["Mario Grossi","NASA TSS team"],"key_works":["Tethered Satellite System Mission Reports (1992)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙ロボティクス","name_en":"Space Robotics","definition":"宇宙環境でロボットアーム、ローバー、自由飛行ロボットが組立、保守、探査、捕獲を行うための機構、制御、認識技術。","impact_summary":"惑星探査、軌道上整備、宇宙ステーション建設の実行能力を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙自律システム","era_start":1981,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙ロボティクス,ロボットアーム,ローバー,軌道上作業","keywords_en":"space robotics,robot arm,rover,on-orbit work","key_researchers":["Canadarm teams","NASA JPL robotics team"],"key_works":["Space Shuttle Remote Manipulator System Reports (1981)"]},
  {"name_ja":"火星ローバー自律走行","name_en":"Mars Rover Autonomous Navigation","definition":"火星表面でローバーがステレオ画像、地形評価、経路計画を用いて障害物を避けながら科学目標へ移動する技術。","impact_summary":"通信遅延下での探査効率を向上させ、火星科学の到達範囲を拡大した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星ロボティクス","era_start":1997,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"火星ローバー,自律走行,経路計画,障害物回避","keywords_en":"Mars rover,autonomous navigation,path planning,obstacle avoidance","key_researchers":["NASA JPL robotics team"],"key_works":["Mars Exploration Rover Mobility and Autonomy (2004)"]},
  {"name_ja":"惑星ドローン","name_en":"Planetary Aerial Vehicle","definition":"火星やタイタンなどの大気中を飛ぶ小型航空機やヘリコプタで、地表ローバーより広範囲を高速に調査する探査概念。","impact_summary":"Ingenuityの成功により、惑星探査の移動手段に空中探査を加えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星航空","era_start":2021,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"惑星ドローン,火星ヘリコプタ,Ingenuity,空中探査","keywords_en":"planetary drone,Mars helicopter,Ingenuity,aerial exploration","key_researchers":["NASA JPL Ingenuity team","Bob Balaram"],"key_works":["Mars Helicopter Technology Demonstration (2021)"]},
  {"name_ja":"火星ヘリコプタ","name_en":"Mars Helicopter","definition":"地球の約百分の一の大気密度でロータ揚力を得るため、軽量構造、高速ロータ、自律制御を組み合わせた火星飛行技術。","impact_summary":"地球外動力飛行を実証し、将来の広域火星探査計画を変えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"低密度大気飛行","era_start":2021,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"火星ヘリコプタ,低密度大気,自律飛行,ロータ","keywords_en":"Mars helicopter,thin atmosphere,autonomous flight,rotor","key_researchers":["Bob Balaram","NASA JPL Ingenuity team"],"key_works":["Ingenuity Mars Helicopter Flight Demonstration (2021)"]},
  {"name_ja":"小型衛星合成開口レーダー","name_en":"SmallSat Synthetic Aperture Radar","definition":"小型衛星にSARを搭載し、雲や夜間に左右されず高頻度で地表を観測するリモートセンシング衛星概念。","impact_summary":"災害監視、海洋監視、商業地球観測の即時性を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"小型衛星観測","era_start":2018,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"小型SAR衛星,合成開口レーダー,地球観測,高頻度","keywords_en":"smallsat SAR,synthetic aperture radar,Earth observation,high revisit","key_researchers":["ICEYE engineers","Capella Space engineers"],"key_works":["Commercial SmallSat SAR Constellation Reports (2018)"]},
  {"name_ja":"リアルタイム地球観測","name_en":"Near-Real-Time Earth Observation","definition":"小型衛星群、クラウド処理、機械学習を組み合わせ、地球表面変化を短時間で検出・配信する観測運用概念。","impact_summary":"災害対応、農業、軍事監視、気候観測の意思決定速度を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"データ駆動宇宙利用","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"リアルタイム地球観測,小型衛星,機械学習,高頻度観測","keywords_en":"near-real-time Earth observation,smallsat,machine learning,high revisit","key_researchers":["Planet Labs engineers","ESA researchers"],"key_works":["Planet Dove Constellation Reports (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"衛星オンボードAI","name_en":"Onboard AI for Satellites","definition":"衛星上で画像認識、異常検知、データ圧縮、観測計画を実行し、通信量と地上依存を減らす人工知能応用概念。","impact_summary":"観測の即応性と自律運用を高め、深宇宙探査にも応用が進んだ。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙AIシステム","era_start":2018,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"オンボードAI,衛星自律,異常検知,画像認識","keywords_en":"onboard AI,satellite autonomy,anomaly detection,image recognition","key_researchers":["ESA PhiSat team","NASA JPL AI researchers"],"key_works":["PhiSat-1 Mission Reports (2020)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙機自律運用","name_en":"Autonomous Spacecraft Operations","definition":"通信遅延や接続制約の下で、宇宙機が状態監視、故障対応、観測計画、航法判断を自律的に実行する運用概念。","impact_summary":"深宇宙探査と大規模衛星群の運用負荷を下げ、即応性を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"自律宇宙システム","era_start":1999,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙機自律,故障対応,観測計画,深宇宙","keywords_en":"spacecraft autonomy,fault response,planning,deep space","key_researchers":["NASA Remote Agent team","JPL researchers"],"key_works":["Remote Agent Experiment on Deep Space 1 (1999)"]},
  {"name_ja":"モデルベースシステムズエンジニアリング","name_en":"Model-Based Systems Engineering","definition":"要求、機能、構造、挙動、検証をデジタルモデルで一貫管理し、複雑な航空宇宙システム開発を統合する方法論。","impact_summary":"複雑化する機体、衛星、ミッションの設計変更管理と検証を改善した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"システムズエンジニアリング","era_start":2005,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"MBSE,要求管理,デジタルモデル,検証","keywords_en":"MBSE,requirements management,digital model,verification","key_researchers":["INCOSE members","NASA systems engineers"],"key_works":["Systems Engineering Vision 2020 (2007)"]},
  {"name_ja":"デジタルエンジニアリング","name_en":"Digital Engineering","definition":"設計、解析、製造、試験、運用のデータとモデルを連結し、航空宇宙システムのライフサイクルをデジタルに管理する概念。","impact_summary":"開発期間短縮、設計品質向上、サプライチェーン連携を促進した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"デジタル開発方法論","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"デジタルエンジニアリング,モデル連携,ライフサイクル,開発効率","keywords_en":"digital engineering,model integration,lifecycle,development efficiency","key_researchers":["DoD engineering teams","NASA engineers"],"key_works":["Digital Engineering Strategy (2018)"]},
  {"name_ja":"AI支援空力設計","name_en":"AI-Assisted Aerodynamic Design","definition":"機械学習代理モデル、最適化、生成モデルを用いて空力形状探索を高速化し、CFDや風洞試験のコストを下げる設計概念。","impact_summary":"高次元設計空間の探索速度を上げ、革新形状の発見可能性を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"データ駆動空力","era_start":2018,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"AI空力設計,代理モデル,形状最適化,機械学習","keywords_en":"AI aerodynamic design,surrogate model,shape optimization,machine learning","key_researchers":["Youssef Marzouk","Antony Jameson"],"key_works":["Machine Learning for Fluid Mechanics (2020)"]},
  {"name_ja":"Physics-Informed Neural Networks","name_en":"Physics-Informed Neural Networks","definition":"ニューラルネットワークの損失関数に物理方程式や境界条件を組み込み、流体、構造、熱の解をデータと物理から学習する手法。","impact_summary":"CFD高速化、逆問題、実験データ同化の新しい道具として注目された。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"物理融合機械学習","era_start":2019,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"PINN,物理情報,ニューラルネット,CFD","keywords_en":"PINN,physics-informed,neural network,CFD","key_researchers":["Maziar Raissi","George Karniadakis"],"key_works":["Physics-Informed Neural Networks (2019)"]},
  {"name_ja":"不確かさ定量化","name_en":"Uncertainty Quantification","definition":"モデル誤差、製造ばらつき、環境変動、観測雑音が航空宇宙性能や安全余裕に及ぼす影響を確率的に評価する方法論。","impact_summary":"ロバスト設計、認証、リスク評価を定量的に行う基盤を与えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"確率的設計解析","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"不確かさ定量化,確率解析,ロバスト設計,リスク","keywords_en":"uncertainty quantification,probabilistic analysis,robust design,risk","key_researchers":["Roger Ghanem","Dimitris Xiu"],"key_works":["Stochastic Finite Elements: A Spectral Approach (1991)"]},
  {"name_ja":"マルチフィデリティ最適化","name_en":"Multi-Fidelity Optimization","definition":"低忠実度モデル、高忠実度CFD、実験データを統合し、計算コストを抑えながら航空宇宙設計を最適化する手法。","impact_summary":"高価な解析と試験を効率よく組み合わせ、設計探索を現実的にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"計算設計最適化","era_start":2000,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"マルチフィデリティ,代理モデル,CFD,設計最適化","keywords_en":"multi-fidelity,surrogate model,CFD,design optimization","key_researchers":["Joaquim Martins","Karen Willcox"],"key_works":["Multifidelity Optimization for High-Dimensional Aerospace Problems (2013)"]},
  {"name_ja":"多分野設計最適化","name_en":"Multidisciplinary Design Optimization","definition":"空力、構造、推進、制御、コストなど相互依存する複数分野を同時に扱い、航空宇宙システム全体を最適化する方法論。","impact_summary":"局所最適を避け、航空機や宇宙機の総合性能設計を体系化した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"統合設計工学","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"MDO,多分野設計,統合最適化,航空機設計","keywords_en":"MDO,multidisciplinary design,integrated optimization,aircraft design","key_researchers":["Jaroslaw Sobieszczanski-Sobieski","Joaquim Martins"],"key_works":["Multidisciplinary Design Optimization: State of the Art (1997)"]},
  {"name_ja":"エコデザイン航空機","name_en":"Eco-Design Aircraft","definition":"燃費、騒音、排出、材料リサイクル、製造エネルギーを含む環境負荷を、機体ライフサイクル全体で最小化する設計概念。","impact_summary":"航空機設計に運航性能だけでなく環境責任を組み込ませた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"環境適合航空","era_start":2010,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"エコデザイン,ライフサイクル,排出削減,騒音低減","keywords_en":"eco-design,lifecycle,emission reduction,noise reduction","key_researchers":["Clean Sky researchers","NASA Environmentally Responsible Aviation team"],"key_works":["NASA Environmentally Responsible Aviation Project Reports (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"航空脱炭素ロードマップ","name_en":"Aviation Decarbonization Roadmap","definition":"燃費改善、SAF、水素、電動化、運航効率、炭素除去を組み合わせ、航空の温室効果ガス排出削減を進める戦略概念。","impact_summary":"研究投資、機体開発、燃料供給、政策目標を同じ方向へ動かした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"持続可能航空政策工学","era_start":2021,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"航空脱炭素,SAF,水素,電動化","keywords_en":"aviation decarbonization,SAF,hydrogen,electrification","key_researchers":["ICAO researchers","NASA Sustainable Flight team"],"key_works":["U.S. Aviation Climate Action Plan (2021)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ゼロエミッション航空機","name_en":"Zero-Emission Aircraft","definition":"飛行中の二酸化炭素排出を実質的にゼロにすることを目指し、水素燃焼、燃料電池、電池電動などを用いる航空機概念。","impact_summary":"2030年代以降の旅客機開発目標として推進、貯蔵、認証研究を加速した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"脱炭素航空","era_start":2020,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ゼロエミッション,水素,燃料電池,電動航空","keywords_en":"zero emission,hydrogen,fuel cell,electric aviation","key_researchers":["Airbus ZEROe team","ZeroAvia engineers"],"key_works":["Airbus ZEROe Concepts (2020)"]},
  {"name_ja":"持続可能飛行実証機","name_en":"Sustainable Flight Demonstrator","definition":"次世代低燃費機体や推進技術を実機規模で検証し、将来旅客機の環境性能を大幅に改善するための実証計画概念。","impact_summary":"トラス支持翼など革新技術を認証可能な実機開発へ近づけた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"実証航空工学","era_start":2023,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"持続可能飛行実証,低燃費,トラス支持翼,実機試験","keywords_en":"sustainable flight demonstrator,fuel efficiency,truss-braced wing,flight test","key_researchers":["NASA Sustainable Flight Demonstrator team","Boeing researchers"],"key_works":["NASA Sustainable Flight Demonstrator Project (2023)"]},
  {"name_ja":"全電化衛星","name_en":"All-Electric Satellite","definition":"化学推進を大幅に減らし、電気推進で軌道投入、軌道保持、姿勢・軌道制御を行う衛星設計概念。","impact_summary":"通信衛星の打上げ質量を削減し、小型ロケットでの投入可能性を広げた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"電気推進衛星","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"全電化衛星,電気推進,軌道投入,質量削減","keywords_en":"all-electric satellite,electric propulsion,orbit raising,mass reduction","key_researchers":["Boeing satellite engineers","Airbus Defence and Space engineers"],"key_works":["First All-Electric Propulsion Satellites Reports (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"小型ロケット打上げサービス","name_en":"Small Launch Vehicle Services","definition":"小型衛星を専用または柔軟な軌道へ投入する小型打上げ機と運用サービスで、相乗りに比べて即応性を重視する。","impact_summary":"小型衛星市場の成長と軌道投入の柔軟性を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"商業宇宙輸送","era_start":2017,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"小型ロケット,小型衛星,専用打上げ,即応性","keywords_en":"small launch vehicle,smallsat,dedicated launch,responsiveness","key_researchers":["Rocket Lab engineers","Virgin Orbit engineers"],"key_works":["Electron Launch Vehicle Flight Reports (2017)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ライドシェア打上げ","name_en":"Rideshare Launch","definition":"複数の衛星を一つの打上げ機にまとめて搭載し、標準インターフェースと配備順序で低コストに軌道投入するサービス概念。","impact_summary":"小型衛星の打上げ単価を下げ、コンステレーション配備を容易にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"商業打上げ運用","era_start":2018,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ライドシェア,相乗り打上げ,小型衛星,低コスト","keywords_en":"rideshare launch,shared launch,smallsat,low cost","key_researchers":["SpaceX rideshare team","ESA Vega SSMS team"],"key_works":["SmallSat Rideshare Program Announcements (2019)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙港運用","name_en":"Spaceport Operations","definition":"打上げ、着陸、保安、燃料供給、地上支援、空域海域調整を統合し、宇宙輸送を継続的に実施する運用概念。","impact_summary":"商業宇宙輸送と再使用ロケットの高頻度運用を支える基盤になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙輸送運用","era_start":2010,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙港,打上げ運用,再使用,地上支援","keywords_en":"spaceport,launch operations,reuse,ground support","key_researchers":["FAA AST","commercial spaceport operators"],"key_works":["Commercial Space Transportation Forecasts (2010)"]},
  {"name_ja":"迅速再使用運用","name_en":"Rapid Reuse Operations","definition":"回収したロケットや宇宙機を短期間で点検、整備、再燃料化し、航空機に近い頻度で再飛行させる運用概念。","impact_summary":"宇宙輸送コストをさらに下げる鍵として整備性と診断技術を押し上げた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"再使用運用工学","era_start":2017,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"迅速再使用,整備性,再飛行,打上げ頻度","keywords_en":"rapid reuse,maintainability,reflight,launch cadence","key_researchers":["SpaceX operations teams","Blue Origin engineers"],"key_works":["Falcon 9 Booster Reflight Reports (2017)"]},
  {"name_ja":"火星サンプルリターン","name_en":"Mars Sample Return","definition":"火星表面で採取・封入した試料を火星上昇機、周回機、地球帰還カプセルで段階的に地球へ戻す複合探査概念。","impact_summary":"惑星保護、火星上昇、軌道ランデブーを統合する最難関探査として技術を進めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"複合惑星探査","era_start":2020,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"火星サンプルリターン,火星上昇機,試料封入,惑星保護","keywords_en":"Mars sample return,Mars ascent vehicle,sample caching,planetary protection","key_researchers":["NASA Mars Sample Return team","ESA MSR team"],"key_works":["Mars Sample Return Campaign Studies (2020)"]},
  {"name_ja":"月ゲートウェイ","name_en":"Lunar Gateway","definition":"月周回軌道に配置される小型宇宙ステーションで、月面着陸、深宇宙実証、国際協力、通信中継の拠点となる概念。","impact_summary":"月探査を継続的かつ国際的なインフラ構築へ発展させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"月周回インフラ","era_start":2017,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"月ゲートウェイ,NRHO,月探査,国際協力","keywords_en":"Lunar Gateway,NRHO,lunar exploration,international cooperation","key_researchers":["NASA Artemis team","ESA Gateway team"],"key_works":["Gateway Memoranda and Architecture Updates (2017)"]},
  {"name_ja":"近直線ハロー軌道","name_en":"Near-Rectilinear Halo Orbit","definition":"月と地球の三体力学を利用する長周期軌道で、月極域へのアクセス、通信、安定性のバランスからゲートウェイに採用された。","impact_summary":"月周回拠点と月面探査の新しい軌道インフラ設計を確立した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"三体軌道設計","era_start":2017,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"NRHO,近直線ハロー軌道,月ゲートウェイ,三体問題","keywords_en":"NRHO,near-rectilinear halo orbit,Lunar Gateway,three-body problem","key_researchers":["Kathleen Howell","NASA mission designers"],"key_works":["Near Rectilinear Halo Orbits and Their Application in Cis-Lunar Space (2017)"]},
  {"name_ja":"シスルナ空間輸送","name_en":"Cislunar Transportation","definition":"地球軌道、月周回、月面、ラグランジュ点を結ぶ輸送、補給、通信、航法を統合する地球月圏インフラ概念。","impact_summary":"月面基地、商業月輸送、深宇宙探査の中継網として重要性が増した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"地球月圏システム","era_start":2018,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"シスルナ,月輸送,補給,宇宙インフラ","keywords_en":"cislunar,lunar transport,logistics,space infrastructure","key_researchers":["NASA Artemis logistics team","commercial lunar payload teams"],"key_works":["Cislunar Transportation Architecture Studies (2018)"]},
  {"name_ja":"商業月面輸送","name_en":"Commercial Lunar Payload Services","definition":"民間着陸機を用いて月面へ科学機器や技術実証装置を配送し、政府ミッションの頻度と柔軟性を高める調達・輸送概念。","impact_summary":"月探査に商業サービスモデルを導入し、着陸機市場を形成した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"商業月探査","era_start":2018,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"CLPS,月面輸送,民間着陸機,商業探査","keywords_en":"CLPS,lunar payload,commercial lander,commercial exploration","key_researchers":["NASA CLPS team","Intuitive Machines engineers"],"key_works":["Commercial Lunar Payload Services Awards (2018)"]},
  {"name_ja":"月面水氷利用","name_en":"Lunar Water Ice Utilization","definition":"月極域の永久影に存在する可能性が高い水氷を採掘し、飲料水、酸素、水素推進剤へ変換する資源利用概念。","impact_summary":"月面基地と深宇宙輸送の補給コストを下げる戦略的資源とされた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"月面ISRU","era_start":2018,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"月面水氷,永久影,ISRU,推進剤","keywords_en":"lunar water ice,permanently shadowed region,ISRU,propellant","key_researchers":["NASA VIPER team","JAXA researchers"],"key_works":["Lunar Water Ice Resource Assessment Studies (2018)"]},
  {"name_ja":"月面原子力電源","name_en":"Lunar Fission Surface Power","definition":"月面の長い夜や永久影でも安定電力を供給するため、小型核分裂炉を用いる表面電力システム概念。","impact_summary":"月面基地、資源利用、極域探査の継続運用を支える候補となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙電力システム","era_start":2020,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"月面原子力,核分裂電源,極域,持続運用","keywords_en":"lunar fission power,nuclear surface power,polar region,sustained operations","key_researchers":["NASA Kilopower team","DOE researchers"],"key_works":["Kilopower Reactor Using Stirling Technology Demonstration (2018)"]},
  {"name_ja":"キロパワー原子炉","name_en":"Kilopower Reactor","definition":"小型核分裂炉とスターリング変換器により、月面、火星、深宇宙で数キロワット級の安定電力を供給する概念。","impact_summary":"太陽光に頼れない探査拠点と高電力ミッションの実現性を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙原子力電源","era_start":2018,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"キロパワー,小型原子炉,スターリング,宇宙電源","keywords_en":"Kilopower,small reactor,Stirling,space power","key_researchers":["Marc Gibson","NASA Glenn researchers"],"key_works":["KRUSTY Kilopower Demonstration (2018)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙放射線防護","name_en":"Space Radiation Protection","definition":"銀河宇宙線、太陽粒子イベント、捕捉放射線帯から乗員や電子機器を守るための遮蔽、予測、運用制限を扱う概念。","impact_summary":"長期有人月火星探査の安全性と質量設計を左右する課題になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"有人宇宙安全","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙放射線,遮蔽,太陽粒子,有人探査","keywords_en":"space radiation,shielding,solar particles,human exploration","key_researchers":["Francis Cucinotta","NASA Space Radiation Program"],"key_works":["Space Radiation Cancer Risk Projections (2012)"]},
  {"name_ja":"閉鎖生態生命維持","name_en":"Closed-Loop Life Support","definition":"水、酸素、二酸化炭素、廃棄物を再生循環し、長期有人宇宙飛行で地球からの補給を減らす生命維持システム概念。","impact_summary":"宇宙ステーション、月面基地、火星飛行の持続性を支える基盤となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"有人宇宙生命維持","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"生命維持,閉鎖循環,水再生,酸素再生","keywords_en":"life support,closed loop,water recovery,oxygen recovery","key_researchers":["NASA ECLSS team","Soviet BIOS researchers"],"key_works":["Controlled Ecological Life Support System Studies (1980)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙服工学","name_en":"Spacesuit Engineering","definition":"真空、温度差、微小隕石、放射線から乗員を保護し、運動性、生命維持、通信を提供する個人用宇宙船設計分野。","impact_summary":"船外活動、月面作業、将来惑星探査の人間作業能力を決定づけた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"有人宇宙システム","era_start":1965,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙服,EVA,生命維持,月面活動","keywords_en":"spacesuit,EVA,life support,lunar activity","key_researchers":["ILC Dover engineers","NASA EVA teams"],"key_works":["Apollo Extravehicular Mobility Unit Reports (1969)"]},
  {"name_ja":"人工重力","name_en":"Artificial Gravity","definition":"回転居住区や加速度により重力に似た環境を作り、長期宇宙滞在での骨量低下、筋萎縮、前庭影響を緩和する概念。","impact_summary":"火星航行や大型宇宙居住施設の人間工学設計で重要視された。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙居住工学","era_start":1950,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"人工重力,回転居住区,長期滞在,宇宙医学","keywords_en":"artificial gravity,rotating habitat,long-duration flight,space medicine","key_researchers":["Wernher von Braun","Gerard O'Neill"],"key_works":["The High Frontier (1976)"]},
  {"name_ja":"インフレータブル宇宙構造","name_en":"Inflatable Space Structures","definition":"打上げ時は小さく収納し、軌道上で膨張展開して大容積や大面積を得る居住モジュール、アンテナ、熱シールド構造。","impact_summary":"大型宇宙構造の打上げ制約を緩和し、低質量居住空間の可能性を示した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"展開宇宙構造","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"インフレータブル構造,展開構造,宇宙居住,大容積","keywords_en":"inflatable structure,deployable structure,space habitat,large volume","key_researchers":["NASA TransHab team","Bigelow Aerospace engineers"],"key_works":["TransHab Concept Studies (1997)"]},
  {"name_ja":"展開構造物","name_en":"Deployable Space Structures","definition":"打上げ時の収納容積を抑え、軌道上でアンテナ、太陽電池、ブーム、望遠鏡を展開する機構と構造の概念。","impact_summary":"大型観測、通信、発電を小型フェアリングから実現可能にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙構造機構","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"展開構造,アンテナ,太陽電池,ブーム","keywords_en":"deployable structure,antenna,solar array,boom","key_researchers":["Miura Koryo","NASA engineers"],"key_works":["Map Fold a la Miura Style (1985)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ミウラ折り","name_en":"Miura-Ori","definition":"平面を剛体パネルと折線で効率よく折り畳み、一方向の動作で大面積構造を展開できる折紙工学パターン。","impact_summary":"宇宙用太陽電池パネルや展開膜構造の設計に大きな影響を与えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"折紙宇宙構造","era_start":1985,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ミウラ折り,折紙工学,展開構造,太陽電池","keywords_en":"Miura-ori,origami engineering,deployable structure,solar array","key_researchers":["Koryo Miura"],"key_works":["Method of Packaging and Deployment of Large Membranes in Space (1985)"]},
  {"name_ja":"大型宇宙望遠鏡展開","name_en":"Deployable Space Telescope","definition":"打上げフェアリングを超える口径を得るため、分割鏡、展開支持構造、精密アラインメントを組み合わせる宇宙望遠鏡概念。","impact_summary":"JWSTにより大型赤外線観測を実現し、展開精密構造の可能性を示した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"精密宇宙構造","era_start":2010,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"展開望遠鏡,分割鏡,JWST,精密アラインメント","keywords_en":"deployable telescope,segmented mirror,JWST,precision alignment","key_researchers":["NASA JWST team","John Mather"],"key_works":["James Webb Space Telescope Mission Reports (2022)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙干渉計","name_en":"Space Interferometry","definition":"複数の望遠鏡や衛星の光波・電波信号を合成し、単一開口より高い角分解能を得る宇宙観測システム概念。","impact_summary":"系外惑星、重力波、ブラックホール観測の将来技術として研究された。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"分散宇宙観測","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙干渉計,編隊飛行,高分解能,分散望遠鏡","keywords_en":"space interferometry,formation flying,high resolution,distributed telescope","key_researchers":["NASA SIM team","ESA Darwin team"],"key_works":["Space Interferometry Mission Studies (1998)"]},
  {"name_ja":"重力波宇宙アンテナ","name_en":"Space-Based Gravitational Wave Observatory","definition":"離れた宇宙機間のレーザー干渉計で時空の微小な伸縮を測定し、低周波重力波を観測する宇宙ミッション概念。","impact_summary":"精密編隊飛行とレーザー計測の極限技術を推し進めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"精密宇宙計測","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"重力波,レーザー干渉計,LISA,編隊飛行","keywords_en":"gravitational waves,laser interferometer,LISA,formation flying","key_researchers":["ESA LISA team","NASA LISA team"],"key_works":["LISA Pathfinder Mission Results (2016)"]},
  {"name_ja":"レーザー通信","name_en":"Laser Communications","definition":"電波より短波長のレーザー光を用いて宇宙機と地上、衛星間で大容量データを送受信する光通信技術。","impact_summary":"深宇宙探査と地球観測衛星のデータ伝送能力を大幅に高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙通信工学","era_start":2013,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"レーザー通信,光通信,衛星間通信,大容量伝送","keywords_en":"laser communication,optical communication,inter-satellite link,high data rate","key_researchers":["NASA LLCD team","ESA EDRS team"],"key_works":["Lunar Laser Communication Demonstration (2013)"]},
  {"name_ja":"深宇宙光通信","name_en":"Deep Space Optical Communications","definition":"探査機と地球間でレーザー光を使い、従来電波より高いデータレートを実現する深宇宙通信技術。","impact_summary":"高解像度科学データの伝送を可能にし、将来探査の情報量を増やした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"深宇宙通信","era_start":2023,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"深宇宙光通信,レーザー,高データレート,探査機","keywords_en":"deep space optical communications,laser,high data rate,spacecraft","key_researchers":["NASA DSOC team","JPL optical communications team"],"key_works":["Deep Space Optical Communications Technology Demonstration (2023)"]},
  {"name_ja":"衛星間リンク","name_en":"Inter-Satellite Link","definition":"衛星同士が電波またはレーザーで直接通信し、地上局を介さずデータ中継、測距、ネットワーク運用を行う技術。","impact_summary":"低軌道通信網とGNSSの堅牢性、低遅延性、全球性を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙ネットワーク","era_start":2000,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"衛星間リンク,レーザー通信,低遅延,中継","keywords_en":"inter-satellite link,laser communication,low latency,relay","key_researchers":["Iridium engineers","SpaceX Starlink engineers"],"key_works":["Iridium Inter-Satellite Link System Reports (1998)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙インターネット","name_en":"Space Internet","definition":"多数の低軌道衛星、衛星間リンク、地上ゲートウェイを統合し、地球規模でインターネット接続を提供するネットワーク概念。","impact_summary":"遠隔地接続、災害通信、軍民両用ネットワークのあり方を変えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙通信ネットワーク","era_start":2019,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙インターネット,低軌道通信,衛星間リンク,広帯域","keywords_en":"space internet,LEO broadband,inter-satellite link,broadband","key_researchers":["SpaceX Starlink team","OneWeb team"],"key_works":["Starlink Broadband Constellation Deployment (2019)"]},
  {"name_ja":"量子衛星通信","name_en":"Quantum Satellite Communication","definition":"量子鍵配送や量子もつれを衛星経由で利用し、長距離で安全な暗号鍵共有や量子ネットワークを実現する通信概念。","impact_summary":"宇宙通信を量子情報技術と結びつけ、次世代セキュア通信を開いた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"量子宇宙通信","era_start":2016,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"量子衛星,量子鍵配送,もつれ,安全通信","keywords_en":"quantum satellite,quantum key distribution,entanglement,secure communication","key_researchers":["Pan Jianwei","Micius mission team"],"key_works":["Satellite-Based Entanglement Distribution over 1200 Kilometers (2017)"]},
  {"name_ja":"合成開口レーダー衛星","name_en":"Synthetic Aperture Radar Satellite","definition":"衛星の移動を利用して大きな仮想アンテナを形成し、昼夜天候に依存せず地表の高分解能画像を取得するレーダー観測。","impact_summary":"地形変動、災害、海洋、氷床監視を全天候で可能にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"リモートセンシング","era_start":1978,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"SAR,合成開口レーダー,地球観測,全天候","keywords_en":"SAR,synthetic aperture radar,Earth observation,all weather","key_researchers":["NASA Seasat team","ESA ERS team"],"key_works":["Seasat SAR Mission Results (1978)"]},
  {"name_ja":"干渉SAR","name_en":"Interferometric Synthetic Aperture Radar","definition":"複数時期または複数位置のSAR位相差を利用し、地形標高や地表変位をセンチメートル級で測定する技術。","impact_summary":"地震、火山、地盤沈下、氷河変動の観測精度を飛躍的に高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"衛星測地観測","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"干渉SAR,位相差,地表変位,測地","keywords_en":"InSAR,phase difference,ground deformation,geodesy","key_researchers":["Howard Zebker","Ramon Hanssen"],"key_works":["Topographic Mapping from Interferometric SAR Observations (1986)"]},
  {"name_ja":"小型衛星フォーメーションSAR","name_en":"Formation-Flying SAR","definition":"複数の衛星を協調飛行させ、同時または準同時観測で大きな基線や高頻度SAR観測を実現する概念。","impact_summary":"単一衛星を超える三次元観測と高時間分解能観測の可能性を広げた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"分散リモートセンシング","era_start":2010,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"編隊SAR,小型衛星,基線,高頻度観測","keywords_en":"formation SAR,smallsat,baseline,high revisit","key_researchers":["DLR TanDEM-X team","ESA researchers"],"key_works":["TanDEM-X Mission Concept (2010)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ハイパースペクトル衛星観測","name_en":"Hyperspectral Satellite Imaging","definition":"多数の狭い波長帯で地表や大気を観測し、物質識別、植生状態、鉱物、汚染などを詳細に推定する衛星観測技術。","impact_summary":"地球環境監視と資源探査にスペクトル情報を本格的に導入した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"光学リモートセンシング","era_start":2000,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ハイパースペクトル,衛星観測,物質識別,環境監視","keywords_en":"hyperspectral,satellite imaging,material identification,environment monitoring","key_researchers":["NASA EO-1 Hyperion team"],"key_works":["Hyperion Imaging Spectrometer on EO-1 (2001)"]},
  {"name_ja":"気候監視衛星","name_en":"Climate Monitoring Satellite","definition":"大気、海洋、陸域、氷床、放射収支を長期一貫観測し、気候変動評価に必要な地球システムデータを提供する衛星概念。","impact_summary":"気候科学、災害予測、国際政策の定量的根拠を支えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"地球システム観測","era_start":1978,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"気候監視,地球観測,放射収支,長期データ","keywords_en":"climate monitoring,Earth observation,radiation budget,long-term data","key_researchers":["NASA Earth Science teams","NOAA researchers"],"key_works":["Nimbus and Earth Radiation Budget Mission Reports (1978)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙天気観測","name_en":"Space Weather Monitoring","definition":"太陽フレア、コロナ質量放出、太陽風、磁気嵐を観測し、衛星、通信、電力網、有人宇宙飛行への影響を予測する概念。","impact_summary":"宇宙インフラと航空運航のリスク管理に不可欠な監視分野となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙環境監視","era_start":1995,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙天気,太陽フレア,磁気嵐,衛星保護","keywords_en":"space weather,solar flare,geomagnetic storm,satellite protection","key_researchers":["NOAA SWPC researchers","NASA heliophysics teams"],"key_works":["SOHO Mission Reports (1995)"]},
  {"name_ja":"航空機氷結モデル","name_en":"Aircraft Icing Model","definition":"過冷却水滴が翼やエンジンに衝突・凍結して空力性能と安全性を悪化させる過程を予測する気象・熱・流体連成モデル。","impact_summary":"防氷装置、認証試験、運航判断を支える重要な安全解析になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"飛行環境安全","era_start":1940,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"航空機氷結,過冷却水滴,防氷,安全","keywords_en":"aircraft icing,supercooled droplets,anti-icing,safety","key_researchers":["NACA icing researchers","NASA Glenn icing team"],"key_works":["Aircraft Icing Handbook (1991)"]},
  {"name_ja":"雷撃防護","name_en":"Lightning Protection","definition":"航空機や宇宙機が雷撃や静電放電を受けても構造、燃料系、電子機器の安全を保つための導電経路と保護設計。","impact_summary":"複合材機体と高度電子化機体の安全認証で重要性が増した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"電磁適合安全","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"雷撃防護,複合材,電磁適合,燃料安全","keywords_en":"lightning protection,composites,EMC,fuel safety","key_researchers":["FAA researchers","SAE committees"],"key_works":["Aircraft Lightning Protection Handbook (1989)"]},
  {"name_ja":"電磁適合性","name_en":"Electromagnetic Compatibility","definition":"航空宇宙機の電子機器が互いに電磁干渉を起こさず、外部電磁環境にも耐えて機能するよう設計・試験する概念。","impact_summary":"フライ・バイ・ワイヤ、衛星通信、電動航空機の信頼性を支えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空電子安全","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"EMC,電磁干渉,航空電子,認証","keywords_en":"EMC,electromagnetic interference,avionics,certification","key_researchers":["RTCA committees","MIL-STD engineers"],"key_works":["RTCA DO-160 Environmental Conditions and Test Procedures (1975)"]},
  {"name_ja":"統合モジュラーアビオニクス","name_en":"Integrated Modular Avionics","definition":"複数の航空機機能を共通計算資源と標準ネットワーク上で実行し、重量、配線、保守性を改善する航空電子アーキテクチャ。","impact_summary":"現代旅客機のソフトウェア集約化と認証プロセスを大きく変えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空電子システム","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"IMA,アビオニクス,共通計算資源,認証","keywords_en":"IMA,avionics,shared computing,certification","key_researchers":["ARINC committees","Airbus engineers"],"key_works":["ARINC 653 Specification (1997)"]},
  {"name_ja":"航空ソフトウェア認証","name_en":"Avionics Software Certification","definition":"航空機搭載ソフトウェアが安全要求を満たすことを、開発プロセス、検証、トレーサビリティ、試験で示す認証枠組み。","impact_summary":"高度自動化機体の安全性を支え、ソフトウェア開発規律を標準化した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"ソフトウェア安全工学","era_start":1982,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"DO-178,ソフトウェア認証,検証,安全要求","keywords_en":"DO-178,software certification,verification,safety requirements","key_researchers":["RTCA committees","EUROCAE committees"],"key_works":["DO-178B Software Considerations in Airborne Systems (1992)"]},
  {"name_ja":"複合材認証","name_en":"Composite Certification","definition":"複合材料構造の強度、損傷許容、製造ばらつき、修理性を証明し、金属とは異なる破壊挙動を認証に反映する考え方。","impact_summary":"ボーイング787やA350のような複合材主構造機の実用化を支えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"材料認証工学","era_start":2000,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"複合材認証,損傷許容,製造ばらつき,修理","keywords_en":"composite certification,damage tolerance,manufacturing variability,repair","key_researchers":["FAA composite experts","NASA ACT researchers"],"key_works":["Composite Materials Handbook CMH-17 (2002)"]},
  {"name_ja":"超軽量宇宙機","name_en":"Ultra-Lightweight Spacecraft","definition":"小型電子機器、薄膜、集積構造、チップスケールシステムを用い、質量を極端に減らして低コスト・大量展開を狙う宇宙機概念。","impact_summary":"探査機、衛星群、恒星間帆船の設計自由度を大きく広げた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"小型宇宙システム","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"超軽量宇宙機,チップサット,薄膜,大量展開","keywords_en":"ultra-light spacecraft,ChipSat,thin film,mass deployment","key_researchers":["Mason Peck","Breakthrough Starshot team"],"key_works":["Sprites ChipSat Demonstrations (2011)"]},
  {"name_ja":"チップサット","name_en":"ChipSat","definition":"数グラム以下の電子基板を衛星として利用し、通信、センサ、太陽電池を集積して多数を低コストで展開する宇宙機概念。","impact_summary":"宇宙機の最小化と大量分散ミッションの可能性を示した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"ピコ衛星工学","era_start":2011,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"チップサット,ピコ衛星,分散ミッション,低コスト","keywords_en":"ChipSat,picosatellite,distributed mission,low cost","key_researchers":["Mason Peck","Zac Manchester"],"key_works":["KickSat Mission Reports (2014)"]},
  {"name_ja":"オンデマンド衛星製造","name_en":"Responsive Satellite Manufacturing","definition":"標準化部品、デジタル設計、短期試験を用い、必要に応じて衛星を迅速に製造・打上げる即応宇宙能力概念。","impact_summary":"災害、防衛、通信復旧で宇宙システムの即応性を高める方向を示した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"即応宇宙システム","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"即応衛星,短期製造,標準化,迅速打上げ","keywords_en":"responsive satellite,rapid manufacturing,standardization,rapid launch","key_researchers":["DARPA teams","US Space Force researchers"],"key_works":["Responsive Space Architecture Studies (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙サイバーセキュリティ","name_en":"Space Cybersecurity","definition":"衛星、地上局、通信リンク、運用ソフトウェアをサイバー攻撃から守り、宇宙システムの機密性、完全性、可用性を保つ概念。","impact_summary":"衛星が重要インフラ化する中で、設計段階からのセキュリティ要求を強めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙システム安全保障","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙サイバー,衛星セキュリティ,地上局,暗号","keywords_en":"space cybersecurity,satellite security,ground station,encryption","key_researchers":["Space ISAC members","NIST researchers"],"key_works":["Cybersecurity Principles for Space Systems (2020)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙状況把握","name_en":"Space Situational Awareness","definition":"軌道上物体、宇宙天気、近傍接近、破片環境を観測・解析し、宇宙システムの安全運用に必要な情報を提供する概念。","impact_summary":"衝突回避、宇宙交通管理、宇宙安全保障の基盤情報を担う。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙監視工学","era_start":2000,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"SSA,宇宙状況把握,追跡,衝突予測","keywords_en":"SSA,space situational awareness,tracking,collision prediction","key_researchers":["T. S. Kelso","US Space Surveillance Network researchers"],"key_works":["CelesTrak Satellite Catalog Studies (2000)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙領域認識","name_en":"Space Domain Awareness","definition":"軌道物体の位置だけでなく、意図、能力、異常挙動、脅威を含めて宇宙領域の活動を理解する安全保障寄りの概念。","impact_summary":"商業・軍事衛星が増える中で、宇宙運用の透明性と抑止を重視させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙安全保障","era_start":2019,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙領域認識,SDA,脅威評価,軌道監視","keywords_en":"space domain awareness,SDA,threat assessment,orbital monitoring","key_researchers":["US Space Force analysts","Secure World Foundation researchers"],"key_works":["Spacepower Doctrine for Space Forces (2020)"]},
  {"name_ja":"地球防衛","name_en":"Planetary Defense","definition":"地球衝突の可能性がある小惑星や彗星を発見、追跡、特性評価し、必要に応じて軌道を変更する防災工学概念。","impact_summary":"天体衝突リスクを科学問題から国際的な工学防災課題へ変えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星防衛工学","era_start":1998,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"地球防衛,小惑星,衝突回避,軌道変更","keywords_en":"planetary defense,asteroid,impact avoidance,deflection","key_researchers":["NASA Planetary Defense Coordination Office","Alan Harris"],"key_works":["NASA Planetary Defense Strategy (2018)"]},
  {"name_ja":"運動インパクタ","name_en":"Kinetic Impactor","definition":"宇宙機を小惑星に高速衝突させ、運動量移行で軌道をわずかに変えて将来の地球衝突を避ける防衛技術。","impact_summary":"DARTにより小天体軌道変更を実証し、地球防衛を実験科学へ進めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星防衛技術","era_start":2022,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"運動インパクタ,DART,小惑星偏向,地球防衛","keywords_en":"kinetic impactor,DART,asteroid deflection,planetary defense","key_researchers":["NASA DART team","Andy Cheng"],"key_works":["DART Mission Results (2022)"]},
  {"name_ja":"重力トラクター","name_en":"Gravity Tractor","definition":"宇宙機が小惑星近傍でホバリングし、微小な重力相互作用を長時間加えて軌道を徐々に変える衝突回避概念。","impact_summary":"破砕を避ける精密な小惑星偏向方法として地球防衛研究を広げた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星防衛技術","era_start":2005,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"重力トラクター,小惑星偏向,ホバリング,精密制御","keywords_en":"gravity tractor,asteroid deflection,hovering,precision control","key_researchers":["Edward Lu","Stanley Love"],"key_works":["Gravitational Tractor for Towing Asteroids (2005)"]},
  {"name_ja":"再突入ブラックアウト対策","name_en":"Reentry Communication Blackout Mitigation","definition":"再突入時のプラズマ鞘が電波を遮断する問題に対し、周波数選択、磁場、リレー衛星、形状制御で通信維持を図る技術。","impact_summary":"有人宇宙船と再突入機の安全監視、遠隔制御、データ取得を改善した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"再突入通信","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"通信ブラックアウト,再突入,プラズマ鞘,通信維持","keywords_en":"communication blackout,reentry,plasma sheath,link maintenance","key_researchers":["NASA reentry researchers"],"key_works":["Radio Blackout During Reentry Studies (1962)"]},
  {"name_ja":"エアデータシステム","name_en":"Air Data System","definition":"ピトー管、静圧孔、迎角センサなどから速度、高度、マッハ数、迎角を推定し、飛行制御と表示へ供給する計測システム。","impact_summary":"安全な操縦、自動操縦、飛行試験データ取得の基本インフラとなった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空計測","era_start":1910,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"エアデータ,ピトー管,迎角,対気速度","keywords_en":"air data,pitot tube,angle of attack,airspeed","key_researchers":["Henri Pitot","NACA researchers"],"key_works":["Air Data System Calibration Reports (1950)"]},
  {"name_ja":"飛行試験同定","name_en":"Flight Test System Identification","definition":"飛行試験で得た入力と応答データから空力微係数、質量特性、制御モデルを推定し、解析モデルを検証する手法。","impact_summary":"機体認証、制御則調整、シミュレータ精度向上に不可欠となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"飛行試験工学","era_start":1970,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"飛行試験,システム同定,空力微係数,モデル検証","keywords_en":"flight test,system identification,aerodynamic derivatives,model validation","key_researchers":["Vladislav Klein","Eugene Morelli"],"key_works":["Aircraft System Identification: Theory and Practice (2006)"]},
  {"name_ja":"風洞試験相似則","name_en":"Wind Tunnel Similarity","definition":"実機と模型のレイノルズ数、マッハ数、フルード数などを考慮し、風洞試験結果を実飛行へ外挿するための相似概念。","impact_summary":"模型試験を航空機設計の信頼できる証拠へ変換する基盤となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"実験空気力学","era_start":1901,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"風洞,相似則,レイノルズ数,マッハ数","keywords_en":"wind tunnel,similarity,Reynolds number,Mach number","key_researchers":["Osborne Reynolds","Wright brothers"],"key_works":["On the Dynamical Theory of Incompressible Viscous Fluids (1895)"]},
  {"name_ja":"レイノルズ数効果","name_en":"Reynolds Number Effects","definition":"慣性力と粘性力の比であるレイノルズ数が、境界層状態、剥離、揚抗特性、模型試験外挿に与える影響を扱う概念。","impact_summary":"小型模型、無人機、高高度機、火星航空機の性能評価を左右する。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"流体相似","era_start":1883,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"レイノルズ数,粘性,境界層,模型試験","keywords_en":"Reynolds number,viscosity,boundary layer,model test","key_researchers":["Osborne Reynolds"],"key_works":["An Experimental Investigation of the Circumstances Which Determine Whether the Motion of Water Shall Be Direct or Sinuous (1883)"]},
  {"name_ja":"マッハ数相似","name_en":"Mach Number Similarity","definition":"流速と音速の比であるマッハ数を一致または補正し、圧縮性、衝撃波、波面抵抗を模型試験や解析で正しく再現する考え方。","impact_summary":"高速機とロケットの風洞試験、CFD検証に不可欠な相似条件となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"高速実験空力","era_start":1920,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"マッハ数,圧縮性,衝撃波,風洞試験","keywords_en":"Mach number,compressibility,shock wave,wind tunnel","key_researchers":["Ernst Mach","Adolf Busemann"],"key_works":["Photographische Fixierung der durch Projektile in der Luft eingeleiteten Vorgange (1887)"]},
  {"name_ja":"CFD検証妥当性確認","name_en":"CFD Verification and Validation","definition":"数値解の離散化誤差、実装誤り、モデル誤差を区別し、実験や解析解と比較してCFDの信頼性を評価する方法論。","impact_summary":"CFDを設計判断と認証補助に使うための信頼性枠組みを与えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"計算信頼性工学","era_start":1998,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"CFD,V&V,検証,妥当性確認","keywords_en":"CFD,V&V,verification,validation","key_researchers":["Patrick Roache","AIAA V&V committees"],"key_works":["Verification and Validation in Computational Science and Engineering (1998)"]},
  {"name_ja":"乱流遷移予測","name_en":"Transition Prediction","definition":"層流境界層が不安定化して乱流へ移る位置を、線形安定性、経験相関、数値解析で予測する空力設計技術。","impact_summary":"摩擦抵抗、熱流束、失速特性の予測精度を高める鍵となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"境界層安定性","era_start":1940,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"遷移予測,層流,乱流,安定性","keywords_en":"transition prediction,laminar,turbulent,stability","key_researchers":["Walter Tollmien","Hermann Schlichting"],"key_works":["Boundary-Layer Theory (1955)"]},
  {"name_ja":"eN法","name_en":"eN Method","definition":"境界層の線形不安定波の増幅率を積分し、経験的なN値に達した位置を遷移開始点とみなす層流遷移予測法。","impact_summary":"自然層流翼と低抵抗機体の実用設計に広く使われた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"遷移予測","era_start":1956,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"eN法,線形安定性,遷移,層流翼","keywords_en":"eN method,linear stability,transition,laminar wing","key_researchers":["A. M. O. Smith","N. Gamberoni"],"key_works":["Transition, Pressure Gradient and Stability Theory (1956)"]},
  {"name_ja":"自然層流翼","name_en":"Natural Laminar Flow Airfoil","definition":"圧力分布と形状を工夫して境界層の不安定化を遅らせ、吸込み装置なしで広い範囲を層流に保つ翼型概念。","impact_summary":"小型機、ビジネス機、次世代旅客機の摩擦抵抗削減に貢献した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"低抵抗翼設計","era_start":1939,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"自然層流,低抵抗翼,圧力分布,摩擦抵抗","keywords_en":"natural laminar flow,low-drag airfoil,pressure distribution,skin friction","key_researchers":["NACA researchers","Richard Eppler"],"key_works":["NACA 6-Series Airfoils Reports (1945)"]},
  {"name_ja":"高高度長時間滞空機","name_en":"High-Altitude Long-Endurance Aircraft","definition":"成層圏付近を長時間飛行し、通信中継や観測を行う航空機概念で、軽量構造、高効率翼、太陽電池が重要となる。","impact_summary":"衛星と航空機の中間プラットフォームとして観測・通信の選択肢を増やした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"高高度航空システム","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"HALE,高高度,長時間滞空,太陽電池","keywords_en":"HALE,high altitude,long endurance,solar power","key_researchers":["NASA Helios team","AeroVironment engineers"],"key_works":["Helios Prototype Flight Reports (2001)"]},
  {"name_ja":"太陽電池航空機","name_en":"Solar-Powered Aircraft","definition":"太陽電池で発電し、電動推進と蓄電を組み合わせて昼夜飛行や長時間滞空を目指す航空機概念。","impact_summary":"高高度通信、環境観測、電動航空の実証に重要な役割を果たした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"再生可能航空","era_start":1974,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"太陽電池航空機,電動推進,長時間滞空,高高度","keywords_en":"solar aircraft,electric propulsion,long endurance,high altitude","key_researchers":["Paul MacCready","AeroVironment engineers"],"key_works":["Solar Challenger Flight Reports (1981)"]},
  {"name_ja":"成層圏プラットフォーム","name_en":"High-Altitude Platform Station","definition":"成層圏に長時間滞空する航空機や気球を通信・観測基地として利用し、衛星より低遅延で広域サービスを提供する概念。","impact_summary":"災害通信、遠隔地接続、地球観測の柔軟なインフラ候補となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"成層圏航空システム","era_start":2000,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"HAPS,成層圏,通信中継,高高度滞空","keywords_en":"HAPS,stratosphere,communication relay,high-altitude endurance","key_researchers":["AeroVironment engineers","SoftBank HAPS team"],"key_works":["High Altitude Platform Station Studies (2000)"]},
  {"name_ja":"成層圏気球","name_en":"Stratospheric Balloon","definition":"軽量気球を用いて成層圏へ観測装置や通信機器を運び、長時間飛行や回収可能な科学観測を行う航空宇宙プラットフォーム。","impact_summary":"天文観測、大気科学、技術実証を低コストで実施する手段を提供した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"高高度プラットフォーム","era_start":1930,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"成層圏気球,高高度観測,科学ペイロード,低コスト","keywords_en":"stratospheric balloon,high-altitude observation,science payload,low cost","key_researchers":["Auguste Piccard","NASA Balloon Program"],"key_works":["Scientific Ballooning Handbook (1975)"]},
  {"name_ja":"再突入カプセル回収","name_en":"Reentry Capsule Recovery","definition":"大気再突入後に熱防護、減速、パラシュート、着水・着地装置を用いて乗員や試料を安全に地球へ戻す技術。","impact_summary":"有人宇宙飛行とサンプルリターンの最終段階を支える不可欠な能力となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"帰還システム工学","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"再突入カプセル,回収,パラシュート,熱防護","keywords_en":"reentry capsule,recovery,parachute,thermal protection","key_researchers":["NASA Mercury team","Soviet Vostok team"],"key_works":["Mercury Project Summary Reports (1963)"]},
  {"name_ja":"パラフォイル回収","name_en":"Parafoil Recovery","definition":"操縦可能な柔軟翼パラシュートを用い、再突入カプセル、無人機、ロケット部品を目標地点へ誘導して回収する方式。","impact_summary":"精密回収と再使用運用の可能性を高め、着地点分散を縮小した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"回収誘導システム","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"パラフォイル,回収,誘導降下,再使用","keywords_en":"parafoil,recovery,guided descent,reuse","key_researchers":["NASA recovery researchers"],"key_works":["Guided Parafoil Recovery System Studies (1990)"]},
  {"name_ja":"パラシュート空力","name_en":"Parachute Aerodynamics","definition":"柔軟膜が膨張して抗力を生む非定常流体構造連成を扱い、再突入機、火星着陸機、航空機脱出装置に使われる。","impact_summary":"惑星着陸と回収システムの減速性能、安全余裕を決める重要分野となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"柔軟構造空力","era_start":1910,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"パラシュート,減速,流体構造連成,火星着陸","keywords_en":"parachute,deceleration,fluid-structure interaction,Mars landing","key_researchers":["Theodore Knacke","NASA EDL teams"],"key_works":["Parachute Recovery Systems Design Manual (1992)"]},
  {"name_ja":"膨張式減速機","name_en":"Inflatable Aerodynamic Decelerator","definition":"再突入時に展開・膨張する大面積熱シールドや空力減速体で、従来フェアリング制約を超える大質量着陸を可能にする技術。","impact_summary":"火星大型貨物着陸や再突入回収の質量制約を緩和する候補となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"先進EDL技術","era_start":2012,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"膨張式減速機,HIAD,熱シールド,火星着陸","keywords_en":"inflatable decelerator,HIAD,heat shield,Mars landing","key_researchers":["NASA HIAD team"],"key_works":["Inflatable Reentry Vehicle Experiment IRVE-3 (2012)"]},
  {"name_ja":"低密度超音速減速機","name_en":"Low-Density Supersonic Decelerator","definition":"火星の薄い大気で大型着陸機を超音速域から減速するため、膨張式装置や大型パラシュートを用いるEDL技術。","impact_summary":"将来火星大型着陸の鍵として超音速減速技術の限界を明らかにした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"火星EDL","era_start":2014,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"LDSD,火星大気,超音速減速,大型着陸","keywords_en":"LDSD,Mars atmosphere,supersonic deceleration,large landing","key_researchers":["NASA LDSD team"],"key_works":["Low-Density Supersonic Decelerator Flight Tests (2014)"]},
  {"name_ja":"グリーン推進剤","name_en":"Green Propellant","definition":"ヒドラジンより毒性や取扱リスクが低い推進剤を用い、衛星や探査機のスラスタ運用を安全・高性能化する推進概念。","impact_summary":"衛星製造と地上運用の安全性を高め、規制対応と性能向上を両立させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"衛星推進","era_start":2010,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"グリーン推進剤,低毒性,衛星スラスタ,ヒドラジン代替","keywords_en":"green propellant,low toxicity,satellite thruster,hydrazine alternative","key_researchers":["NASA GPIM team","ECAPS engineers"],"key_works":["Green Propellant Infusion Mission Reports (2019)"]},
  {"name_ja":"水推進スラスタ","name_en":"Water Propulsion Thruster","definition":"水を推進剤として電気分解、加熱、蒸気噴射などで推力を得る小型衛星向け安全・低コスト推進技術。","impact_summary":"キューブサットの軌道変更と安全な地上取扱いを可能にする候補となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"小型衛星推進","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"水推進,小型衛星,電気分解,低毒性","keywords_en":"water propulsion,smallsat,electrolysis,low toxicity","key_researchers":["Tethers Unlimited engineers","Pale Blue engineers"],"key_works":["Water Electrolysis Propulsion for CubeSats (2017)"]},
  {"name_ja":"コールドガススラスタ","name_en":"Cold Gas Thruster","definition":"高圧ガスを加熱燃焼せずノズルから噴射して小推力を得る単純で信頼性の高い姿勢・軌道制御用推進装置。","impact_summary":"小型衛星、宇宙機姿勢制御、初期実証機で安全な推進手段を提供した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"衛星推進","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"コールドガス,スラスタ,姿勢制御,小型衛星","keywords_en":"cold gas,thruster,attitude control,smallsat","key_researchers":["NASA spacecraft engineers"],"key_works":["Spacecraft Propulsion Analysis and Design (1995)"]},
  {"name_ja":"モノプロペラントスラスタ","name_en":"Monopropellant Thruster","definition":"単一推進剤を触媒で分解し、高温ガスを噴射して推力を得る衛星姿勢・軌道制御用の実用的化学推進装置。","impact_summary":"長年にわたり衛星姿勢制御と軌道保持の標準技術として使われた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"衛星化学推進","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"モノプロペラント,ヒドラジン,触媒,衛星推進","keywords_en":"monopropellant,hydrazine,catalyst,satellite propulsion","key_researchers":["NASA propulsion engineers"],"key_works":["Hydrazine Monopropellant Propulsion Systems (1960)"]},
  {"name_ja":"二液式スラスタ","name_en":"Bipropellant Thruster","definition":"燃料と酸化剤を別々に供給して燃焼させ、衛星の軌道投入や大きな軌道変更に必要な比較的高い推力を得る装置。","impact_summary":"静止衛星投入、探査機軌道修正、着陸機推進の主力技術となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙化学推進","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"二液式,燃料,酸化剤,軌道変更","keywords_en":"bipropellant,fuel,oxidizer,orbit maneuver","key_researchers":["Aerojet engineers","NASA propulsion teams"],"key_works":["Spacecraft Propulsion Analysis and Design (1995)"]},
  {"name_ja":"軌道上燃料補給","name_en":"On-Orbit Refueling","definition":"宇宙機へ軌道上で推進剤を移送し、寿命延長、再使用輸送、深宇宙ミッションの段階的補給を可能にする技術概念。","impact_summary":"宇宙機を使い捨てから補給可能なインフラへ変える鍵となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙ロジスティクス","era_start":2010,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"軌道上燃料補給,推進剤移送,寿命延長,再使用","keywords_en":"on-orbit refueling,propellant transfer,life extension,reuse","key_researchers":["NASA Restore-L team","Northrop Grumman MEV team"],"key_works":["Robotic Refueling Mission Reports (2011)"]},
  {"name_ja":"極低温推進剤管理","name_en":"Cryogenic Propellant Management","definition":"液体水素や液体酸素などの極低温推進剤を、長期宇宙滞在で蒸発損失を抑えながら貯蔵・移送する熱流体技術。","impact_summary":"月火星輸送、燃料補給、上段再始動の実現性を左右する重要課題となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙熱流体","era_start":2010,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"極低温推進剤,蒸発損失,液体水素,推進剤移送","keywords_en":"cryogenic propellant,boil-off,liquid hydrogen,propellant transfer","key_researchers":["NASA Glenn researchers","ULA engineers"],"key_works":["Cryogenic Fluid Management Technology Demonstration Studies (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ゼロボイルオフ貯蔵","name_en":"Zero-Boil-Off Storage","definition":"冷凍機、断熱、多層断熱材を組み合わせ、極低温推進剤の蒸発損失を実質的にゼロへ近づける宇宙貯蔵技術。","impact_summary":"長期月火星ミッションと軌道上推進剤デポの成立性を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"極低温熱制御","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ゼロボイルオフ,極低温,推進剤デポ,断熱","keywords_en":"zero boil-off,cryogenic,propellant depot,insulation","key_researchers":["NASA Glenn cryogenic teams"],"key_works":["Zero Boil-Off Cryogenic Storage Studies (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"推進剤デポ","name_en":"Propellant Depot","definition":"軌道上や月周辺に推進剤を貯蔵し、宇宙機へ補給する施設概念で、輸送を分割し深宇宙ミッションを柔軟化する。","impact_summary":"再使用宇宙輸送、月火星ロジスティクス、商業補給市場の基盤とされた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙補給インフラ","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"推進剤デポ,燃料補給,月火星輸送,宇宙インフラ","keywords_en":"propellant depot,refueling,lunar Mars transport,space infrastructure","key_researchers":["George Sowers","NASA architecture teams"],"key_works":["Propellant Depot Architecture Studies (2011)"]},
  {"name_ja":"スターシップ型完全再使用輸送","name_en":"Fully Reusable Heavy-Lift Transport","definition":"大型ブースタと宇宙船の両方を再使用し、軌道上補給と大質量輸送で月火星や大規模衛星配備を狙う輸送概念。","impact_summary":"宇宙輸送の単価、搭載量、ミッション規模に関する前提を大きく変えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"完全再使用宇宙輸送","era_start":2019,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"完全再使用,大型打上げ,軌道上補給,月火星","keywords_en":"fully reusable,heavy lift,on-orbit refueling,Moon Mars","key_researchers":["SpaceX Starship team"],"key_works":["Starship System Updates (2019)"]},
  {"name_ja":"スーパー・ヘビーリフトロケット","name_en":"Super Heavy-Lift Launch Vehicle","definition":"数十トンから百トン超を低軌道へ投入できる大型打上げ機で、月火星探査や大規模宇宙構造物の輸送に用いられる。","impact_summary":"有人深宇宙探査と大質量宇宙インフラ構築の輸送能力を提供した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"大型宇宙輸送","era_start":1967,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"超大型ロケット,大質量輸送,月探査,低軌道","keywords_en":"super heavy lift,large payload,lunar exploration,LEO","key_researchers":["Wernher von Braun","NASA SLS team"],"key_works":["Saturn V Flight Manuals (1967)"]},
  {"name_ja":"アルテミス計画アーキテクチャ","name_en":"Artemis Program Architecture","definition":"SLS、Orion、Gateway、商業月着陸船、国際協力を組み合わせ、有人月面復帰と持続的月探査を実現する体系。","impact_summary":"月探査を政府単独から商業・国際連携の持続型計画へ転換した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"有人月探査システム","era_start":2019,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"アルテミス,有人月探査,SLS,Gateway","keywords_en":"Artemis,human lunar exploration,SLS,Gateway","key_researchers":["NASA Artemis team","international partners"],"key_works":["Artemis Plan (2020)"]},
  {"name_ja":"商業乗員輸送","name_en":"Commercial Crew Transportation","definition":"民間企業が開発・運用する宇宙船で乗員を低軌道へ輸送し、政府がサービスとして購入する有人宇宙輸送モデル。","impact_summary":"有人宇宙輸送に商業競争と再使用運用を導入し、低軌道アクセスを拡大した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"商業有人宇宙輸送","era_start":2020,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"商業乗員輸送,低軌道,有人宇宙船,サービス調達","keywords_en":"commercial crew,LEO,human spacecraft,service procurement","key_researchers":["NASA Commercial Crew Program","SpaceX Crew Dragon team"],"key_works":["Crew Dragon Demo-2 Mission Reports (2020)"]},
  {"name_ja":"商業宇宙ステーション","name_en":"Commercial Space Station","definition":"民間主体が低軌道に居住・研究・製造施設を構築し、政府や企業が利用サービスを購入する宇宙インフラ概念。","impact_summary":"ISS後の低軌道利用を商業市場へ移行させる中心構想となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"商業低軌道経済","era_start":2021,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"商業宇宙ステーション,低軌道経済,民間運用,研究施設","keywords_en":"commercial space station,LEO economy,private operation,research facility","key_researchers":["Axiom Space engineers","NASA CLD team"],"key_works":["Commercial LEO Destinations Awards (2021)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙観光","name_en":"Space Tourism","definition":"専門宇宙飛行士ではない顧客が、弾道飛行や軌道飛行を商業サービスとして体験する有人宇宙活動の概念。","impact_summary":"宇宙輸送を政府任務から民間体験市場へ拡張し、安全認証課題を生んだ。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"商業有人宇宙活動","era_start":2001,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙観光,弾道飛行,軌道飛行,商業宇宙","keywords_en":"space tourism,suborbital flight,orbital flight,commercial space","key_researchers":["Dennis Tito","Virgin Galactic engineers"],"key_works":["SpaceShipOne Flight Reports (2004)"]},
  {"name_ja":"サブオービタル飛行","name_en":"Suborbital Flight","definition":"軌道速度には達しないが宇宙空間または高高度へ弾道的に到達し、短時間の微小重力や高速飛行を提供する飛行概念。","impact_summary":"宇宙観光、微小重力実験、再使用宇宙輸送実証の入口となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"弾道宇宙飛行","era_start":1944,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"サブオービタル,弾道飛行,微小重力,宇宙観光","keywords_en":"suborbital,ballistic flight,microgravity,space tourism","key_researchers":["Wernher von Braun","Burt Rutan"],"key_works":["SpaceShipOne X-Prize Flight Reports (2004)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙医学工学","name_en":"Space Medicine Engineering","definition":"微小重力、放射線、閉鎖環境が人体に及ぼす影響を測定し、対策装置、運動処方、生命維持へ反映する工学領域。","impact_summary":"長期ISS滞在、月火星探査、商業有人飛行の安全基盤を形成した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"有人宇宙健康工学","era_start":1961,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙医学,微小重力,放射線,有人探査","keywords_en":"space medicine,microgravity,radiation,human exploration","key_researchers":["NASA Human Research Program","Valery Polyakov"],"key_works":["Human Research Roadmap (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙酔い対策","name_en":"Space Motion Sickness Mitigation","definition":"微小重力移行時の前庭感覚不一致による吐き気や作業能力低下を予測し、訓練、薬剤、運用で抑える対策概念。","impact_summary":"有人宇宙飛行初期の作業効率と安全性確保に重要な役割を果たした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙人間工学","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙酔い,前庭,微小重力,有人宇宙","keywords_en":"space motion sickness,vestibular,microgravity,human spaceflight","key_researchers":["NASA flight surgeons"],"key_works":["Space Motion Sickness Studies (1980)"]},
  {"name_ja":"微小重力科学ペイロード","name_en":"Microgravity Science Payload","definition":"軌道上の微小重力環境を利用して、流体、燃焼、材料、生命科学の実験を行うために設計される宇宙実験装置。","impact_summary":"地上では観察しにくい物理現象を明らかにし、宇宙利用価値を示した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙実験システム","era_start":1973,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"微小重力,科学ペイロード,宇宙実験,材料","keywords_en":"microgravity,science payload,space experiment,materials","key_researchers":["Skylab science teams","ISS researchers"],"key_works":["Skylab Science Experiments Reports (1974)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙燃焼科学","name_en":"Combustion in Microgravity","definition":"浮力が弱い微小重力で燃焼、火炎伝播、すす生成、消火を調べ、宇宙火災安全と基礎燃焼を理解する研究領域。","impact_summary":"宇宙船火災安全基準と地上燃焼理論の双方に知見を与えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"微小重力流体燃焼","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"微小重力燃焼,火災安全,火炎,ISS","keywords_en":"microgravity combustion,fire safety,flame,ISS","key_researchers":["NASA Glenn combustion team"],"key_works":["Flame Extinguishment Experiment FLEX Reports (2009)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙熱制御","name_en":"Spacecraft Thermal Control","definition":"放射、伝導、蓄熱、ヒータ、ルーバ、ヒートパイプを用いて、宇宙機の機器と構造を許容温度範囲に保つ設計分野。","impact_summary":"衛星、探査機、有人船の信頼性と寿命を支える基本サブシステムとなった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙熱工学","era_start":1957,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"熱制御,放射,ヒートパイプ,衛星","keywords_en":"thermal control,radiation,heat pipe,satellite","key_researchers":["NASA thermal engineers"],"key_works":["Spacecraft Thermal Control Handbook (2002)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ヒートパイプ","name_en":"Heat Pipe","definition":"封入流体の蒸発・凝縮と毛細管力により、機械的ポンプなしで熱を高効率に輸送する受動熱制御デバイス。","impact_summary":"衛星機器の温度均一化と長寿命熱管理に広く採用された。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"受動熱制御","era_start":1963,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ヒートパイプ,相変化,毛細管,熱輸送","keywords_en":"heat pipe,phase change,capillary,heat transport","key_researchers":["George Grover"],"key_works":["Structures of Very High Thermal Conductance (1964)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ループヒートパイプ","name_en":"Loop Heat Pipe","definition":"蒸発器、凝縮器、補償器をループ状に配置し、長距離・高能力で熱を受動輸送する宇宙機熱制御装置。","impact_summary":"大型衛星や高発熱機器の柔軟な熱管理を可能にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"高度熱制御","era_start":1980,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ループヒートパイプ,受動熱輸送,衛星,高発熱","keywords_en":"loop heat pipe,passive heat transport,satellite,high heat load","key_researchers":["Y. F. Maidanik","NASA thermal teams"],"key_works":["Loop Heat Pipes: Theory and Practice (1993)"]},
  {"name_ja":"可変放射率熱制御","name_en":"Variable Emittance Thermal Control","definition":"表面の赤外放射率を温度や電気入力で変化させ、宇宙機の放熱量を能動的または受動的に調整する熱制御概念。","impact_summary":"小型衛星や月面機器の省電力熱管理を改善する候補となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"スマート熱制御","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"可変放射率,熱制御,スマート材料,省電力","keywords_en":"variable emittance,thermal control,smart material,power saving","key_researchers":["NASA thermal researchers","JAXA materials teams"],"key_works":["Variable Emittance Coatings for Spacecraft Thermal Control (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"小型衛星標準バス","name_en":"Small Satellite Standard Bus","definition":"電力、通信、姿勢制御、構造、熱制御を標準化した小型衛星プラットフォームで、多様なペイロードを迅速に搭載する。","impact_summary":"衛星開発の反復速度を上げ、商業コンステレーション展開を容易にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"衛星プラットフォーム工学","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"標準バス,小型衛星,プラットフォーム,短期開発","keywords_en":"standard bus,smallsat,platform,rapid development","key_researchers":["Surrey Satellite Technology engineers","Planet Labs engineers"],"key_works":["Small Satellite Standardization Studies (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ソフトウェア定義衛星","name_en":"Software-Defined Satellite","definition":"通信ペイロード、信号処理、ビーム形成、運用機能を軌道上でソフトウェア再構成し、需要変化に対応する衛星概念。","impact_summary":"通信衛星の柔軟性と寿命中価値を高め、デジタルペイロードを普及させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"再構成可能宇宙システム","era_start":2018,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ソフトウェア定義衛星,再構成,デジタルペイロード,ビーム形成","keywords_en":"software-defined satellite,reconfigurable,digital payload,beamforming","key_researchers":["Eutelsat Quantum team","Airbus engineers"],"key_works":["Eutelsat Quantum Software-Defined Satellite (2021)"]},
  {"name_ja":"デジタルビームフォーミング衛星","name_en":"Digital Beamforming Satellite","definition":"アンテナ素子信号をデジタル処理して複数ビームの形状、方向、容量を柔軟に制御する通信衛星技術。","impact_summary":"需要に応じた通信容量配分と周波数利用効率を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"衛星通信ペイロード","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"デジタルビームフォーミング,通信衛星,フェーズドアレイ,容量配分","keywords_en":"digital beamforming,communication satellite,phased array,capacity allocation","key_researchers":["ESA telecom teams","Airbus Defence and Space engineers"],"key_works":["Digital Transparent Processor Satellite Studies (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"フェーズドアレイアンテナ","name_en":"Phased Array Antenna","definition":"多数のアンテナ素子の位相を制御し、機械的に動かさずビーム方向を高速に変えるアンテナ技術。","impact_summary":"衛星通信、レーダー、航空機センサの高速走査と信頼性を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空宇宙電波システム","era_start":1950,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"フェーズドアレイ,電子走査,アンテナ,ビーム制御","keywords_en":"phased array,electronic scanning,antenna,beam steering","key_researchers":["Harold Wheeler","MIT Lincoln Laboratory researchers"],"key_works":["Phased Array Antenna Handbook (1994)"]},
  {"name_ja":"アクティブ電子走査アレイ","name_en":"Active Electronically Scanned Array","definition":"各アンテナ素子またはモジュールが送受信機能を持ち、ビーム形成、追尾、複数目標処理を高速に行うレーダーアンテナ。","impact_summary":"戦闘機、衛星、気象レーダーの探知性能と信頼性を大きく向上させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空電子レーダー","era_start":1980,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"AESA,電子走査,レーダー,送受信モジュール","keywords_en":"AESA,electronic scan,radar,transmit-receive module","key_researchers":["MIT Lincoln Laboratory researchers","Raytheon engineers"],"key_works":["Active Phased Array Radar Development Reports (1980)"]},
  {"name_ja":"合成視界システム","name_en":"Synthetic Vision System","definition":"地形、障害物、滑走路、航法情報をデジタル地図とセンサで統合し、操縦者へ視覚的に表示する航空機表示技術。","impact_summary":"低視程運航の状況認識を改善し、CFIT事故防止に貢献した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空ヒューマンファクター","era_start":2000,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"合成視界,状況認識,低視程,地形表示","keywords_en":"synthetic vision,situational awareness,low visibility,terrain display","key_researchers":["NASA Aviation Safety Program","FAA researchers"],"key_works":["Synthetic Vision Systems Project Reports (2005)"]},
  {"name_ja":"拡張視界システム","name_en":"Enhanced Vision System","definition":"赤外線カメラやミリ波レーダーで低視程中の滑走路や障害物を検出し、操縦席表示へ重ねて着陸判断を支援する技術。","impact_summary":"悪天候時の進入・着陸安全性と運航継続性を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空視覚支援","era_start":2000,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"拡張視界,赤外線,低視程,着陸支援","keywords_en":"enhanced vision,infrared,low visibility,landing aid","key_researchers":["Gulfstream engineers","FAA researchers"],"key_works":["Enhanced Flight Vision System Certification Reports (2001)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ヒューマンファクター工学","name_en":"Human Factors Engineering","definition":"操縦者、管制官、整備員と機械・手順・環境の相互作用を設計し、誤操作、負荷、状況認識低下を防ぐ分野。","impact_summary":"航空事故分析とコックピット設計、訓練、CRMに大きな影響を与えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"人間中心設計","era_start":1940,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ヒューマンファクター,状況認識,作業負荷,CRM","keywords_en":"human factors,situational awareness,workload,CRM","key_researchers":["Earl Wiener","Mica Endsley"],"key_works":["Human Factors in Aviation (1988)"]},
  {"name_ja":"クルーリソースマネジメント","name_en":"Crew Resource Management","definition":"操縦室内外のコミュニケーション、意思決定、リーダーシップ、相互監視を訓練し、人間エラーを減らす航空安全手法。","impact_summary":"航空事故の人的要因対策として世界の航空会社に標準化された。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空運航安全","era_start":1979,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"CRM,乗員協調,意思決定,人的要因","keywords_en":"CRM,crew coordination,decision making,human factors","key_researchers":["NASA Ames researchers","Robert Helmreich"],"key_works":["Resource Management on the Flightdeck (1979)"]},
  {"name_ja":"状況認識モデル","name_en":"Situation Awareness Model","definition":"環境要素の知覚、意味理解、将来予測という段階で操縦者や管制官の認知状態を捉える安全設計モデル。","impact_summary":"コックピット表示、訓練、事故分析、自律システム監視設計に影響した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空認知工学","era_start":1995,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"状況認識,知覚,理解,予測","keywords_en":"situation awareness,perception,comprehension,projection","key_researchers":["Mica Endsley"],"key_works":["Toward a Theory of Situation Awareness in Dynamic Systems (1995)"]},
  {"name_ja":"操縦者誘導振動","name_en":"Pilot-Induced Oscillation","definition":"操縦者、機体、制御系の遅れや利得が相互作用し、意図せず振動が増幅する操縦安定性問題。","impact_summary":"フライ・バイ・ワイヤ機と高応答機の操縦則設計に重要な教訓を与えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"操縦性評価","era_start":1940,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"PIO,操縦者,制御遅れ,振動","keywords_en":"PIO,pilot,control delay,oscillation","key_researchers":["Duane McRuer","NASA flight test teams"],"key_works":["Aviation Safety and Pilot-Induced Oscillations (1995)"]},
  {"name_ja":"飛行包線保護","name_en":"Flight Envelope Protection","definition":"迎角、荷重、速度、姿勢などが安全限界を超えないよう、飛行制御コンピュータが操縦入力を制限・補正する機能。","impact_summary":"民間機の過大操作や失速リスクを低減し、自動化安全を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"デジタル飛行安全","era_start":1988,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"飛行包線,制限保護,失速防止,FBW","keywords_en":"flight envelope,protection,stall prevention,FBW","key_researchers":["Airbus flight control teams"],"key_works":["A320 Fly-by-Wire System Reports (1988)"]},
  {"name_ja":"自動着陸システム","name_en":"Autoland System","definition":"計器着陸装置や航法センサと自動操縦を組み合わせ、低視程条件で接地から滑走までを自動的に行う航空機システム。","impact_summary":"悪天候時の定時性と安全性を高め、民間航空運航の信頼性を向上させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"自動操縦システム","era_start":1965,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"自動着陸,ILS,低視程,自動操縦","keywords_en":"autoland,ILS,low visibility,autopilot","key_researchers":["Smiths Industries engineers","BEA Trident team"],"key_works":["Trident Autoland Certification Reports (1965)"]},
  {"name_ja":"自動衝突回避システム","name_en":"Automatic Ground Collision Avoidance System","definition":"地形データ、飛行状態、予測軌道を用いて地面衝突の危険を検知し、自動回避操作を実行する安全システム。","impact_summary":"戦闘機事故を大幅に減らし、自律安全制御の有効性を示した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空安全自動化","era_start":2014,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"自動地形衝突回避,Auto-GCAS,安全,自動回避","keywords_en":"Auto-GCAS,ground collision avoidance,safety,automatic recovery","key_researchers":["NASA Armstrong team","US Air Force researchers"],"key_works":["Automatic Ground Collision Avoidance System Fielding Reports (2014)"]},
  {"name_ja":"衝突防止装置","name_en":"Traffic Collision Avoidance System","definition":"航空機同士がトランスポンダ情報を交換し、衝突リスクを検知して上昇・降下回避指示を出す航空安全装置。","impact_summary":"空中衝突防止の最後の防壁として世界の大型機に装備された。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空安全システム","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"TCAS,空中衝突,回避指示,トランスポンダ","keywords_en":"TCAS,midair collision,resolution advisory,transponder","key_researchers":["FAA TCAS team","MIT Lincoln Laboratory"],"key_works":["TCAS II Minimum Operational Performance Standards (1990)"]},
  {"name_ja":"地形認識警報装置","name_en":"Terrain Awareness and Warning System","definition":"地形データベースと飛行経路を比較し、制御された地表衝突の危険を操縦者へ早期警告する航空安全システム。","impact_summary":"CFIT事故を劇的に減少させ、航空機安全装備の標準になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空安全警報","era_start":1996,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"TAWS,地形警報,CFIT,安全装備","keywords_en":"TAWS,terrain warning,CFIT,safety equipment","key_researchers":["Honeywell engineers","FAA researchers"],"key_works":["Enhanced Ground Proximity Warning System Certification (1996)"]},
  {"name_ja":"電動垂直離着陸認証","name_en":"eVTOL Certification","definition":"分散電動推進、バッテリー、ソフトウェア、自律機能、垂直離着陸運用を含む新型航空機の安全基準を定める認証領域。","impact_summary":"都市航空モビリティ実用化の速度と機体設計方針を左右している。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"新航空機認証","era_start":2020,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"eVTOL認証,バッテリー安全,分散推進,都市航空","keywords_en":"eVTOL certification,battery safety,distributed propulsion,urban aviation","key_researchers":["FAA","EASA"],"key_works":["EASA Special Condition VTOL (2019)"]},
  {"name_ja":"バッテリー熱暴走対策","name_en":"Battery Thermal Runaway Mitigation","definition":"電動航空機や衛星でリチウムイオン電池の発熱連鎖を防ぐため、セル監視、隔離、冷却、排気、冗長設計を行う安全概念。","impact_summary":"電動航空、宇宙機電源、eVTOL認証の安全性を左右する核心課題となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"電動航空安全","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"熱暴走,リチウムイオン電池,eVTOL,安全","keywords_en":"thermal runaway,lithium-ion battery,eVTOL,safety","key_researchers":["NASA battery safety researchers","FAA researchers"],"key_works":["Lithium Battery Safety in Aviation Reports (2016)"]},
  {"name_ja":"高電圧航空電力システム","name_en":"High-Voltage Aircraft Power Systems","definition":"電動・ハイブリッド航空機で大電力を軽量配線で扱うため、高電圧配電、絶縁、アーク対策、熱管理を統合する概念。","impact_summary":"メガワット級電動推進を成立させるための基盤技術として重要性が増した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空電力工学","era_start":2018,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"高電圧,航空電力,電動推進,絶縁","keywords_en":"high voltage,aircraft power,electric propulsion,insulation","key_researchers":["NASA Electric Aircraft Testbed team","Airbus researchers"],"key_works":["NASA Electric Aircraft Testbed Reports (2019)"]},
  {"name_ja":"超電導航空推進","name_en":"Superconducting Aircraft Propulsion","definition":"超電導モータや送電を用いて高出力密度と低損失を実現し、大型電動航空機の質量課題を克服しようとする概念。","impact_summary":"メガワット級電動航空の長距離化を狙う先端研究として注目された。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"先進電動推進","era_start":2018,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"超電導,電動航空,高出力密度,低損失","keywords_en":"superconducting,electric aviation,high power density,low loss","key_researchers":["NASA Glenn researchers","Airbus UpNext researchers"],"key_works":["Superconducting Electric Machines for Aircraft Propulsion Studies (2018)"]},
  {"name_ja":"水素燃焼ガスタービン","name_en":"Hydrogen Combustion Gas Turbine","definition":"航空ガスタービンで水素を燃焼させ、二酸化炭素を出さずに推力を得る方式で、NOx、燃焼安定、燃料貯蔵が課題となる。","impact_summary":"大型機の脱炭素に向け、既存タービン技術を活かす道を示した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"水素推進","era_start":2020,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"水素燃焼,ガスタービン,NOx,脱炭素","keywords_en":"hydrogen combustion,gas turbine,NOx,decarbonization","key_researchers":["Rolls-Royce engineers","Airbus ZEROe team"],"key_works":["Hydrogen Combustion Engine Ground Test Reports (2022)"]},
  {"name_ja":"液体水素貯蔵航空機","name_en":"Liquid Hydrogen Storage Aircraft","definition":"低温液体水素を航空機内に安全に搭載するため、断熱タンク、配置、重量、蒸発管理を統合する機体設計概念。","impact_summary":"水素航空機の航続距離、客室配置、空港インフラ設計を左右する中核課題となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"水素航空システム","era_start":2020,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"液体水素,貯蔵タンク,断熱,水素航空機","keywords_en":"liquid hydrogen,storage tank,insulation,hydrogen aircraft","key_researchers":["Airbus ZEROe team","DLR researchers"],"key_works":["Hydrogen-Powered Aviation Studies (2020)"]},
  {"name_ja":"航空機ライフサイクル評価","name_en":"Aircraft Life Cycle Assessment","definition":"燃料製造、機体製造、運航、整備、廃棄までの環境負荷を定量化し、航空技術の真の排出削減効果を評価する手法。","impact_summary":"SAF、水素、電動化の比較を単純な飛行中排出から全体評価へ進めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"環境影響評価","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ライフサイクル評価,LCA,航空排出,環境負荷","keywords_en":"life cycle assessment,LCA,aviation emissions,environmental impact","key_researchers":["Clean Sky researchers","MIT aviation environment researchers"],"key_works":["Life Cycle Assessment of Aviation Fuels Studies (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"非二酸化炭素航空影響","name_en":"Non-CO2 Aviation Effects","definition":"NOx、 contrails、巻雲、粒子状物質が気候へ与える影響を評価し、航空の温暖化効果を二酸化炭素以外も含めて扱う概念。","impact_summary":"飛行経路最適化と燃料政策に、CO2以外の気候影響を組み込ませた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空環境科学","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"非CO2影響,飛行機雲,NOx,気候影響","keywords_en":"non-CO2 effects,contrails,NOx,climate impact","key_researchers":["David Lee","Volker Grewe"],"key_works":["The Contribution of Global Aviation to Anthropogenic Climate Forcing (2021)"]},
  {"name_ja":"飛行機雲回避運航","name_en":"Contrail Avoidance Operations","definition":"氷過飽和領域を予測し、航空機の高度や経路をわずかに変更して温暖化効果の高い持続性飛行機雲を減らす運航概念。","impact_summary":"低コストで航空の気候影響を下げる短期対策として注目された。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"気候配慮運航","era_start":2020,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"飛行機雲回避,氷過飽和,経路最適化,気候影響","keywords_en":"contrail avoidance,ice supersaturation,route optimization,climate impact","key_researchers":["Volker Grewe","Google Research aviation team"],"key_works":["Reducing Aviation's Climate Impact by Avoiding Contrails (2023)"]},
  {"name_ja":"データ駆動整備","name_en":"Data-Driven Maintenance","definition":"センサデータ、運航履歴、機械学習を用いて故障兆候を予測し、航空機や宇宙機の整備時期と部品交換を最適化する概念。","impact_summary":"稼働率向上、整備費削減、安全余裕の定量管理を可能にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"予知保全","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"予知保全,データ駆動,故障予測,整備最適化","keywords_en":"predictive maintenance,data-driven,failure prediction,maintenance optimization","key_researchers":["Rolls-Royce analytics teams","NASA IVHM researchers"],"key_works":["Integrated Vehicle Health Management Studies (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"統合機体健全性管理","name_en":"Integrated Vehicle Health Management","definition":"機体、エンジン、アビオニクス、構造の状態データを統合し、異常検知、診断、予後予測、意思決定支援を行う概念。","impact_summary":"航空機と宇宙機の安全運航、整備効率、ミッション継続性を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"健全性管理工学","era_start":2000,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"IVHM,健全性管理,異常検知,予後予測","keywords_en":"IVHM,health management,anomaly detection,prognostics","key_researchers":["NASA Ames researchers","Ian Jennions"],"key_works":["Integrated Vehicle Health Management: Perspectives on an Emerging Field (2011)"]},
  {"name_ja":"航空機サイバー物理システム","name_en":"Aircraft Cyber-Physical Systems","definition":"航空機の物理運動、センサ、制御ソフトウェア、通信ネットワークが密接に結合した安全クリティカルなシステム概念。","impact_summary":"自律化と接続化が進む航空機で、安全・セキュリティ統合設計を必要にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"サイバー物理航空","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"サイバー物理,航空機制御,ネットワーク,安全","keywords_en":"cyber-physical,aircraft control,network,safety","key_researchers":["Edward Lee","NASA autonomy researchers"],"key_works":["Cyber-Physical Systems: Design Challenges (2008)"]},
  {"name_ja":"自律航空機認証","name_en":"Autonomous Aircraft Certification","definition":"機械学習、認識、意思決定、自律制御を搭載する航空機について、説明可能性、検証、運用制限を含め安全性を証明する課題領域。","impact_summary":"AI航空機と無人機の社会実装に向け、従来認証手法の拡張を迫った。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"AI安全認証","era_start":2020,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"自律航空機,AI認証,検証,機械学習","keywords_en":"autonomous aircraft,AI certification,verification,machine learning","key_researchers":["EASA AI task force","FAA researchers"],"key_works":["EASA Artificial Intelligence Roadmap (2020)"]},
  {"name_ja":"説明可能AI航空システム","name_en":"Explainable AI for Aerospace","definition":"航空宇宙の認識、診断、計画AIがなぜ判断したかを人間や認証者が理解できる形で提示する設計・検証概念。","impact_summary":"AIの安全認証、運用監視、操縦者信頼を得るための重要条件になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"信頼できるAI","era_start":2018,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"説明可能AI,XAI,認証,自律システム","keywords_en":"explainable AI,XAI,certification,autonomous systems","key_researchers":["DARPA XAI team","EASA AI experts"],"key_works":["Explainable Artificial Intelligence Program Reports (2018)"]},
  {"name_ja":"航空宇宙用生成設計","name_en":"Generative Design for Aerospace","definition":"設計制約と目的関数を与え、アルゴリズムが多数の構造・形状案を生成して軽量性や性能を探索する設計手法。","impact_summary":"積層造形と結びつき、部品軽量化と設計探索の速度を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"計算創成設計","era_start":2018,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"生成設計,軽量部品,最適化,積層造形","keywords_en":"generative design,lightweight part,optimization,additive manufacturing","key_researchers":["Autodesk researchers","Airbus engineers"],"key_works":["Generative Design in Aerospace Structures Studies (2018)"]},
  {"name_ja":"航空宇宙量子センサ","name_en":"Quantum Sensors for Aerospace","definition":"原子干渉計、量子磁力計、量子時計などを用い、慣性、重力、磁場、時刻を高精度に測定する航法・観測技術。","impact_summary":"GNSS非依存航法、地下構造観測、深宇宙測定の精度向上を期待させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"量子航法計測","era_start":2020,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"量子センサ,慣性航法,原子干渉計,量子時計","keywords_en":"quantum sensor,inertial navigation,atom interferometer,atomic clock","key_researchers":["NASA quantum sensing researchers","ESA quantum technology teams"],"key_works":["Quantum Technologies in Space Studies (2020)"]},
  {"name_ja":"GNSS非依存航法","name_en":"GNSS-Denied Navigation","definition":"衛星測位が妨害、遮蔽、利用不能な環境で、慣性、地形照合、視覚、電波、量子センサを組み合わせ位置を推定する概念。","impact_summary":"防衛、都市ドローン、深宇宙、月面での自律航法能力を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"レジリエント航法","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"GNSS非依存,妨害耐性,視覚航法,慣性航法","keywords_en":"GNSS-denied,jam-resistant,vision navigation,inertial navigation","key_researchers":["DARPA PNT researchers","NASA navigation teams"],"key_works":["Assured Positioning Navigation and Timing Studies (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"月面測位航法時刻体系","name_en":"Lunar PNT","definition":"月周辺で測位、航法、時刻同期を提供する衛星・地上ビーコン・通信ネットワークの概念で、月面活動の基盤となる。","impact_summary":"月面基地、ローバー、着陸機、商業活動の運用精度と安全性を高める。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"月面インフラ航法","era_start":2021,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"月面PNT,測位,時刻同期,月探査","keywords_en":"lunar PNT,positioning,timing,lunar exploration","key_researchers":["NASA LunaNet team","ESA Moonlight team"],"key_works":["LunaNet Interoperability Specification (2021)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ルナネット","name_en":"LunaNet","definition":"月周辺の通信、測位、航法、時刻、検知サービスを相互運用可能なネットワークとして提供する月探査インフラ概念。","impact_summary":"複数国・商業主体の月面活動を共通サービスで支える枠組みを示した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"月通信航法インフラ","era_start":2021,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"LunaNet,月通信,月面PNT,相互運用","keywords_en":"LunaNet,lunar communications,lunar PNT,interoperability","key_researchers":["NASA SCaN team","ESA Moonlight team"],"key_works":["LunaNet Interoperability Specification (2021)"]},
  {"name_ja":"火星通信中継網","name_en":"Mars Relay Network","definition":"火星周回衛星が着陸機やローバーのデータを地球へ中継し、低電力表面探査機の通信容量と運用頻度を高める仕組み。","impact_summary":"火星表面探査の科学データ量とミッション継続性を大幅に向上させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星通信インフラ","era_start":2001,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"火星通信中継,周回衛星,ローバー,深宇宙通信","keywords_en":"Mars relay,orbiter,rover,deep space communication","key_researchers":["NASA Mars Relay team","JPL researchers"],"key_works":["Mars Odyssey Relay Operations Reports (2001)"]},
  {"name_ja":"火星大気飛行","name_en":"Mars Atmospheric Flight","definition":"低密度で二酸化炭素主体の火星大気中を、翼機、ヘリコプタ、グライダーが揚力を得て飛行する技術分野。","impact_summary":"地表ローバーを超える広域・高解像度探査の移動手段を開いた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星航空工学","era_start":2000,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"火星大気飛行,低密度大気,翼機,ヘリコプタ","keywords_en":"Mars atmospheric flight,thin atmosphere,airplane,helicopter","key_researchers":["NASA ARES team","JPL Ingenuity team"],"key_works":["ARES Mars Airplane Studies (2002)"]},
  {"name_ja":"タイタン航空探査","name_en":"Titan Aerial Exploration","definition":"濃い大気と低重力を持つタイタンで、ドローンや気球を用いて広域移動し、地形、化学、生命前駆環境を調査する概念。","impact_summary":"外惑星衛星探査に航空機型移動体を本格導入する道を開いた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"外惑星航空探査","era_start":2019,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"タイタン,Dragonfly,ドローン,外惑星探査","keywords_en":"Titan,Dragonfly,drone,outer planet exploration","key_researchers":["Elizabeth Turtle","NASA Dragonfly team"],"key_works":["Dragonfly Mission Selection Reports (2019)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ドラゴンフライ型ロータークラフト","name_en":"Dragonfly Rotorcraft Lander","definition":"タイタン表面で原子力電源を用いるマルチローター着陸機が、地点間を飛行しながら化学分析を行う探査機概念。","impact_summary":"低重力・濃密大気環境を活かした惑星移動探査の新しい標準を示した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星ロータークラフト","era_start":2019,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"Dragonfly,タイタン,ロータークラフト,原子力電源","keywords_en":"Dragonfly,Titan,rotorcraft,nuclear power","key_researchers":["Elizabeth Turtle","Johns Hopkins APL team"],"key_works":["Dragonfly: A Rotorcraft Lander Concept for Scientific Exploration at Titan (2018)"]},
  {"name_ja":"金星大気プラットフォーム","name_en":"Venus Atmospheric Platform","definition":"金星の高層大気で気球や飛行船を浮遊させ、比較的温和な環境から大気化学、気象、地表観測を行う探査概念。","impact_summary":"過酷な金星地表を避けた長期探査手段として再評価された。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星大気探査","era_start":1985,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"金星大気,気球,飛行船,大気探査","keywords_en":"Venus atmosphere,balloon,airship,atmospheric exploration","key_researchers":["Soviet Vega team","NASA HAVOC team"],"key_works":["Vega Balloon Mission Reports (1985)"]},
  {"name_ja":"小惑星着陸・ホッピング","name_en":"Asteroid Landing and Hopping","definition":"極低重力で通常の車輪走行が難しい小惑星表面を、跳躍、アンカー、反力制御で移動・着陸する探査技術。","impact_summary":"小天体表面の直接探査とサンプル採取の運用手法を確立した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"小天体表面移動","era_start":2018,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"小惑星着陸,ホッピング,低重力,サンプル採取","keywords_en":"asteroid landing,hopping,microgravity,sampling","key_researchers":["JAXA Hayabusa2 team","DLR MASCOT team"],"key_works":["Hayabusa2 MINERVA-II and MASCOT Reports (2018)"]},
  {"name_ja":"小惑星資源利用","name_en":"Asteroid Resource Utilization","definition":"小惑星に含まれる水、金属、揮発性物質を採掘し、推進剤、建材、宇宙製造材料として利用する構想。","impact_summary":"宇宙経済と探査補給の長期構想を広げたが、技術・経済成立性が課題である。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙資源工学","era_start":2012,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"小惑星資源,採掘,水,宇宙経済","keywords_en":"asteroid resources,mining,water,space economy","key_researchers":["Planetary Resources team","Deep Space Industries team"],"key_works":["Asteroid Mining Architecture Studies (2012)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙採掘ロボット","name_en":"Space Mining Robotics","definition":"月や小惑星で掘削、選別、搬送、処理を行うロボットシステムで、低重力、粉塵、通信遅延に対応する必要がある。","impact_summary":"ISRUを机上概念から実装技術へ進める重要な研究領域となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙資源ロボティクス","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙採掘,ロボット,ISRU,低重力","keywords_en":"space mining,robotics,ISRU,low gravity","key_researchers":["NASA Swamp Works team","JAXA robotics researchers"],"key_works":["Regolith Advanced Surface Systems Operations Robot Studies (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"レゴリス建設","name_en":"Regolith Construction","definition":"月や火星の表土を焼結、固化、3Dプリントして、着陸場、遮蔽壁、道路、居住構造を作る惑星表面建設概念。","impact_summary":"地球からの建材輸送を減らし、持続的表面活動の基盤構築を可能にする。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星建設工学","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"レゴリス,3Dプリント,月面建設,ISRU","keywords_en":"regolith,3D printing,lunar construction,ISRU","key_researchers":["NASA Swamp Works team","ICON lunar construction team"],"key_works":["Additive Construction with Mobile Emplacement ACME Studies (2017)"]},
  {"name_ja":"月面着陸場建設","name_en":"Lunar Landing Pad Construction","definition":"ロケット噴流によるレゴリス飛散と機器損傷を抑えるため、月面に舗装または固化した着陸場を構築する概念。","impact_summary":"高頻度月着陸と月面基地運用の安全性を高めるインフラ課題となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"月面インフラ工学","era_start":2020,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"月面着陸場,レゴリス飛散,噴流,インフラ","keywords_en":"lunar landing pad,regolith ejecta,plume,infrastructure","key_researchers":["Phil Metzger","NASA Swamp Works team"],"key_works":["Lunar Landing Pad and Blast Ejecta Studies (2020)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ロケット噴流レゴリス相互作用","name_en":"Rocket Plume-Regolith Interaction","definition":"月や火星で着陸エンジン噴流が表土を掘削・飛散させ、視界、機器、周辺設備に与える影響を扱う現象。","impact_summary":"月面着陸場設計、探査機保護、着陸誘導センサの信頼性に影響した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星着陸環境","era_start":1969,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"噴流,レゴリス,月着陸,飛散","keywords_en":"plume,regolith,lunar landing,ejecta","key_researchers":["Phil Metzger","Apollo analysis teams"],"key_works":["Apollo Lunar Module Plume Effects Studies (1969)"]},
  {"name_ja":"月塵対策","name_en":"Lunar Dust Mitigation","definition":"微細で帯電し研磨性の高い月塵が機械、シール、宇宙服、光学機器に与える影響を減らす材料・運用・清掃技術。","impact_summary":"長期月面活動の信頼性、健康、安全を左右する実務課題となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"月面環境工学","era_start":1972,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"月塵,帯電,摩耗,月面活動","keywords_en":"lunar dust,electrostatic charging,abrasion,lunar operations","key_researchers":["Apollo astronauts","NASA dust mitigation teams"],"key_works":["Apollo Experience Report: Protection Against Dust (1973)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙船防塵シール","name_en":"Dust-Tolerant Spacecraft Seals","definition":"月や火星の粉塵環境でハッチ、ベアリング、機構部が摩耗・漏洩しないよう設計するシールと機構保護の概念。","impact_summary":"表面基地、ローバー、宇宙服の長寿命運用に不可欠な設計課題となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星表面機構設計","era_start":2018,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"防塵シール,月塵,機構保護,ローバー","keywords_en":"dust-tolerant seal,lunar dust,mechanism protection,rover","key_researchers":["NASA Glenn tribology teams"],"key_works":["Lunar Dust-Tolerant Mechanism Studies (2018)"]},
  {"name_ja":"月面ローバー","name_en":"Lunar Rover","definition":"月面の低重力、真空、粉塵、熱環境に対応し、乗員や科学機器を移動させる車両システム概念。","impact_summary":"月面探査範囲を着陸点周辺から広域へ拡張した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"惑星表面移動","era_start":1971,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"月面ローバー,低重力,粉塵,広域探査","keywords_en":"lunar rover,low gravity,dust,wide-area exploration","key_researchers":["Boeing Lunar Roving Vehicle team","NASA Apollo engineers"],"key_works":["Lunar Roving Vehicle Operations Handbook (1971)"]},
  {"name_ja":"与圧ローバー","name_en":"Pressurized Rover","definition":"乗員が宇宙服を常時着用せず月面や火星表面を長距離移動できる、生命維持と居住機能を備えた惑星探査車。","impact_summary":"有人表面探査の範囲と作業時間を大きく拡張する手段となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"有人惑星移動システム","era_start":2020,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"与圧ローバー,月面移動,有人探査,生命維持","keywords_en":"pressurized rover,lunar mobility,human exploration,life support","key_researchers":["JAXA Toyota Lunar Cruiser team","NASA SEV team"],"key_works":["Lunar Cruiser Pressurized Rover Studies (2020)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙船ドッキング標準","name_en":"International Docking System Standard","definition":"異なる国や企業の宇宙船が相互にドッキングできるよう、機械、電力、通信、捕獲機構を標準化する枠組み。","impact_summary":"国際協力と商業宇宙船の相互運用性を高め、救難能力も向上させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙相互運用","era_start":2010,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ドッキング標準,IDSS,相互運用,宇宙船","keywords_en":"docking standard,IDSS,interoperability,spacecraft","key_researchers":["International Space Station partners"],"key_works":["International Docking System Standard (2010)"]},
  {"name_ja":"共通バーシング機構","name_en":"Common Berthing Mechanism","definition":"宇宙ステーションのモジュールや補給船をロボットアームで位置合わせし、構造・気密・電力接続する大型結合機構。","impact_summary":"ISSの組立と補給運用を支え、大型モジュール結合の標準となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙機結合機構","era_start":1998,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"CBM,バーシング,ISS,モジュール結合","keywords_en":"CBM,berthing,ISS,module connection","key_researchers":["NASA ISS engineering teams"],"key_works":["Common Berthing Mechanism Design Reports (1998)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙船環境制御生命維持","name_en":"Environmental Control and Life Support System","definition":"乗員宇宙船内の空気、水、温度、湿度、圧力、廃棄物を制御し、閉鎖環境で人間が生存できるようにするシステム。","impact_summary":"有人宇宙飛行の滞在時間を延ばし、ISS長期運用を可能にした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"有人宇宙システム","era_start":1961,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ECLSS,生命維持,空気再生,水再生","keywords_en":"ECLSS,life support,air revitalization,water recovery","key_researchers":["NASA ECLSS team"],"key_works":["International Space Station ECLSS Reports (2009)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙船火災安全","name_en":"Spacecraft Fire Safety","definition":"閉鎖・微小重力環境での発火、燃焼、煙拡散、検知、消火、避難を扱い、材料選定と運用手順に反映する安全分野。","impact_summary":"有人宇宙船の材料認証、消火装置、緊急手順の設計を規定した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"有人宇宙安全","era_start":1967,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙船火災,微小重力,消火,材料安全","keywords_en":"spacecraft fire,microgravity,fire suppression,material safety","key_researchers":["NASA fire safety researchers"],"key_works":["Apollo 204 Review Board Report (1967)"]},
  {"name_ja":"航空機客室与圧","name_en":"Aircraft Cabin Pressurization","definition":"高高度飛行で乗員乗客が安全に呼吸できるよう、客室圧力、換気、構造差圧、緊急降下を管理するシステム。","impact_summary":"高高度・高速旅客輸送を快適かつ安全に実現する基盤となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空環境制御","era_start":1938,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"客室与圧,高高度,環境制御,差圧","keywords_en":"cabin pressurization,high altitude,environmental control,pressure differential","key_researchers":["Boeing 307 engineers","Garrett AiResearch engineers"],"key_works":["Stratoliner Pressurization System Reports (1938)"]},
  {"name_ja":"航空機環境制御システム","name_en":"Aircraft Environmental Control System","definition":"空調、与圧、換気、温度湿度調整、防氷を統合し、乗員乗客と機器に適切な環境を提供する航空機システム。","impact_summary":"旅客機の快適性、電子機器信頼性、高高度運航を支える不可欠なサブシステムとなった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空機システム工学","era_start":1950,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ECS,空調,与圧,防氷","keywords_en":"ECS,air conditioning,pressurization,anti-icing","key_researchers":["Garrett AiResearch engineers"],"key_works":["Aircraft Environmental Control Systems Design (1980)"]},
  {"name_ja":"モアエレクトリック航空機","name_en":"More Electric Aircraft","definition":"油圧、空圧、機械駆動機能を電力駆動へ置き換え、効率、整備性、制御性を高める航空機システム設計概念。","impact_summary":"現代旅客機の電力需要を増やし、電動推進への技術的橋渡しとなった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空機電化","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"モアエレクトリック,電動アクチュエータ,電力システム,整備性","keywords_en":"more electric aircraft,electric actuator,power system,maintainability","key_researchers":["Boeing 787 teams","Airbus researchers"],"key_works":["More Electric Aircraft Technology Studies (1990)"]},
  {"name_ja":"電動アクチュエーション","name_en":"Electromechanical Actuation","definition":"油圧アクチュエータの代わりに電動モータ、ギヤ、ボールねじなどで操舵面や機構を駆動する航空宇宙機構技術。","impact_summary":"配管重量と保守負担を減らし、航空機システムの電化を進めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"航空機電動化システム","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"電動アクチュエータ,操舵面,油圧代替,モアエレクトリック","keywords_en":"electromechanical actuator,control surface,hydraulic replacement,more electric","key_researchers":["NASA actuator researchers","Airbus engineers"],"key_works":["Electromechanical Actuation for Flight Control Studies (1990)"]},
  {"name_ja":"空力形状ステルス","name_en":"Aerodynamic Stealth Shaping","definition":"レーダー反射を抑える形状と航空性能を両立させるため、面角、エッジ配置、内部搭載、空力安定性を統合する設計概念。","impact_summary":"軍用航空機設計で空力、構造、電磁特性の統合設計を加速した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"低観測性設計","era_start":1975,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ステルス,低観測性,レーダー反射,形状設計","keywords_en":"stealth,low observability,radar cross section,shaping","key_researchers":["Lockheed Skunk Works engineers","Pyotr Ufimtsev"],"key_works":["Method of Edge Waves in the Physical Theory of Diffraction (1962)"]},
  {"name_ja":"レーダー断面積低減","name_en":"Radar Cross Section Reduction","definition":"形状、材料、吸収体、エッジ処理により航空機やミサイルのレーダー反射強度を下げ、探知距離を短縮する技術。","impact_summary":"航空機の生存性設計を空力性能と同等に重要な設計軸へ押し上げた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"電磁設計","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"RCS,レーダー反射,吸収材料,低観測性","keywords_en":"RCS,radar reflection,absorbing material,low observability","key_researchers":["Pyotr Ufimtsev","Northrop engineers"],"key_works":["Fundamentals of the Physical Theory of Diffraction (1962)"]},
  {"name_ja":"飛行荷重スペクトル","name_en":"Flight Load Spectrum","definition":"航空機が寿命中に受ける突風、操縦、着陸、地上走行などの荷重履歴を統計的に表し、疲労設計へ使う概念。","impact_summary":"安全寿命と保守間隔を実運用に合わせて決定できるようにした。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"構造寿命評価","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"荷重スペクトル,疲労,運用荷重,寿命評価","keywords_en":"load spectrum,fatigue,operational loads,life assessment","key_researchers":["FAA researchers","NASA structures teams"],"key_works":["FALSTAFF Flight Load Spectrum (1976)"]},
  {"name_ja":"複合材衝撃損傷","name_en":"Composite Impact Damage","definition":"工具落下、雹、鳥衝突などで複合材内部に目視困難な層間剥離や繊維破断が生じる現象と評価技術。","impact_summary":"複合材主構造の点検、修理、損傷許容認証の重要課題となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"複合材損傷力学","era_start":1980,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"複合材,衝撃損傷,層間剥離,点検","keywords_en":"composite,impact damage,delamination,inspection","key_researchers":["Stephen Tsai","NASA ACT researchers"],"key_works":["Impact Damage in Composite Structures (1985)"]},
  {"name_ja":"バードストライク解析","name_en":"Bird Strike Analysis","definition":"飛行中に鳥が機体、エンジン、窓へ衝突する際の流体構造的荷重と損傷を解析し、耐衝撃設計と認証に用いる。","impact_summary":"エンジンファン、風防、前縁構造の安全基準と試験法を発展させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"衝撃安全工学","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"バードストライク,衝撃解析,エンジン,認証","keywords_en":"bird strike,impact analysis,engine,certification","key_researchers":["FAA researchers","engine certification teams"],"key_works":["Bird Ingestion Certification Standards (1960)"]},
  {"name_ja":"エンジンブレードアウト","name_en":"Engine Blade-Out Containment","definition":"タービンやファンブレードが破断して飛散した場合でも、ケースや機体が破片を封じ込め安全を保つ設計・認証概念。","impact_summary":"高エネルギー回転機械を航空機へ安全に搭載するための基準を作った。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"推進安全設計","era_start":1970,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"ブレードアウト,封じ込め,タービン,安全認証","keywords_en":"blade-out,containment,turbine,safety certification","key_researchers":["FAA engine safety teams","GE Aviation engineers"],"key_works":["Engine Rotor Burst Protection Studies (1970)"]},
  {"name_ja":"航空機衝突安全性","name_en":"Aircraft Crashworthiness","definition":"事故時に構造がエネルギーを吸収し、客室空間と乗員生存性を保つよう設計する航空機安全概念。","impact_summary":"座席、胴体、燃料系、ヘリコプタ構造の安全設計を発展させた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"衝突安全工学","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"衝突安全,エネルギー吸収,乗員保護,耐墜落","keywords_en":"crashworthiness,energy absorption,occupant protection,crash safety","key_researchers":["NASA Langley crash dynamics team"],"key_works":["Crashworthiness of Aircraft Structures Studies (1970)"]},
  {"name_ja":"航空機避難解析","name_en":"Aircraft Evacuation Analysis","definition":"非常時に乗客が限られた出口と時間で脱出できるかを、客室配置、人間行動、煙、照明を含めて評価する安全解析。","impact_summary":"客室設計、非常口配置、認証試験、乗務員手順の基準を支えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"客室安全工学","era_start":1980,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"避難解析,非常口,客室安全,認証","keywords_en":"evacuation analysis,emergency exit,cabin safety,certification","key_researchers":["FAA cabin safety researchers","Cranfield researchers"],"key_works":["Aircraft Evacuation Testing and Modelling Studies (1990)"]},
  {"name_ja":"航空機火災安全材料","name_en":"Aircraft Fire-Safe Materials","definition":"客室内装や構造材料が燃えにくく、煙や毒性ガスを抑え、火災時の生存時間を延ばすよう選定・試験する設計概念。","impact_summary":"事故時の生存率向上と客室材料認証基準の厳格化を促した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"客室安全材料","era_start":1980,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"火災安全,難燃材料,煙毒性,客室","keywords_en":"fire safety,flame-retardant material,smoke toxicity,cabin","key_researchers":["FAA fire safety researchers"],"key_works":["Aircraft Materials Fire Test Handbook (1990)"]},
  {"name_ja":"極超音速材料","name_en":"Hypersonic Materials","definition":"高温酸化、熱衝撃、アブレーション、構造荷重に耐えるセラミック、炭素複合材、超高温材料を用いる極超音速機材料概念。","impact_summary":"極超音速滑空体、再突入機、先進エンジンの実現性を左右する。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"高温材料工学","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"極超音速材料,超高温,炭素複合材,酸化","keywords_en":"hypersonic materials,ultra-high temperature,carbon composite,oxidation","key_researchers":["NASA materials researchers","UHTC researchers"],"key_works":["Ultra-High Temperature Ceramics for Hypersonic Applications (2000)"]},
  {"name_ja":"セラミック基複合材料","name_en":"Ceramic Matrix Composites","definition":"セラミック母材と繊維強化を組み合わせ、高温強度と耐酸化性を持たせた材料で、航空エンジンや熱防護に使われる。","impact_summary":"ガスタービン高温化と軽量化を進め、エンジン効率向上に貢献した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"高温複合材料","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"CMC,セラミック基複合材,高温,タービン","keywords_en":"CMC,ceramic matrix composite,high temperature,turbine","key_researchers":["GE Aviation materials teams","NASA materials researchers"],"key_works":["Ceramic Matrix Composites in Aircraft Engines (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"超高温セラミックス","name_en":"Ultra-High Temperature Ceramics","definition":"ジルコニウムやハフニウムの炭化物・ホウ化物など、2000度を超える環境に耐える材料群で極超音速前縁に用いられる。","impact_summary":"再使用極超音速機の鋭い前縁と高熱流束部位の設計可能性を広げた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"熱防護材料","era_start":2000,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"超高温セラミックス,UHTC,前縁,熱防護","keywords_en":"ultra-high temperature ceramics,UHTC,leading edge,thermal protection","key_researchers":["William Fahrenholtz","Gregory Hilmas"],"key_works":["Ultra-High Temperature Ceramics: Materials for Extreme Environment Applications (2007)"]},
  {"name_ja":"再使用熱防護システム","name_en":"Reusable Thermal Protection System","definition":"再突入時の高熱流束に複数回耐え、点検・整備後に再飛行できるタイル、ブランケット、複合材熱防護概念。","impact_summary":"スペースシャトルから現代再使用宇宙船まで、運用性と安全性を左右した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"再使用宇宙機熱設計","era_start":1981,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"再使用熱防護,TPS,タイル,再突入","keywords_en":"reusable TPS,thermal protection,tile,reentry","key_researchers":["NASA Shuttle TPS team"],"key_works":["Space Shuttle Thermal Protection System Reports (1981)"]},
  {"name_ja":"PICA熱防護材","name_en":"Phenolic Impregnated Carbon Ablator","definition":"炭素繊維プリフォームにフェノール樹脂を含浸した軽量アブレータで、高速再突入やサンプル帰還カプセルの熱防護に使われる。","impact_summary":"高熱流束帰還ミッションで軽量かつ高性能な熱防護を提供した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"アブレータ材料","era_start":1990,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"PICA,アブレータ,炭素,サンプルリターン","keywords_en":"PICA,ablator,carbon,sample return","key_researchers":["NASA Ames researchers"],"key_works":["Development of the Phenolic Impregnated Carbon Ablator (1996)"]},
  {"name_ja":"オリオン型カプセル設計","name_en":"Orion-Type Crew Capsule Design","definition":"鈍頭カプセル、アブレータ熱防護、打上げ脱出、海上回収を組み合わせ、深宇宙からの高速帰還に対応する有人船設計。","impact_summary":"アポロ型の信頼性を現代技術で再構成し、月火星探査の帰還基盤となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"有人深宇宙船設計","era_start":2014,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"Orion,有人カプセル,深宇宙帰還,熱防護","keywords_en":"Orion,crew capsule,deep space return,thermal protection","key_researchers":["NASA Orion team","Lockheed Martin engineers"],"key_works":["Orion Exploration Flight Test-1 Reports (2014)"]},
  {"name_ja":"打上げ脱出システム","name_en":"Launch Abort System","definition":"打上げ中のロケット異常時に乗員カプセルを迅速に切り離し、安全な距離へ退避させるロケット塔または推進脱出装置。","impact_summary":"有人打上げのリスクを下げ、商業乗員輸送でも重要な認証項目となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"有人打上げ安全","era_start":1961,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"打上げ脱出,有人安全,カプセル,ロケット異常","keywords_en":"launch abort,human safety,capsule,launch failure","key_researchers":["Maxime Faget","NASA crew safety teams"],"key_works":["Mercury Launch Escape System Reports (1961)"]},
  {"name_ja":"パッドアボート試験","name_en":"Pad Abort Test","definition":"打上げ台上での異常を模擬し、脱出システムが乗員カプセルを安全に退避・着地させられるか検証する地上近傍試験。","impact_summary":"有人宇宙船の緊急脱出信頼性を実証し、認証上の重要な証拠となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"有人宇宙安全試験","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"パッドアボート,脱出試験,有人宇宙船,安全","keywords_en":"pad abort,abort test,crew spacecraft,safety","key_researchers":["NASA Orion team","SpaceX Crew Dragon team"],"key_works":["Crew Dragon Pad Abort Test Report (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"飛行中脱出試験","name_en":"In-Flight Abort Test","definition":"実際の上昇飛行中にロケット異常を模擬し、カプセル脱出、姿勢安定、パラシュート展開、回収を検証する試験。","impact_summary":"有人打上げ時の最も厳しい脱出ケースを実証し、乗員輸送認証を支えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"有人宇宙安全試験","era_start":2019,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"飛行中脱出,アボート,有人安全,パラシュート","keywords_en":"in-flight abort,abort,crew safety,parachute","key_researchers":["SpaceX Crew Dragon team","NASA Commercial Crew Program"],"key_works":["Crew Dragon In-Flight Abort Test Report (2020)"]},
  {"name_ja":"再使用ロケット着陸脚","name_en":"Reusable Rocket Landing Gear","definition":"回収ロケットが着陸時の荷重を吸収し、転倒を防ぐために展開する軽量構造脚と減衰機構の設計概念。","impact_summary":"垂直着陸の実用性と整備性を左右し、再使用運用の信頼性を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"再使用機構設計","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"着陸脚,再使用ロケット,衝撃吸収,垂直着陸","keywords_en":"landing gear,reusable rocket,shock absorption,vertical landing","key_researchers":["SpaceX Falcon 9 team"],"key_works":["Falcon 9 Landing System Reports (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"グリッドフィン制御","name_en":"Grid Fin Control","definition":"格子状の空力舵を用いて超音速から亜音速まで広い範囲で姿勢と軌道を制御する技術で、再使用ロケット帰還に使われる。","impact_summary":"第一段ブースタの大気圏帰還誘導を高精度化した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"再突入誘導空力","era_start":1970,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"グリッドフィン,再使用ロケット,姿勢制御,帰還誘導","keywords_en":"grid fin,reusable rocket,attitude control,return guidance","key_researchers":["Soviet missile engineers","SpaceX engineers"],"key_works":["Grid Fin Aerodynamics Studies (1970)"]},
  {"name_ja":"エンジン再着火","name_en":"Rocket Engine Relight","definition":"飛行中または軌道上でロケットエンジンを複数回確実に始動する能力で、段帰還、軌道投入、深宇宙軌道修正に不可欠。","impact_summary":"再使用ロケット、上段運用、惑星探査の柔軟性と信頼性を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"ロケット運用推進","era_start":1960,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"再着火,上段,軌道修正,再使用","keywords_en":"relight,upper stage,trajectory correction,reuse","key_researchers":["Pratt & Whitney RL10 team","SpaceX Merlin team"],"key_works":["RL10 Restart Capability Reports (1963)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ディープスロットリング","name_en":"Deep Throttling","definition":"ロケットエンジン推力を広い範囲で安定に絞り、着陸、ランデブー、軌道制御で精密な加速度制御を実現する能力。","impact_summary":"月着陸、火星着陸、再使用ブースタ着陸の制御余裕を確保した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"推進制御","era_start":1969,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"深絞り,推力制御,着陸,ロケットエンジン","keywords_en":"deep throttling,thrust control,landing,rocket engine","key_researchers":["TRW Lunar Module engine team","SpaceX engineers"],"key_works":["Lunar Module Descent Engine Reports (1969)"]},
  {"name_ja":"着陸誘導最適制御","name_en":"Powered Descent Guidance","definition":"限られた推進剤と推力制約の下で、着陸地点、速度、姿勢を満たす軌道をリアルタイムに生成する最適誘導技術。","impact_summary":"月火星着陸と再使用ロケット回収の精密化に直接貢献した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"最適誘導制御","era_start":1969,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"着陸誘導,最適制御,推進降下,精密着陸","keywords_en":"powered descent guidance,optimal control,propulsive descent,precision landing","key_researchers":["Apollo guidance team","Lars Blackmore"],"key_works":["Lossless Convexification of Nonconvex Control Bound and Pointing Constraints (2010)"]},
  {"name_ja":"凸最適化誘導","name_en":"Convex Optimization Guidance","definition":"非線形で制約の多い着陸・ランデブー問題を凸最適化へ変換し、リアルタイムに大域的に信頼できる解を得る誘導手法。","impact_summary":"自律着陸と再使用ロケット誘導に高速で検証しやすい最適化を導入した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"リアルタイム最適制御","era_start":2010,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"凸最適化,誘導,リアルタイム,着陸","keywords_en":"convex optimization,guidance,real time,landing","key_researchers":["Lars Blackmore","Behcet Acikmese"],"key_works":["Lossless Convexification of Nonconvex Control Bound and Pointing Constraints (2010)"]},
  {"name_ja":"自律ランデブー","name_en":"Autonomous Rendezvous","definition":"宇宙機が相対航法センサと制御アルゴリズムで目標を認識し、人手を最小にして接近、停止、ドッキングを行う技術。","impact_summary":"補給船、衛星整備、デブリ除去、大規模衛星運用の自動化を進めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"自律近傍運用","era_start":2008,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"自律ランデブー,相対航法,ドッキング,近傍運用","keywords_en":"autonomous rendezvous,relative navigation,docking,proximity operations","key_researchers":["ESA ATV team","JAXA HTV team"],"key_works":["Automated Transfer Vehicle Jules Verne Mission Reports (2008)"]},
  {"name_ja":"ビジョンベース相対航法","name_en":"Vision-Based Relative Navigation","definition":"カメラ、ライダー、画像処理を用いて目標宇宙機や地形との相対位置姿勢を推定し、接近・着陸・捕獲に使う航法技術。","impact_summary":"非協力目標の点検、デブリ捕獲、惑星着陸の自律性を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"画像航法","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"画像航法,相対航法,ライダー,非協力目標","keywords_en":"vision navigation,relative navigation,lidar,non-cooperative target","key_researchers":["NASA Raven team","ESA GNC researchers"],"key_works":["Raven Vision Navigation Sensor Demonstration (2017)"]},
  {"name_ja":"非協力目標捕獲","name_en":"Non-Cooperative Target Capture","definition":"姿勢制御やドッキング標識を持たない衛星やデブリに接近し、形状認識、相対制御、ロボット機構で捕獲する技術。","impact_summary":"故障衛星整備とデブリ除去の実現に向けた核心技術になった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙ロボット近傍運用","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"非協力目標,捕獲,デブリ除去,宇宙ロボット","keywords_en":"non-cooperative target,capture,debris removal,space robot","key_researchers":["ESA e.Deorbit team","JAXA researchers"],"key_works":["RemoveDEBRIS Mission Results (2019)"]},
  {"name_ja":"衛星寿命延長機","name_en":"Mission Extension Vehicle","definition":"燃料を使い切った衛星にドッキングし、代わりに姿勢・軌道制御を提供して商業衛星の運用寿命を延ばすサービス宇宙機。","impact_summary":"軌道上サービスを商業的に実証し、衛星運用の資産価値を高めた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"商業軌道上サービス","era_start":2020,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"寿命延長機,軌道上サービス,ドッキング,商業衛星","keywords_en":"mission extension vehicle,on-orbit servicing,docking,commercial satellite","key_researchers":["Northrop Grumman MEV team"],"key_works":["MEV-1 Intelsat 901 Servicing Mission (2020)"]},
  {"name_ja":"衛星リサイクル","name_en":"Satellite Recycling","definition":"使用済み衛星の部品、アンテナ、構造、材料を軌道上で再利用し、新しい宇宙システムへ組み込む構想。","impact_summary":"宇宙廃棄物を資源へ転換し、打上げ質量とデブリ増加を抑える可能性を示した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"循環型宇宙システム","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"衛星リサイクル,軌道上再利用,デブリ,宇宙資源","keywords_en":"satellite recycling,on-orbit reuse,debris,space resources","key_researchers":["DARPA Phoenix team"],"key_works":["DARPA Phoenix Program Reports (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙3Dプリント構造物","name_en":"3D-Printed Space Structures","definition":"軌道上や月面で材料を積層して梁、パネル、アンテナ、居住構造を製造し、打上げ時の容積制約を超える概念。","impact_summary":"大型構造の現地製造と修理を可能にし、宇宙インフラ構築の前提を変えた。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙積層製造","era_start":2016,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"宇宙3Dプリント,軌道上製造,大型構造,現地製造","keywords_en":"space 3D printing,in-space manufacturing,large structure,in-situ fabrication","key_researchers":["Made In Space Archinaut team","NASA OSAM researchers"],"key_works":["Archinaut In-Space Manufacturing Studies (2016)"]},
  {"name_ja":"軌道上組立","name_en":"On-Orbit Assembly","definition":"大型アンテナ、望遠鏡、太陽電池、居住施設を打上げ後に宇宙空間で組み立て、フェアリング制約を超える技術概念。","impact_summary":"将来の巨大宇宙望遠鏡、太陽発電、深宇宙船建造の基盤となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙建設工学","era_start":1984,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"軌道上組立,大型構造,宇宙建設,ロボット","keywords_en":"on-orbit assembly,large structure,space construction,robotics","key_researchers":["NASA ISS assembly teams","DARPA NOM4D team"],"key_works":["International Space Station Assembly Reports (1998)"]},
  {"name_ja":"宇宙船モジュール化","name_en":"Modular Spacecraft Architecture","definition":"電力、通信、推進、ペイロードなどを標準化されたモジュールとして設計し、交換、拡張、再構成を容易にする宇宙機概念。","impact_summary":"開発速度、整備性、軌道上サービスとの相性を高める設計思想となった。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"再構成可能宇宙機設計","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"モジュール化,宇宙機,再構成,標準インターフェース","keywords_en":"modularity,spacecraft,reconfiguration,standard interface","key_researchers":["DARPA Phoenix team","NASA OSAM team"],"key_works":["Modular Open Systems Architecture for Space Systems (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"オープンアーキテクチャ衛星","name_en":"Open Architecture Satellite","definition":"標準インターフェース、公開仕様、交換可能モジュールを用い、異なる企業や機関の部品を統合しやすくする衛星設計概念。","impact_summary":"サプライチェーン多様化と迅速な衛星開発を支える方法論として注目された。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"オープン宇宙システム","era_start":2018,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"オープンアーキテクチャ,標準化,衛星,モジュール","keywords_en":"open architecture,standardization,satellite,module","key_researchers":["Space Development Agency engineers","MOSSAIC teams"],"key_works":["Modular Open Systems Approach for Space (2018)"]},
  {"name_ja":"プロリフェレーテッドLEO","name_en":"Proliferated Low Earth Orbit","definition":"多数の比較的小型で安価な低軌道衛星を分散配置し、単一大型衛星に比べて冗長性、再訪性、耐攻撃性を高める概念。","impact_summary":"防衛通信、ミサイル警戒、地球観測で宇宙システム設計を分散化した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"分散宇宙アーキテクチャ","era_start":2019,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"プロリフェレーテッドLEO,分散衛星,冗長性,低軌道","keywords_en":"proliferated LEO,distributed satellites,resilience,low Earth orbit","key_researchers":["Space Development Agency teams"],"key_works":["SDA National Defense Space Architecture Plans (2019)"]},
  {"name_ja":"衛星レジリエンス","name_en":"Satellite Resilience","definition":"故障、攻撃、宇宙天気、デブリ、サイバー脅威に対して、衛星システムが機能を維持または迅速回復する能力。","impact_summary":"重要インフラ化した宇宙システムで冗長性、分散化、再構成の設計を促した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"宇宙システム信頼性","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"衛星レジリエンス,冗長性,分散化,宇宙安全保障","keywords_en":"satellite resilience,redundancy,distribution,space security","key_researchers":["US Space Force researchers","Secure World Foundation analysts"],"key_works":["Resilience and Disaggregated Space Architectures Studies (2015)"]},
  {"name_ja":"分散型宇宙アーキテクチャ","name_en":"Distributed Space Architecture","definition":"機能を複数衛星や地上システムへ分散し、単一故障点を減らしながら柔軟なサービス提供を行う宇宙システム設計概念。","impact_summary":"小型衛星群、メガコンステレーション、宇宙安全保障の設計思想を形成した。","subfield":"航空宇宙工学","school_of_thought":"分散システム工学","era_start":2015,"era_end":null,"keywords_ja":"分散型宇宙,小型衛星群,冗長性,柔軟性","keywords_en":"distributed space,smallsat constellation,resilience,flexibility","key_researchers":["Karen Willcox","SDA engineers"],"key_works":["Tradespace Exploration for Space System Architectures (2015)"]},
